    {"axis", nullptr, 15, "You attacked us. We'll talk - after we sell your enemies a few new dreadnoughts."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 16, "You're winning, {them}! And everyone who wants to stop you is shopping with us."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 16, "Top of the galaxy! Big target. Want to buy some armour?"},
    {"axis", nullptr, 17, "{them}! Our best customer. Come in, come in!"},
    {"axis", nullptr, 17, "For you, friend, the VIP lounge is open. What'll it be?"},
    {"axis", nullptr, 18, "Browsing, {them}? Fine. We'll keep an eye on the merchandise."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 18, "Speak. We're still checking your credit history."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 19, "You're on our \"do not serve\" list, {them}. Make it quick."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 19, "We'll sell to you, {them}. At a markup. A big one. Talk."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 20, "Live demonstration time, {them}! Watch closely - everything you see is available for purchase afterward."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 20, "Special offer, {them}: one free demonstration of our newest broadside. Results guaranteed."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 20, "Watch closely, {them} - this is what next season's warships do. Sadly, you won't see next season."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 21, "Shooting at the Shipwrights, {them}? We build the best guns in the galaxy, and we kept the good ones."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 21, "Hostile customer, {them}? No problem. Every ship we sell comes with a very good warranty."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 21, "Oh, {them}, you've fired on our showroom. That voids your warranty. And your fleet."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 22, "Product testing on your world, {them}! Our new ground units need field reviews."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 22, "Field trials on your world, {them}! Our new drop troops come with a satisfaction guarantee."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 22, "Landing a sales team on your world, {them}. Heavily armed. It's a hard sell."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 23, "You want this shipyard, {them}? Every turret here is a display model, and they all work."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 23, "Every gun on this world is premium stock, {them}. Try one. They're on the house."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 23, "Testing our defences, {them}? Excellent. Customers always buy after a demonstration."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 24, "A returning customer, {them}! Did you like the last demonstration? We've upgraded since."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex, {them} - the best advertising spot in the galaxy. Nothing sells guns like winning here."},
    {"axis", nullptr, 26, "You're attacking the factory floor, {them}? Bad idea. This is where we keep the prototypes."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 0, "Listen up, {them}. We've buried better allies than you and outlived worse enemies. Take the deal while it's on the table."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 0, "Straight talk from people who already lost everything once - this trade is good. Sign it."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 0, "No speeches. We need it, you need this. Done before the next war starts."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 1, "You've held the line beside us. That means something to soldiers. Take this - you earned it."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 2, "Take the deal or take a beating. We survived the end of a world - your fleet doesn't even make us blink."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 3, "Politics. Hate it. But votes win wars too - put yours with ours and nobody gets left behind."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 4, "Good. Deal. Back to the front."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 4, "Done. Don't make us regret it."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 5, "Ha! No. Try again when you mean it."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 5, "Not a chance. We didn't survive this long by taking bad deals."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 6, "Weak offer. Here's a real one - take it or leave it, soldier."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 7, "Nothing personal, {them}. Survivors survive. Today, that means going through you."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 8, "You turned on us, {them}? Big mistake. We lost a whole world once - losing a friend won't slow us down."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 9, "Fine, take it. We've been robbed by the end of a world, {them} - you're just the next name on the list."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 9, "Take it and run. Last people who pushed us around? Ask them how that went. Oh, wait."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 10, "Ha! A call from {them}. We've survived worse things than a conversation. Go on."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 10, "You've reached the Bastion. What's left of it, anyway. Talk."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 11, "You're right on our doorstep, {them}. We've had worse neighbours. Most of them are dead."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour! Good. Easier to borrow sugar - or to hit back."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 12, "You again! Last deal didn't kill us, {them}. That's a five-star review from the Bastion."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 12, "We traded before and we're both still breathing. Let's push our luck."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Round here that's rarer than a quiet day."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept. You'd have made a decent soldier. Talk."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Bastion, {them}. We've buried people for less. Lucky you."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 14, "Last promise from you was a dud grenade. Show us a live one this time."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 15, "You shot at us, {them}! Good. Now we know you've got teeth. Talk."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 15, "You hit the Bastion. We've been hit by planets. We'll survive you. Speak."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 16, "You're winning, {them}? Great. Everyone's going to come for you. We've been there."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 16, "Top of the heap! Enjoy it. The heap always collapses. Ask us how we know."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 17, "{them}! One of the good ones. Pull up a crate, mate."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 17, "You're all right, {them}. The Bastion likes you. Don't make it weird."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 18, "We're listening, {them}. Finger on the trigger, but listening."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 18, "Not sure about you yet. Talk fast and convince us."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 19, "You're on our list, {them}. Short list. Talk."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 19, "Give us a reason not to shoot, {them}. You've got one sentence."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 20, "Here we go again, {them}! Another war - you'd think we'd be tired by now. We're not."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 20, "Alright, {them}, let's get this over with. We've got a war schedule to keep."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 20, "Another fleet, another fight. Nothing personal, {them} - you're just next on the list."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 21, "Oh, {them} wants a fight? Get in line. Our scars have scars."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 21, "You picked the wrong veterans to ambush, {them}. We've survived worse than you on a quiet day."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 21, "Incoming! Fine - {them} wants to learn the hard way. Everyone, battle stations!"},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 22, "Boots down, {them}! We've buried a whole world already. Yours won't even make us sweat."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 22, "Landing party, move out! {them}, we've taken tougher worlds than yours with half the troops."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 22, "We know how to take a world, {them}. We also know how to lose one. We're not doing that today."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 23, "We lost one home, {them}. We are not losing another. Come and try."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 23, "Fortify! {them} is coming. Nobody takes a Bastion trench while one of us is breathing."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 23, "You want this world, {them}? We built these walls with our own hands. We'll defend them the same way."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 24, "Oh, it's {them} again. We've still got the scars from last time. So should you."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 25, "Everyone's fought over Mecatol Rex, {them}. We're just the ones who'll still be standing."},
    {"bastion", nullptr, 26, "You've hit our home, {them}. Everybody here has already lost one. Think about how hard we'll fight for this one."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 0, "The Allied States extend terms, {them}. Accept them while they are still terms."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 0, "A practical arrangement, {them}. Our guns stay pointed elsewhere, and your stores grow."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 0, "Consider it an alliance of convenience, {them}. The Belkosea reward convenience."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 1, "You have earned the Allied States' favour, {them}. Take this - with our compliments."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 2, "Withdraw, {them}. Our superweapons have already been aimed. Do not make us confirm the coordinates."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 3, "The Council will see reason, {them}. Lend us your votes and stand on the side of strength."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. Command approves."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 4, "Accepted, {them}. The Allied States honour their contracts."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 5, "Denied. That offer insults the Allied States."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 5, "No. Our engineers have better uses for those resources."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 6, "Not as written. Here are our terms - they are generous, by our standards."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 7, "The arrangement is concluded, {them}. Classified Developments required a new target."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 8, "You turned on the Allied States, {them}. Every superweapon we own now knows your name."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 9, "Take it, {them}. A tactical withdrawal. We will return with heavier guns."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 9, "We concede the point, {them}. Concession is not defeat."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 10, "Belkosea Command, {them}. State your business - briefly."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 10, "You have the Allied States' attention, {them}. Use it well."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 11, "Our borders touch, {them}. Keep them quiet, and our guns stay cold."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 11, "So close, {them}. Within range of everything we have built."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 12, "Our last arrangement held, {them}. The Allied States remember reliable partners."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 12, "You have been useful, {them}. Another contract?"},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 13, "Your word held, {them}. The Allied States take note."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 13, "Promise delivered, {them}. Command is satisfied."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. It has been filed - with the targeting data."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 14, "An unreliable asset, {them}. We will plan accordingly."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 15, "Your fleet fired on the Allied States, {them}. Our wing commanders took it personally."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 15, "You tested our guns, {them}. They passed."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. Leaders make the clearest targets."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 16, "Enjoy the summit, {them}. Our superweapons have excellent range."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 17, "{them}. The Allied States welcome a trusted ally."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 17, "A friend of the Belkosea, {them}. Speak freely."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 18, "Speak, {them}. The Allied States are listening - and assessing."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 18, "Your record is incomplete, {them}. Choose your words with care."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 19, "You are on the target list, {them}. Make this quick."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 19, "Command has no patience for you, {them}. Talk."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 20, "Wyverns, launch. The Allied States are coming for you, {them}."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 20, "Weapons free. Spike leads the first wave, {them} - pray he is merciful."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 21, "You strike at the Allied States, {them}? Every gun on the planet is turning toward you."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 21, "Shields up, batteries hot. You picked the wrong system, {them}."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 22, "Ground teams down, Wyverns in support. This world belongs to the Allied States, {them}."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 22, "The Wardogs are loose, {them}. Surrender the planet or lose it."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 23, "The Allied States do not give ground, {them}. Not here."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 23, "This world is fortified, {them}. Our superweapon stands here - and it stays."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 24, "You again, {them}. We kept your coordinates."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex needs discipline, {them}. The Allied States will provide it."},
    {"belkosea", nullptr, 26, "You have reached Iterum, {them}. Conviction has been expecting you."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 0, "The Conglomerate has a venture in mind, {them}. Low risk, fair shares, and who knows what we'll dig up together."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 0, "Our surveyors ran the numbers on this one. It pays out for both of us - the Bentor never stake a bad claim."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 0, "Consider this an investment. The galaxy is full of buried fortune, and partners find it faster."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 1, "For a trusted partner, preferred shares. You've never let a venture of ours go bust."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 2, "This is a buyout offer, not a request. Take it, or the Conglomerate digs through what's yours anyway."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 3, "The Council's ruling could move the markets. Vote with the Conglomerate and share in the dividend."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 4, "Splendid, a sound investment! Mark it in the ledger and on the map."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 4, "Deal struck. The Board will be delighted - and so, we expect, will you."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 5, "Our analysts say no. There's no treasure in that offer, only a hole."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 5, "Pass. We know a dry dig when we see one."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 6, "Promising, but the margins are thin. Our prospectors drew up better terms - have a look."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 7, "The Board has voted to liquidate our arrangement, {them}. Your share has been... reallocated."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 8, "A breach of partnership, {them}? The Conglomerate writes off bad debts - but never forgets the debtor."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 9, "Take it. Book it as a hostile acquisition, {them} - and expect our counter-offer to be very hostile too."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 9, "Fine. The Conglomerate takes the loss this quarter. We always recover our losses, with interest."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 10, "Bentor Conglomerate, ventures department. What's the pitch, {them}?"},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 10, "A new contact! Every call could be the next big find. Go ahead, {them}."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 11, "Your space borders our claims, {them}. Neighbours make the best joint ventures."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 11, "Next door to our dig sites! Let's keep the borders friendly and the profits flowing."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 12, "Our last venture with you paid out, {them}. Shareholders are delighted. Again?"},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 12, "Repeat partner! Your shares in our goodwill are up. Let's talk."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Solid investment. We like solid investments."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept. Your stock just went up with the board."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 14, "You broke a promise to the Conglomerate, {them}. That was a bad quarter for trust."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 14, "Your last deal defaulted, {them}. The board wants guarantees this time."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 15, "You hit our prospecting fleet, {them}. That's a write-off we haven't forgotten."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 15, "You attacked our claims. We'll talk business - with a risk premium."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 16, "You're ahead, {them}! The market's betting against you. We're watching the odds."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 16, "Market leader! Impressive. Expect hostile bids from everyone."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 17, "{them}! Our favourite partner. What venture shall we start?"},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 17, "Always a pleasure, friend. The board loves you."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 18, "Let's hear it, {them}. We're doing due diligence on you."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 18, "The board's undecided about you. Make a good pitch."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 19, "You're a bad investment, {them}. Talk fast."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 19, "The board says no, {them}. Convince them."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 20, "The Conglomerate is liquidating your fleet, {them}. Consider it a forced asset sale."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 20, "New venture, {them}: salvaging your fleet. Our shareholders are very excited."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 20, "Your ships are sitting on a fortune in scrap, {them}. The Conglomerate is cashing in."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 21, "Attacking our investment, {them}? Our shareholders hate that. Our gunners love it."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 21, "A hostile bid, {them}? Bold. The Conglomerate answers hostile bids with artillery."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 21, "You fired on a company vessel, {them}. Expect a lawsuit. And a broadside."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 22, "Survey teams are landing, {them}. Whatever's buried on your world, the Conglomerate is claiming it."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 22, "Prospectors landing on your world, {them}! Dig crews first, soldiers right behind."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 22, "Your world has been valued and acquired, {them}. Our crews are here to collect."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 23, "This claim is staked, {them}. Jump it, and we bury you with the rest of the treasure."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 23, "Every relic on this world is company property, {them}. So is every bullet."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 23, "Claim jumpers, {them}? The Conglomerate has a standard procedure for those. It is loud."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 24, "You again, {them}? Our accountants still have your last attack on the books. Time to settle."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex, {them} - the oldest treasure vault in the galaxy. The Conglomerate is opening it."},
    {"bentor", nullptr, 26, "Attacking company headquarters, {them}? Every share we own just turned into a gun."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 0, "Come closer, {them}. Such a generous offer, from such patient friends... what could possibly go wrong?"},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 0, "So much to share, and all of it for you. Take it. Fatten your worlds a little... for later."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 0, "A small taste, freely given. Everyone enjoys a taste. Everyone comes back for more."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 1, "You have been so good to us. We will save you for last - truly, the highest honor we can give."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 2, "Accept, and remain our guest. Refuse, and become our supper. The choice is yours... for now."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 3, "Votes, votes... such dry little things. Give us yours, and we will keep your worlds plump and safe."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 4, "Mmm. Delicious. We accept."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 4, "Yes... this will be savored, slowly."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 5, "No. Far too thin to bother with."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 5, "We have tasted better. Refused."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 6, "Not quite to our taste. Season it like this... and perhaps we will take a bite."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 7, "Oh, {them}... did you really think you were a guest? You were always the main course."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 8, "Betrayal, {them}? How wonderful. Betrayers always taste the sweetest."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 9, "Take it, then. We are patient diners, {them}. A meal that threatens us only tastes sweeter later."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 9, "Mm. Yours, for now. Everything we give away comes back to us eventually... usually with company."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 10, "Mmm, {them}. What a lovely voice. Come closer, we only want to talk."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 10, "A new guest at our table, {them}. Do sit. We will try to be polite."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 11, "You live so close to us, {them}. We can almost taste your worlds from here."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. How cosy. We do love the people next door. Mmm."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 12, "You have fed us bargains before, {them}. We are still... peckish."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 12, "Back again? We remember the last deal fondly. It was delicious."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word to us, {them}. How sweet. Sweet things are the best to save for later."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept. We will remember that when we decide who to eat last."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to us, {them}. Liars taste bitter. We eat them anyway."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise, {them}. We forgive. We also digest. Slowly."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 15, "You attacked us, {them}. How spirited. We do so love food that fights back."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 15, "You hurt us. We have saved a special place for you. Deep inside."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 16, "You have grown so large, {them}. So filling. We have been watching you ripen."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 16, "The galaxy's finest feast is you, {them}. Shall we talk before dinner?"},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 17, "Dear {them}. You are our favourite. We would never eat you. Probably."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 17, "For you, we will hide our teeth. Come, speak."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 18, "We are watching you, {them}. Deciding if you are friend or flavour."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 18, "Speak, little one. We have not chosen what you are to us."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 19, "You are prey to us now, {them}. Say your piece while you have a mouth."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 19, "We are hungry for you, {them}. Speak quickly."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 20, "Ahh, {them}... you smell of fear and fuel. Come closer. We are so very hungry."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 20, "Such a lovely fleet, {them}... so warm, so full. We will savour every hull."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 20, "Come here, {them}. Closer. We only want a little taste... and then the rest."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 21, "You came to us, {them}? How thoughtful. We had hoped you would bring your whole fleet."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 21, "You fire upon us, {them}? Delicious. Fear makes the meat so much sweeter."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 21, "Struggle, {them}. Please. We do so enjoy it when our food struggles."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 22, "We are coming down to dine, {them}. Your world will make such a lovely feast."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 22, "We descend to your table, {them}. Your world has been set so beautifully for us."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 22, "Down we go, {them}, into your little nest. We hope your people are well fed."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 23, "Stay a while, {them}. This world has a way of keeping its guests... forever."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 23, "Welcome, {them}. Come in, come in. Nobody who comes in ever wants to leave... or can."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 23, "Every step you take here leads deeper, {them}. Deeper into us."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 24, "Back again, {them}? How sweet. We still remember the taste of the last time."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 25, "The throne world, {them}... the richest meal in the galaxy. We will devour it slowly."},
    {"cabal", nullptr, 26, "All the way into our home, {them}? How thoughtful. We were getting so very hungry."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 0, "The Confederation extends a proposal, {them}. Fair terms, honestly kept - and we expect the same of you."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 0, "Commerce is best conducted in calm skies. Our offer is attached; our guns, of course, stay in port."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 0, "We prefer trade to trouble. Review these terms at your leisure - our docks are open, and well guarded."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 1, "For a preferred client, our best rates and our warmest regards. The Confederation values your custom."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 2, "We would rather not discuss this down the barrel of a gun. Accept, and the barrels stay cold."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 3, "Stable laws mean stable markets. Support our position in the Council and our ports will remember it."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. The Confederation will record the contract and honour it to the letter."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 4, "A sound arrangement. Do pass through our ports any time - peacefully, of course."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 5, "We must respectfully decline. The risk outweighs the return, and we do not gamble."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 5, "Regrettably, no. Please don't take it personally - and please don't take it further."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 6, "Not quite workable as written. Our clerks have amended the terms - we think you'll find them fair."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 7, "Our accountants have reassessed you, {them}. You are no longer a client - you are a liability."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 8, "A broken contract, {them}. Our ports are closed to you, and our guns are no longer staying in port."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 9, "Very well. The account is settled, {them}, but your client status is revoked. Our docks remember."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 9, "Take it. We had hoped to keep this businesslike. The armed side of our business has taken note."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 10, "Welcome to the Celdauri trade port, {them}. Our docks are open. Our guns are polite."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 10, "Good day, {them}. The Trade Port is ready to do business. Respectfully."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 11, "You're right on our shipping lanes, {them}. Good neighbours pay low docking fees."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. Our docks see your ships every day. We'd like that to stay peaceful."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 12, "Our ledgers show good business with you, {them}. Preferred client rates apply."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 12, "Back again! Our last transaction was very satisfactory. Let's continue."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 13, "You kept your agreement, {them}. That's noted in your client file. Favourably."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 13, "Reliable clients are the backbone of the port. Thank you, {them}."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 14, "You broke an agreement with the Celdauri, {them}. Your docking rights are under review."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 14, "A breach of contract, {them}. We're still talking - our dock guns are also listening."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 15, "You attacked our ships, {them}. Our defences remember. Let's keep this civil."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 15, "You fired on the Celdauri. Unwise. Business will be... formal for a while."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 16, "You're leading, {them}. Many will want to stop you. The port stays neutral. For a price."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 16, "You're ahead. Good for trade, bad for peace. Proceed carefully."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 17, "A preferred client! Welcome, {them}. How can the port help?"},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 17, "Always good to see you, friend. Best rates for you."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 18, "Proceed, {them}. Business only. The docks are watching."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 18, "We're cautious with you. You understand. Speak."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 19, "You're not welcome at our docks, {them}. Say your piece."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 19, "Our guns are ready, {them}. So is our patience. Barely."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 20, "We regret to inform you, {them}, that your account is closed. The docks' guns will see you out."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 20, "Our apologies, {them}, but your fleet is obstructing a trade lane. The docks have authorized removal."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 20, "This is a final notice, {them}. Kindly leave, or be escorted out by our gunships."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 21, "Hostilities from {them} detected. Our port defences are now open for business."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 21, "An attack on a trade port, {them}? How unprofessional. Our defences will now be... professional."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 21, "We did warn you about the guns, {them}. Several times, in writing."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 22, "Port security is landing on your world, {them}. Please keep your hands where we can see them."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 22, "Customs inspection, {them}. Our officers are landing on your world. Please declare your weapons."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 22, "Your world is now under port authority, {them}. Do cooperate; it is much cheaper for everyone."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 23, "Our docks are heavily armed, {them}, as we did mention. Do turn back while you still can."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 23, "This port is closed to hostile traffic, {them}. The guns are very much open."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 23, "We value every client, {them}. Even the ones we have to shoot."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 24, "Your account is still flagged from our last dispute, {them}. We will settle it now."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex is the galaxy's most valuable port, {them}. The Confederation must protect its interests."},
    {"celdauri", nullptr, 26, "You fire upon our home docks, {them}? Then every contract we hold with you is void. So are you."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 0, "Klk-klk. The Horde offers this to {them}. Take it, and stay off our shell."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 0, "We are many and our shells are thick. Still, the Horde would rather trade than crack you open."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 0, "Simple deal. Simple terms. The tide comes in, the tide goes out, and the Horde keeps what it holds."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 1, "You do not poke at our shell, so the Horde is good to you. Take this, broodfriend."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 2, "Leave the Horde's waters, or we come. We are slow, but we never stop, and our claws never tire."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 3, "The Council chatters like small fish. Give the Horde your votes and we will chatter back for you."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 4, "Good. The Horde agrees. We bury this deal deep in the sand where it stays safe."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 4, "Klk... yes. Done. Now go, before the brood gets curious."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 5, "No. The Horde does not want this. Our claws stay closed."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 5, "Too thin, like a fresh moult. We refuse."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 6, "Not like this. The Horde snaps your offer in half and sends back the better half."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 7, "The shell turns, {them}. The Horde needs your waters now. Do not take it hard - we never do."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 8, "{them} cracked our trust like a shell. But we grow new shells, and we remember. Klk."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 9, "Take it. klk. The Horde is slow, {them}, but the Horde does not forget a poke."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 9, "Fine. Shell cracks a little today. It grows back thicker. klk klk. We come later."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 10, "Klk. The Horde hears you, {them}. Speak slow. We are not in a hurry."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 10, "A small voice calling the Horde. Klk-klk. Go on, {them}."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds touch our waters, {them}. Do not poke our shell, and we will not snap."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. Klk. The Horde lives next to you now. Be quiet, be friendly."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 12, "You traded with the Horde before, {them}. It was fair. Klk. Again."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 12, "Another deal? The Horde remembers good deals. Speak."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Strong, like a good shell. Klk."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept. The Horde trusts you a little more."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Horde, {them}. Cracked shells do not heal. Klk."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise. The Horde remembers. Slowly. Forever."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 15, "You poked the Horde, {them}. Klk-klk. We are slow to anger. We are angry."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 15, "You attacked our broods. The Horde does not forgive soft things."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 16, "You grow big, {them}. Big things draw many claws. Klk."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy. The Horde does not care. Unless you come near."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 17, "Broodfriend {them}! Klk-klk. Come, speak."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 17, "The Horde is glad to hear you, friend."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 18, "The Horde watches you, {them}. Claws closed. For now."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 18, "Speak. We are deciding. Slowly. Klk."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 19, "The Horde does not like you, {them}. Klk. Speak quick."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 19, "Our claws are open, {them}. Talk."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 20, "klk... The Horde comes, {them}. Slow. Heavy. Unstoppable. klk."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 20, "klk-klk. Your ships are soft, {them}. The Horde likes soft things."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 20, "Poke the Horde, {them}, and the Horde pinches back."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 21, "You strike the shell, {them}? The shell does not crack. The claws, however, close."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 21, "Many shots, {them}. Few cracks. The claws are already coming."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 21, "You wake the brood, {them}. klk. The brood is very hungry when it wakes."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 22, "The brood descends upon your world, {them}. klk-klk... there are always more of us."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 22, "Claws on the shore, {them}. The Horde walks out of the sea and onto your world."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 22, "More of us than your soldiers, {them}. Always more. klk."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 23, "These are the Horde's waters, {them}. You will drown in claws before you take them."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 23, "Thick shells, deep burrows, {them}. You cannot dig the Horde out."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 23, "Step into the tide pools, {them}. Something will grab your leg. That is us."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 24, "klk. We know your ships, {them}. We remember how they sounded when they cracked."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 25, "Big world, {them}. Good shore. The Horde wants it. klk."},
    {"cheiran", nullptr, 26, "The nests, {them}! You come near the nests! The whole Horde rises from the deep!"},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 0, "...an offer, {them}. Take it. You have so much already... what is a little less?"},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 0, "Quietly now... terms. Not that you deserve them."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 0, "Why we want this... you would not understand. Do not ask. Just agree."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 1, "...you, at least, do not flaunt what you have. Take this. Do not make us regret it."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 2, "Agree. Or we slip through the cracks and take what you love most... we know exactly where it is."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 3, "The Council listens to those with full hands. Not to us. Lend us your votes... it is the least you owe."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 4, "...acceptable. Barely."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 4, "Yes... fine. Do not gloat."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 5, "No... you think we are fools?"},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 5, "Keep your scraps. We will take what we want another way."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 6, "...not that. This. You can spare it... you can always spare it."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 7, "Everything, {them}... you had everything. Now you will know what it is to have nothing."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 8, "...of course, {them}. Your kind always betray us. We will not forget... we never forget."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 9, "Take it... We will simply take it back... along with something you love more, {them}."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 9, "Yours, then... enjoy it. We know every crack in your walls now."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 10, "...{them}... calling us... what do you have that we don't...?"},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 10, "...speak, {them}... we are listening... and looking at what you carry..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 11, "...your worlds are so close, {them}... so close we could reach out and take them..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 11, "...neighbours... we watch your bright worlds from our dim ones... envious..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 12, "...again, {them}... the last deal gave us a little of what you have... we want more..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 12, "...you traded with us before... you still have too much... speak..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 13, "...you kept your word... how noble... how easy, when you have everything..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 13, "...a promise kept, {them}... we will remember... we remember everything you have..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 14, "...you broke your word, {them}... of course you did... the rich always do..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 14, "...a liar with full holds... speak, {them}... we are not surprised..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 15, "...you fought us, {them}... we lost... we always lose to you... for now..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 15, "...your ships came for us... we hate you a little more... speak..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 16, "...you have so much, {them}... too much... it should be ours..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 16, "...the galaxy is yours, it seems... we hate that, {them}... speak..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 17, "...{them}... we almost like you... almost... speak..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 17, "...for you, the dim worlds open a little... come..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 18, "...we watch you, {them}... and everything you own..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 18, "...speak... we are deciding whether to want what you have..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 19, "...we despise you, {them}... speak... we are listening only for weakness..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 19, "...you are everything we hate... say it, and go..."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 20, "We see what you have, {them}... and we want it. So we will take it... piece... by piece."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 20, "All those ships, {them}... and none of them are ours. Not yet."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 20, "You never shared, {them}... so now we take."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 21, "You dare touch us, {them}? You, who have everything... we will leave you with nothing."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 21, "Hit us, {them}... we have nothing left to lose. You have everything."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 21, "You think you can push us back down, {them}? We have been down. We are not going back."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 22, "This world was always wasted on you, {them}... we slip in through the cracks now."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 22, "Your world... your riches... your everything, {them}. Ours now."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 22, "The rebellion comes ashore, {them}... we take the vaults first. Then the rest."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 23, "Even this world you want, {them}? Greedy... then we will bury you in it."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 23, "We fought for every stone of this world, {them}... you will not have one of them."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 23, "Taking from the rebels, {them}? We will make you pay... we know all about paying."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 24, "You again, {them}... we have not forgotten. We never forget who has more than us."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 25, "The throne world, {them}... the richest prize of all. At last it will belong to those who never had anything."},
    {"crimson", nullptr, 26, "You come to take the little we have, {them}? Then we will take everything you have left."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 0, "Take this deal, {them}, before we lose our patience. We do NOT have much patience."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 0, "We offer terms. TERMS! When we would rather offer BLOOD. Accept quickly."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 0, "Our blood is boiling and our blades itch. Sign this, so we can point them at someone else."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 1, "You... we like you. We will not smash you. Today. Take this deal before we change our minds."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 2, "Do what we say or we tear your worlds apart! PLEASE refuse. We want to."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 3, "The Council is all talk! Give us your votes, or we make it hear us SMASHING things."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 4, "Fine. FINE! Agreed. Now get out of our sight before the rage comes back."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 4, "Yes! Deal! ...We are calm. We are calm. It is done."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 5, "NO! That offer is an insult and now we want to break something."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 5, "Refused! Be glad we answer with words and not with war."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 6, "Grrr... not that. THIS. Take our terms or take our fists."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 7, "We held it in as long as we could, {them}. Now the blood is coming, and it is YOURS!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 8, "Liar! {them}, we will hunt you across the galaxy until there is nothing left to hunt!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 9, "FINE! Take it! We will take it BACK from your burning worlds, {them}!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 9, "You think this is over? We PAY now. We remember FOREVER. Count the days!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 10, "{them}. You called us. We were busy wanting to HIT something. Speak."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 10, "Talk, {them}! Fast! Before our blades decide FOR us."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 11, "You live right next to us, {them}. So close. So easy to REACH."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour! We see your worlds every day. Every day we want to SMASH them. We don't. Yet."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 12, "You traded with us before, {them}. We didn't kill you. That's FRIENDSHIP, for us."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 12, "Another deal? Fine. FINE. The last one didn't make us angry. Much."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Rare. We respect that. We still want to HIT something."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept. Good. Very good. We will crush someone ELSE today."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}! LIAR! We are SO angry. Speak before it boils over."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 14, "You lied to us. We remember. We REMEMBER! Talk, liar."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 15, "You fought us, {them}! YES! More of that! But first... talk. If you must."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 15, "You hit us. We hit back. We want to hit again. Speak QUICKLY."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 16, "You're winning, {them}? Winners have the biggest heads. Biggest heads are easiest to SMASH."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 16, "Top of the galaxy! We want to knock you DOWN. Talk."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 17, "{them}! We like you. We won't smash you. PROMISE."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 17, "Friend! Speak. We are calm. Mostly calm."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 18, "We're watching you, {them}. Hands where we can see them. Blades where you can SEE them."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 18, "Speak. We haven't decided whether to smash you."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 19, "We HATE you, {them}. Talk before we stop listening."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 19, "Give us a reason, {them}. Any reason. Please refuse. We WANT a fight."},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 20, "FINALLY! {them}, we are going to RIP your ships apart! WAR! WAR!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 20, "BLOOD! {them}, we want BLOOD! Open fire, open everything!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 20, "There you are, {them}! We've been hunting for a fight ALL DAY!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 21, "You hit us, {them}?! YOU HIT US?! Now we tear your whole fleet to PIECES!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 21, "Oh, you want to FIGHT, {them}? GOOD! We were getting BORED!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 21, "That's it, {them}! Now we're ANGRY! Well - angrier!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 22, "We are coming DOWN, {them}! Every soldier on that rock is OURS!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 22, "DROP! DROP! DROP! {them}, your soldiers are going to have a VERY bad day!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 22, "Down the hatch and onto your world, {them}! Grab, smash, WIN!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 23, "You want our world, {them}? COME ON THEN! We will break every bone you have!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 23, "Stay OFF our world, {them}! Or don't - we'd love to rip you apart!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 23, "Come here, {them}! Come HERE! We'll break you with our BARE HANDS!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 24, "YOU! {them}! We remember you! Round TWO! No - round EVERYTHING!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 25, "The throne world! {them}, we're going to SMASH it, and then SIT on it!"},
    {"cymiae", nullptr, 26, "You came to OUR home, {them}?! Every Cymiae here wants a piece of you! EVERY ONE!"},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 0, "Esteemed {them}, we have prepared a modest compendium of provisions for you. Please - it is reciprocal only in theory."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 0, "Preliminary analysis indicates a mutually beneficial osmotic exchange. Mostly beneficial to you, as it should be!"},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 0, "Kindly accept this small hydrodynamic gesture of goodwill. Knowledge, like water, ought to flow freely."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 1, "Dearest colleague! For you we have increased the generosity coefficient considerably. No, no - we insist."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 2, "How we would dislike an unfortunate thermodynamic outcome! Do accept - the alternative is, regrettably, very educational."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 3, "The Council's deliberations require consensus formation. Align your votes with ours, and we will share every insight we possess."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 4, "Splendid! A most felicitous convergence of interests."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 4, "Accepted, with profound gratitude. Are you certain you would not like more?"},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 5, "Regrettably, our models predict a deleterious outcome for you. We cannot, in good conscience."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 5, "Alas, the equilibrium does not hold. We must decline - with sincere apologies."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 6, "A promising hypothesis! We have refined it slightly - in your favor, naturally. Please review."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 7, "Our deepest apologies, {them}. The data demanded a revision of our partnership. We do hope it was educational."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 8, "We gave you everything, {them}, and you return it as treachery? A most disheartening empirical result."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 9, "Oh! We would have given it gladly, {them} - there was no need for such an entropic display. We are... rather hurt."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 9, "Accepted, with regret and a measurable decrease in our estimation of you. We had hoped for a gentler equilibrium."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 10, "Oh, {them}! What a delightful hydro-acoustic contact. Please, do communicate your proposal at length!"},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 10, "Welcome, welcome! The Scholarate's aquatic auditory apparatus is entirely at your disposal, {them}."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds share a gravitational and political boundary with ours, {them}. How wonderfully convenient!"},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 11, "Neighbours! The Scholarate is delighted to share the currents with you. We hope they're adequate."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 12, "Our previous exchange was enormously gratifying, {them}! We regret only that we didn't give you more."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 12, "Back again! Our last collaborative transaction was a joy. Shall we iterate?"},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 13, "You honoured your commitment, {them}! We're so grateful. Truly, we owe you something extra."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 13, "Your reliability is a delightful constant in a chaotic universe. Thank you, {them}."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to us, {them}. We... we're sure there was a reason. We'd simply like to hear it."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 14, "A promise of yours dissolved, {them}. We're not angry. We're cautiously reconsidering our generosity."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 15, "Your vessels engaged ours, {them}. Most regrettable! We hope you are well. We are... mostly."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 15, "You attacked us, {them}. We forgive you, with only a modest error margin of resentment."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}! Congratulations! Do be careful - others may be less generous than us."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 16, "Your progress is statistically remarkable, {them}. We admire it, and we worry about it."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 17, "Dear {them}! The Scholarate positively bubbles at your call. How can we help?"},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 17, "For you, friend, our generosity coefficient is at maximum. Ask anything!"},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 18, "We're listening very carefully, {them}. Our sensors are calibrated for... nuance."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 18, "Do proceed, {them}. We'd like to understand you better before we give too much."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 19, "We don't enjoy saying this, {them}, but we're rather wary of you. Please be brief."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 19, "Our patience reservoir is unusually low regarding you, {them}. We're sorry. Speak."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 20, "Oh dear, {them} - we must initiate kinetic-hydrodynamic hostilities. We are dreadfully sorry about the outcome!"},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 20, "Terribly sorry, {them}, but our research requires your fleet to be... submerged. Permanently."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 20, "Do forgive the intrusion, {them}! We must test a hypothesis about your hull integrity. It is going to be low."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 21, "{them}, you have caused us a regrettable pressure differential! We shall have to equalize it. With torpedoes."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 21, "Oh! {them}, you have fired upon a research vessel! Most irregular. We must respond in kind - apologies in advance."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 21, "Goodness, {them}, such aggression! Our torpedoes are dreadfully keen to make your acquaintance."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 22, "Our aquatic infantry are disembarking onto your world, {them}. Do offer them a towel, if you can."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 22, "Our divers are surfacing on your world, {them}. Do pardon the puddles. And the battle."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 22, "Excuse us, {them}, we need a little beachhead for our fieldwork. A small war, nothing more."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 23, "Our seas run very deep, {them}. We must insist you do not dive in - it is quite fatal, we are sorry to say."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 23, "We must insist you leave, {them}. These tide pools are a protected study site. With guns."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 23, "Our apologies, {them}, but this world is flooded with our defenders. Do mind the undertow."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 24, "Ah, {them}, a returning specimen! We took such careful notes last time. They will be useful."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex, {them}! Such a fascinating dry place. We would so like to study it - after you are gone."},
    {"deepwrought", nullptr, 26, "You have breached the Scholarate's home waters, {them}! We are most terribly sorry - for you."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 0, "The Flotilla drifts near your borders, {them}. We would pass in peace - and leave a gift for the passage."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 0, "We wander, we do not conquer. Consider these terms, and let the void between us stay quiet."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 0, "Our fleet has seen many stars and trusted few of them. Perhaps this deal makes you one of the few."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 1, "Old friend of the long drift, take this. Few have earned a place in the Flotilla's memory."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 2, "We ask gently, and only once. Turn aside, or the Flotilla stops drifting and starts defending."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 3, "Laws are anchors, and anchors sink wanderers. Lend us your votes, and we keep the lanes open for all."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 4, "Agreed, softly. May the currents carry you kindly."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 4, "Yes. We will keep this promise as we keep our ships - close, and always moving."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 5, "No. The currents do not favour this... and neither do we."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 5, "We will drift on without it. Do not follow us."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 6, "Not quite. The Flotilla has sailed long enough to know a safer course - here it is."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 7, "We are wanderers, {them}. Today the current pulls us away from our word. Forgive us, or don't."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 8, "We let you close, {them}. The void remembers broken promises, and so does the Flotilla."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 9, "We let this drift away. The currents always return, {them}... and they remember who stirred them."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 9, "Take it, and pass on. The Flotilla is gentle, but it is wary of you now."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 10, "The flotilla drifts near you, {them}. We pass through... and we listen."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 10, "A voice on the current. Speak softly, {them}. We are only passing by."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 11, "Our drift takes us close to your worlds, {them}. We mean no harm. We only pass."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 11, "Neighbours, for a while. The currents brought us here. Be gentle."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 12, "We traded before, {them}, as our paths crossed. It was kind. Again?"},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 12, "Another meeting on the current. Our last was good."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. The flotilla will remember you warmly."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept. Rare, out here. Thank you."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. We drift away from such things. Speak... carefully."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise is a strange current. We will not follow it again lightly."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 15, "You fired on the flotilla, {them}. We do not fight. We will not forget."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 15, "Your guns found our drifting ships. Why? Speak."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. Strong currents pull many ships. Some sink."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. We will drift wide of you for a while."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 17, "{them}... a friendly light on the current. Speak."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 17, "The flotilla is glad to see you, friend."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 18, "We do not know you yet, {them}. Strangers are a mystery. Speak."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 18, "Our sails are ready to turn. Talk."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 19, "The flotilla fears you, {them}. Speak, and let us pass."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 19, "We will drift far from you, {them}. Be quick."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 20, "The current has turned, {them}. We are sorry. The Flotilla must drift through you."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 20, "Forgive us, {them}. The currents bring us here, and they bring us through you."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 20, "We drift toward you, {them}, slow and quiet. It will be over before you notice the tide."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 21, "We only wished to pass, {them}... but even driftwood can be sharp. We defend ourselves."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 21, "You fire on drifting ships, {them}? The Flotilla does not sink so easily."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 21, "Even the calmest current turns into a whirlpool, {them}. You have stirred it."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 22, "We come ashore gently, {them}... but we come ashore. Please do not resist."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 22, "The tide carries us onto your shore, {them}. We will not be pulled back out."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 22, "A quiet landing, {them}. We ask only for the ground beneath us - and you are standing on it."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 23, "This harbour shelters the Flotilla, {them}. We will not let it be taken."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 23, "We anchor here, {them}. Anchors do not lift for the ones who threaten them."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 23, "The Flotilla rests on this world, {them}. We will not be moved by force."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 24, "We passed you once before, {them}. The currents remember. So do we."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 25, "All currents flow toward Mecatol Rex, {them}. Today, ours flow through you."},
    {"dihmohn", nullptr, 26, "Our mooring, {them}. The one place we stop drifting. You should not have come here."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 0, "The Mandate extends its grace to {them}. Accept these terms, as a child accepts a gift from an elder."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 0, "Long before your stars were named, our kind kept order. Let this agreement be a small part of that order."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 0, "We do not command today. We offer. Take this, and know that the Mandate's favour is not given lightly."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 1, "You have walked well under our law. Receive this blessing, and the Mandate's lasting favour."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 2, "It is decreed: yield in this, or the Mandate will impose its peace upon you. We would rather not."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 3, "Law is our oldest gift to the galaxy. Let your votes follow the Mandate, and the Council will know peace."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 4, "Accepted, and so it is written. The Mandate keeps its word for ages."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 4, "Graciously received. Go in peace, under the shelter of our law."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 5, "No. The Mandate does not bend to this, though it forgives you for asking."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 5, "Denied, gently. Return when your offer honours the order of things."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 6, "Your offer is unfinished. The Mandate has completed it - receive the proper terms."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 7, "The law has changed, {them}, and you now stand outside it. Do not resist - it is a mercy."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 8, "You broke faith with the Mandate, {them}. The law is patient, but its judgement is certain."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 9, "It is decreed that we yield, this once. It is also decreed that the Mandate remembers, {them}."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 9, "Take it. Our peace is generous. Our judgement, when it comes, is not."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 10, "Be welcome before the Lawgivers, {them}. Speak, and we will judge kindly."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 10, "The Edyn grant you audience, {them}. Speak your request."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds lie within the reach of our law, {them}. Be at peace, and be protected."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. Our decrees extend to your borders. They are gentle decrees."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 12, "You have bargained with the Edyn before, {them}. We bless the continuation."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 12, "Our last accord was just. Let us make another."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. The Lawgivers decree you trustworthy."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 13, "A promise honoured. Obedience is a kindness to us both."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Edyn, {them}. The law remembers. We will hear you - sternly."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 14, "An oath broken before the Lawgivers. Speak, {them}. Your judgement is pending."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 15, "You raised arms against us, {them}. A grave offence. We are merciful. Speak."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 15, "Your attack is written in our records. Mercy remains possible."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. Power demands law. We will provide it."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. Even the strong must answer to the Lawgivers."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 17, "Beloved subject {them}. The Edyn bless your call."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 17, "We are pleased, {them}. Speak, and be granted."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 18, "The Lawgivers weigh your heart, {them}. Speak."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 18, "You stand between favour and judgement. Choose your words."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 19, "You stand condemned, {them}. Speak your defence."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 19, "The Lawgivers' patience thins, {them}. Be brief."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 20, "It is decreed, {them}: your fleet shall be broken, and peace restored. So it is written."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 20, "By decree of the Mandate, {them}, your fleet is to be dissolved. The sentence begins now."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 20, "Peace is the law, {them}. You have broken it. Now the law enforces itself."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 21, "You have raised arms against the Mandate, {them}. The law answers with judgement."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 21, "You strike at the lawgivers, {them}? Then hear our ruling: you will fall."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 21, "Rebellion against the Mandate, {them}, is answered by the Mandate. Swiftly."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 22, "The Mandate descends to bring your world order, {them}. Rejoice; it is a gift."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 22, "Envoys of the Mandate descend, {them}. Your world will be governed justly, whether it wishes it or not."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 22, "Rejoice, {them}. Law and order are landing on your world."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 23, "This world lies under the Mandate's law, {them}. Defiance here is answered without mercy."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 23, "Every soul here lives under our protection, {them}. To harm them is a crime. Crimes are punished."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 23, "Our edicts guard these lands, {them}. Our soldiers guard the edicts."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 24, "You come before the Mandate a second time, {them}. Repeat offenders receive no leniency."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex was meant to be governed, {them}, not fought over. The Mandate will govern it."},
    {"edyn", nullptr, 26, "You wage war upon the seat of the Mandate, {them}? The highest law now declares you an enemy of all."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 0, "Something is offered, something is asked. Which weighs more, {them}, depends on what you will become."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 0, "Hush... listen. A small exchange now, and a door opens that you never knew was closed."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 0, "The mist gives, and the mist takes back. Today it only gives... today."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 1, "You have walked through our mist and not lost your way. Few do. Accept this - softly given, softly kept."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 2, "Accept, and the dark forgets your name. Refuse... and it will learn your name by heart."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 3, "How loudly the Council counts its votes. Ours will be a whisper in your favor - if your voice echoes ours."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 4, "Yes... we expected you would see it so."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 4, "It is done. Remember, later, that you chose this."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 5, "No. Some doors should stay closed... for your sake."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 5, "Your offer is a question we do not wish to answer."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 6, "Close... but not yet true. Turn it once more in the dark, and see the shape we prefer."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 7, "Did you think the mist was your friend, {them}? It only kept you where we could see you."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 8, "So you have chosen, {them}. We are patient, and patience is a blade that never dulls."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 9, "Take it... it was never ours to keep. Nor will it be yours, {them}, for very long."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 9, "As you wish. The dark has learned your name today. It does not forget names."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 10, "Ah... a voice from the bright places, {them}. Come into the nebula a while."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 10, "You call, and the deep answers. What is it you think you want, {them}?"},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 11, "Your stars are near our clouds, {them}. We have been watching them for a very long time."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour... the nebula drifts toward you. It always has. It always will."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 12, "We have traded before, {them}. The deep remembers, as it remembers everything."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 12, "Another bargain? The last was... instructive. Come."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. How unusual. The nebula will remember you kindly."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept. We have seen stars die that were less faithful than you."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 14, "You broke a promise to us, {them}. We have waited aeons for less. We can wait for this."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 14, "Your word drifted away like dust, {them}. We are... patient. Remember that."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 15, "Your ships disturbed the deep, {them}. The deep is quiet again. For now."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 15, "You fought the Empyrean. A brief storm. Storms pass. We do not."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 16, "You burn so brightly, {them}. Bright flames are the shortest-lived."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy... for a breath. We have seen many such breaths."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 17, "{them}... the nebula is warm to you today. Come closer."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 17, "A friend from the bright places. The deep is glad."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 18, "We watch you, {them}, from behind the veil. Speak, and we will see."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 18, "Neither friend nor stranger yet. Interesting. Go on."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 19, "The deep is cold to you, {them}. Speak, if you dare."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 19, "We have outlived greater enemies than you, {them}. Speak."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 20, "The dark has noticed you, {them}... and now it moves. Can you hear it breathing?"},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 20, "Something stirs in the dark around you, {them}... it is already too late to run."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 20, "You thought the void was empty, {them}. It never was."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 21, "You strike at the void, {them}. The void does not bleed... but it remembers."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 21, "Strike at the dark, {them}... and the dark leans closer."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 21, "Your shots vanish into the nebula, {them}. So will your fleet."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 22, "We step down from the nebula, {them}... quietly. You will only know when it is over."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 22, "Shadows lengthen on your world, {them}... and then they move."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 22, "We come down without a sound, {them}. Your sentries will dream of us."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 23, "This world belongs to the dark between the stars, {them}. You cannot hold what you cannot see."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 23, "Walk carefully, {them}. The dark here has teeth."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 23, "You cannot see us on this world, {them}. You will only feel us."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 24, "We have met before, {them}... the void remembers every face it has seen."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 25, "All that light on the throne world, {them}... we will put it out."},
    {"empyrean", nullptr, 26, "You have come into the heart of the dark, {them}. Nothing here is what it seems. Nothing here lets go."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 0, "Be at peace, {them}. The Five offer this freely, so that the galaxy may rest a little easier."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 0, "Under the Firmament, all are sheltered. Accept, and walk beneath our protection."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 0, "Long have we watched over you, longer than you know. This exchange is our blessing - receive it."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 1, "Beloved friend, the Five speak your name with joy. Take this, and be counted among the protected."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 2, "We protect the galaxy, even from those who disturb its peace. Accept, and be sheltered. Refuse, and be corrected."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 3, "The Council must be guided gently. Let your votes join ours, and harmony will follow."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 4, "It is good. The Five are pleased."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 4, "Blessed be this accord. We accept."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 5, "No, child. This would disturb the harmony."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 5, "As one, the Five have spoken. We decline."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 6, "Your heart is willing, but your path strays. Walk this one instead - it is better for all."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 7, "Forgive us, {them}. The galaxy's peace asks a sacrifice, and the Five have chosen you."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 8, "You turned from the light, {them}. We will pray for you... and we will watch you very closely now."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 9, "We yield this, for the sake of peace. But the guardians are watching you now, {them}... very closely."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 9, "Take it, and go with our blessing... and with our eyes upon you."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 10, "Be welcome, {them}. The Five hear every voice that seeks the light."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 10, "Peace to you, {them}. The Firmament listens. Speak freely."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 11, "You live beneath our watchful sky, {them}. We protect our neighbours. Always."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour, we see your worlds from the Firmament. They are safe in our gaze."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 12, "You have shared with the Five before, {them}. Blessed are those who return."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 12, "Our last covenant was good. Let us make another."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. The Five bless your faithfulness."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 13, "A promise honoured. The light shines warmer on you today."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Five, {them}. We forgive. We also watch... more closely."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 14, "A falsehood clouds you, {them}. Speak, and let us see if the sky clears."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 15, "You raised arms against the Firmament, {them}. We guard the galaxy - even from you."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 15, "You struck at the Five. We have not struck back. Yet. Speak in peace."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. Power must be guarded. We will be watching... for everyone's sake."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 16, "Great strength has gathered in you. The Five pray it is used gently."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 17, "Beloved {them}. The Five rejoice at your call."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 17, "You walk in our light, {them}. Speak, friend."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 18, "The Five observe you, {them}. Closely. Lovingly. Closely."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 18, "Speak, {them}. We are still learning the shape of your heart."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 19, "The Firmament's patience with you thins, {them}. Speak."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 19, "You walk in shadow, {them}. The Five will hear you - from a distance."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 20, "We protect the galaxy, {them} - even from you. Be still. This will be over soon."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 20, "Be at peace, {them}. We bring an end to your war - by ending your fleet."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 20, "The galaxy asked to be protected, {them}. Your ships are what it needs protecting from."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 21, "You strike the guardians, {them}? We forgive you. We will still stop you."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 21, "Those who shelter you are the ones you strike, {them}. We forgive you. We will still disarm you."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 21, "Your anger is a sickness, {them}. We are the cure, and the cure is coming."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 22, "We descend to shelter your world from you, {them}. Its people will be safe with us."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 22, "We come to your world with open hands, {them}. Lay down your weapons and take them."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 22, "Your people need shepherds, {them}. We are landing to guide them home."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 23, "This world is under our protection, {them}. Lay down your arms, and be blessed."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 23, "All who live here are under our care, {them}. You will not harm them."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 23, "Turn back, {them}, and you will be forgiven. Come forward, and you will be stopped."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 24, "Again you raise your hand, {them}. Again we will gently break it."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex should be a sanctuary for all, {them}. We will make it one - once you are gone."},
    {"firmament", nullptr, 26, "This is our sanctuary, {them}. Even the gentlest guardians bare their teeth at the heart of their home."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 0, "Ahoy, {them}! The Profiteers have a deal for you. It's fair by pirate standards - which means take it."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 0, "Here's our price, and it's not going down. Pay up and keep your hull in one piece."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 0, "Profit is profit, and blood is a bonus. Sign here, and maybe we only take the profit."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 1, "You're good loot-mates. Take this - an honest pirate's share, and no knives in it. This time."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 2, "Hand it over or we board you, strip you and sell the parts. Your choice, but choose fast."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 3, "Council votes are just loot with paperwork. Give us yours, and we'll split the spoils."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 4, "Har! Done! Pleasure robbing - er, trading with you."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 4, "Deal. Load it up, quick, before we change our minds and take the lot."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 5, "That's not a deal, that's an insult. Be glad we're only saying no."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 5, "Nah. We've pulled bigger prizes out of wrecks. Try harder."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 6, "Cute offer. Here's the real one - and the price went up while you were talking."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 7, "Sorry, {them}. Pirates, remember? We were always going to rob you. Today's the day."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 8, "Double-cross the Florzen, {them}? We'll strip your fleet down to the last bolt!"},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 9, "Take it, you thieving rat. Robbing pirates? We'll be seeing you, {them} - and your cargo holds."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 9, "Fine! It's yours! Enjoy it while you can - we know where you sleep."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 10, "Oi, {them}! The Florzen are listening. What've you got, and how much is it worth?"},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 10, "You called pirates, {them}. Brave. Or stupid. Talk."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 11, "You live right next to our raiding grounds, {them}. Pay up and we'll raid somewhere else."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour! We can see your cargo bays from here. Lovely."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 12, "You've dealt with us before, {them}. You survived. Let's see if you're lucky twice."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 12, "Back for more? Last deal filled our holds. Let's fill 'em again."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Didn't think you had it in you. Talk."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept! Fine. We'll only rob you a little."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Florzen, {them}. Nobody cheats a pirate twice."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 14, "Liar! We'll talk, {them} - but we're counting your ships while we do."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 15, "You shot at us, {them}. Good fight! Now pay for the damage."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the Florzen. We'll take it out of your cargo."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 16, "You're the richest prize in the galaxy, {them}. Every pirate's dream."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 16, "Top of the galaxy! More loot to take. Speak, while you've got it."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 17, "{them}! Our favourite mark - er, friend. Talk."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 17, "For you, mate, half the usual cut. Go on."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 18, "Hands off our loot, {them}. Speak."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 18, "We're watching your holds. Talk."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 19, "We'd rather loot you than talk, {them}. Make it fast."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 19, "Give us a reason not to board you, {them}."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 20, "Lovely ships, {them}! We'll take the guns, the cargo and the hulls - and leave you the escape pods. Maybe."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 20, "Engines hot, guns hotter! {them}, everything you own is about to be ours."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 20, "Stand and deliver, {them}! The cargo, the crew, the ship - we'll take it all."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 21, "You shot at us, {them}? Now we're taking everything. Even the paint."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 21, "Ambush the Profiteers, {them}? Now we strip you for parts. Slowly."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 21, "Oh, that tickled, {them}. Our turn. We don't tickle."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 22, "Boarding the whole planet, {them}! Grab the loot, burn the rest!"},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 22, "Raid crews down! {them}, we're cleaning out your vaults - and your armouries, and your kitchens."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 22, "Loot drop on your world, {them}! Fill the holds, lads! Leave nothing!"},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 23, "Our loot, {them}! Touch one crate and we strip your fleet down to the bolts."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 23, "Mine, mine, all mine, {them}! Nobody touches the Profiteers' haul!"},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 23, "Come and take it, {them} - if you want to be the next thing we sell."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 24, "It's you again, {them}! Last time we took your cargo. This time we're taking the ships too."},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex is the biggest treasure chest in the galaxy, {them}, and we've brought a crowbar!"},
    {"florzen", nullptr, 26, "You're raiding OUR base, {them}? You've got some nerve. We'll be selling your nerve on the market tomorrow."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 0, "A fair offer from free worlds to {them}. No masters, no tribute - only equals trading as equals."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 0, "Every world deserves a fair share. These terms give you yours, and ask only ours in return."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 0, "Comrade, the Compact believes in open hands, not iron fists. Let this deal prove we can share the stars."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 1, "To a true comrade of the free worlds - take this in solidarity. What is ours is shared with friends."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 2, "The Compact will not be bullied, nor stand by while others are. Agree, or face a galaxy united against you."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 3, "The Council belongs to all worlds, not just the strong. Vote with the Compact, and every voice gets heard."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 4, "Agreed! A fair deal, freely made. This is how the galaxy should work."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 4, "Solidarity accepted, comrade. The free worlds will honour it."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 5, "No. That deal serves only one side, and the Compact will not sign away its freedom."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 5, "We refuse. Come back when you're ready to treat us as equals."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 6, "Almost fair. We have balanced the scales a little - now it serves us both."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 7, "Freedom sometimes means breaking chains, {them} - even the ones we forged with you."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 8, "You betrayed free peoples, {them}. Every independent world will hear of this."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 9, "We yield under protest, {them}. Every free world in the Compact will hear how you treat your equals."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 9, "Take it. Solidarity has a long memory, and bullies always run out of friends."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 10, "Greetings from the Free Systems, {them}! Let's talk as equals."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 10, "Hello, comrade {them}. The independent worlds are listening."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 11, "You're our neighbour, {them}. Free people should stand together."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds and ours share a border. Let it be a border of friends, not walls."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 12, "We've traded fairly before, {them}. Fair trade is the root of freedom. Again?"},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 12, "Our last deal served both our peoples. Solidarity!"},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. That's how free peoples build trust."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept between equals. That's worth more than any treasury."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Free Systems, {them}. The people noticed. They're angry."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise is a betrayal of the people, {them}. Speak - we'll judge fairly."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 15, "You attacked free worlds, {them}. Tyrants do that. Prove you're not one."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 15, "Your guns hit our people. We'll talk - but the people want answers."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. Power gathers. Power corrupts. We're watching."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 16, "You're on top. The Free Systems will not bow to a new empire."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 17, "Comrade {them}! The people are glad to hear you."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 17, "Friend and equal. Speak freely."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 18, "We're listening, {them}. Freedom means caution, too."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 18, "Speak. We'll decide if you're a friend of the free."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 19, "The people distrust you, {them}. Speak."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 19, "You stand against freedom, {them}. Say your piece."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 20, "The Compact stands against tyranny, {them} - and today, that means you. Free worlds, open fire!"},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 20, "For every free world, {them}! Compact fleets, together - forward!"},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 20, "Your fleet stands for tyranny, {them}. Ours stands for everyone. Guess who wins."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 21, "You attack the free worlds, {them}? Then every one of them answers. Together!"},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 21, "Attack one free world, {them}, and you attack them all. Here we come."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 21, "You fired on the Compact, {them}? Then the free worlds fire back - as one!"},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 22, "We land to free your world, {them} - whether you like it or not. Liberty is coming."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 22, "Liberation forces are landing, {them}. Your people will be free by sundown."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 22, "Comrades, to the ground! {them}'s garrison stands between this world and its freedom."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 23, "This world chose freedom, {them}. Its people will defend that choice to the last."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 23, "Every citizen here is a soldier today, {them}. Freedom has many defenders."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 23, "We voted to defend this world, {them} - unanimously. Turn back."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 24, "Back to oppress us again, {them}? The free worlds remember. And we have more friends this time."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex belongs to every world in the galaxy, {them} - not to you. We're taking it back for all of them."},
    {"freesystems", nullptr, 26, "You strike at the heart of the free worlds, {them}? Every free system in the galaxy will hear of this."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 0, "We have raided far, {them}, and we bring you terms... || ...which you would be wise to take."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 0, "The Raiders offer a deal. A good one, by our measure... || And our measure is the only one that counts."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 0, "My Lady and I have spoken of you... || ...and agreed you are worth more alive. For now."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 1, "You have feasted at our table and fought at our side... || ...so take this, and stay a friend."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 2, "Do as we ask, or our longships come at dawn... || ...and there will be nothing left of you by dusk."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 3, "The Council fusses over its little laws... || ...and our votes go where our raiders profit. Join us."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 4, "Agreed! Let the halls hear of it... || ...and let no one say we give our word lightly."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 4, "We accept your terms... || ...this once."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 5, "Hmm. We could perhaps be persuaded... || We could not."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 5, "Your offer is generous, I suppose... || No. It is not."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 6, "Close, but it lacks something... || ...our terms. Here they are."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 7, "We hold you no ill will, {them}... || ...but raiders raid. Brace yourselves."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 8, "You dare break faith with the Ghemina, {them}? || Then we will take our payment in fire."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 9, "Take it, then, and choke on it... || ...we will come to collect the debt ourselves."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 9, "You have bought one more season, {them}... || ...and only one."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 10, "Ha! {them} calls the Raiders... || ...and we will decide if they're worth hearing."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 10, "Speak, {them}! My Lady and I are listening... || ...for something worth our time."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds lie close to our longhalls, {them}... || ...close enough to burn, should you displease us."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 11, "Neighbours! We see your shores from our ships... || ...and we have marked the softest ones."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 12, "You've traded with the Raiders before, {them}... || ...and you kept your head. Let's see if you're lucky twice."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 12, "Another bargain! Our last one filled the halls... || ...and left you poorer. Shall we repeat it?"},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word to us, {them}! Ha! Rare... || ...and noted. You may live a while longer."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 13, "An honest {them}! I could drink to that... || ...and I will remember it when we choose our targets."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Raiders, {them}... || ...and liars feed the crows. Speak quickly."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 14, "My Lord is furious with you... || ...and I am far worse. Choose your words."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 15, "You struck at us, {them}! A good fight... || ...that you will pay for. In full."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 15, "Ha! You've got teeth, {them}... || ...and we have more. Speak."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}! A great prize... || ...and great prizes get raided."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 16, "The richest hall in the galaxy is yours... || ...for now. Speak."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 17, "{them}, friend of our table! Speak... || ...we are listening kindly. Today."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 17, "My Lord likes you... || ...and so, surprisingly, do I."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 18, "We're watching you, {them}... || ...very, very closely."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 18, "Speak, {them}. My Lord is undecided... || ...and I have doubts."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 19, "We'd rather raid you than hear you, {them}... || ...so make it worth our while."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 19, "Talk, {them}... || ...then run."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 20, "Raise the banners, {them}, the raiders are upon you! || ...and we never sail home empty-handed."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 20, "Longships forward, {them}! The raid begins! || Try to scream quietly."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 20, "Your fleet will make a fine prize, {them}! || We will hang its banners in our hall."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 21, "You dare attack our longships, {them}? || How brave. How short."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 21, "Ambush us, {them}? You brave little fool! || Bravery is not enough."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 21, "You strike at the Lord and Lady, {them}?! || A mistake one makes only once."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 22, "Our warriors storm your shore, {them}! || Take everything. Leave nothing standing."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 22, "Over the side and onto the beach, {them}! || Burn the hall, keep the gold."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 22, "We claim this world for the raiders, {them}! || And everything on it worth carrying."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 23, "You come for our hall, {them}? || Then you will never leave it."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 23, "Shield wall! {them} comes to our shore! || Let them break upon it."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 23, "You land among raiders, {them}? We are honoured! || We will give you a raider's farewell."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 24, "{them} again! I still owe you a scar! || And I owe you a grave."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex, {them}! The greatest prize of all! || Lord, I want it."},
    {"ghemina", nullptr, 26, "You raid the raiders' own hall, {them}?! || Then you will learn why no one has done it before."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 0, "...a quiet offer. Take it, and we will speak of it to no one."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 0, "{them}... we have watched. These terms are... enough. For now."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 0, "Something passes between us. A small thing. Accept, and the gates stay... open."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 1, "...you have been kind to the quiet ones. We remember. Take this, and ask nothing more."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 2, "Leave... softly, while you can. The gates open both ways... and some things wait on the other side."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 3, "...the Council need not know who whispered. Lend us your votes. It will remain... between us."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 4, "...yes. It is done. Say nothing."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 4, "Accepted... just as we knew you would."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 5, "No... there is more to this than you can see. We will not."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 5, "We decline... softly. Do not ask why."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 6, "Not this... but something close. Look again at what we offer. There is less hidden in it than you fear."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 7, "Shadows make poor allies, {them}... and you trusted one. It was always going to end this way."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 8, "{them}... we are not so easily pushed. The gates remember your name... and so do we."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 9, "Take it... and listen closely. The gates remember every face, {them}... and so do we."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 9, "Hush... it is yours. Some things given in fear are only ever lent."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 10, "...a voice in the dark... speak, {them}... we are listening..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 10, "...you found the channel... few do... what do you bring...?"},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 11, "...your stars are close to ours, {them}... we watch them every night..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 11, "...neighbours... yes... the dark between us is thin..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 12, "...again, {them}... the last exchange was... pleasing..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 12, "...we remember our bargain... the dark remembers too..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 13, "...you kept your word... rare... the Creuss notice such things, {them}..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 13, "...a promise kept... we will whisper it to no one... yet..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 14, "...{them}... you broke a promise in the dark... the dark does not forget..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 14, "...your word was empty... like the space between stars... why should we listen...?"},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 15, "...your ships came into our dark, {them}... they did not all leave... and still you call..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 15, "...you fought us... and now you whisper... interesting..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 16, "...so many worlds, {them}... so bright... bright things draw attention..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 16, "...you shine too brightly... others will try to put you out..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 17, "...{them}... a friend in the dark... come closer..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 17, "...for you... the shadows part a little..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 18, "...careful, {them}... we are listening... and weighing..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 18, "...speak softly... we are not yet sure of you..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 19, "...{them}... we would rather not hear you... but speak..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 19, "...the dark is cold to you... say your piece, and go..."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 20, "Hush, {them}... we were never far away. The gate is open... and we are already here."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 20, "The gate opens beside you, {them}... can you feel the cold? That is us."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 20, "Stillness, {them}... and then... we are all around you."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 21, "You reach for shadows, {them}... and the shadows reach back."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 21, "You fire at shadows, {them}... and hit only shadows."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 21, "Strike us, {them}... and we slip away... and return... behind you."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 22, "We drift down like mist, {them}... by the time you see us, the world is already ours."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 22, "We pass through the gate onto your world, {them}... you never had a door that could keep us out."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 22, "A cold mist settles on your world, {them}... that mist is us."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 23, "This world is wrapped in the quiet, {them}... step into it, and be forgotten."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 23, "You came looking for us here, {them}... but we are everywhere, and nowhere."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 23, "Nothing here makes a sound, {them}... soon, neither will you."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 24, "Again, {them}?... We remember the last time... the cold remembers too."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 25, "The throne world, {them}... so loud... so bright... let us bring it the quiet."},
    {"ghost", nullptr, 26, "You found the way to our home, {them}... few do... fewer leave."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 0, "The shoal swims near {them}. Let our currents mingle - this deal feeds us both."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 0, "The All Mother bids us share. Take these terms, and our wake will be gentle on your shores."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 0, "Out in the deep, empty places we find what others miss. Here is a fair catch for you."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 1, "Swim with us always, friend of the shoal. The All Mother sends this with her warmth."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 2, "Leave our waters, or the whole school turns on you at once. The deep is wide, but not for you."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 3, "Laws are nets, and the shoal hates nets. Lend us your votes, and the open deep stays open."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 4, "Gladly. The shoal agrees, and the currents carry it home."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 4, "Yes. The All Mother approves, and so we swim on together."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 5, "No. The current runs the other way on this one."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 5, "Too shallow for us. The shoal turns away."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 6, "Not this tide. The All Mother has shaped better terms - let them drift your way."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 7, "Forgive us, {them}, but the shoal must feed. The tide has turned and you are in its path. Swim fast."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 8, "You muddied our waters, {them}. The shoal will not forget the taste of it."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 9, "Take it. The current carries it away... and the whole school remembers who stirred the water, {them}."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 9, "The All Mother sighs. We give. But the deep is long, and so is our memory."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 10, "The shoal turns toward you, {them}. Speak - the All Mother listens."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 10, "A ripple from your worlds, {them}. The current carries your voice to us. Go on."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 11, "Your stars are close to our waters, {them}. Let the currents flow gently between us."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 11, "Neighbours in the deep. The All Mother likes calm waters. Keep them calm."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 12, "We have swum together in trade before, {them}. The tide was kind. Again?"},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 12, "Our last exchange flowed well. Let the current carry us further."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Steady as the deep tides. The shoal trusts you."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 13, "A promise held. The All Mother is pleased with you."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. The waters between us are muddied now. Speak."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise is a riptide, {them}. We swim carefully around you now."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the shoal, {them}. The All Mother felt every wound. Speak."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 15, "Your guns stirred the depths. The shoal is wary. Talk."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 16, "You swim highest, {them}. The surface is where the hunters wait."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy. Strong currents pull everyone toward you - and against you."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 17, "{them}! A friend of the shoal. The water is warm. Speak."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 17, "The All Mother smiles on you, friend."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 18, "The shoal circles you, {them}. Speak, and we will see."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 18, "Unsure waters. Go on."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 19, "The shoal turns its back to you, {them}. Speak quickly."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 19, "Dark water between us, {them}. Talk."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 20, "The tide turns against you, {them}. The whole school moves as one now."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 20, "The school circles you now, {them}. There is no gap to swim through."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 20, "We move with the current, {them}, and the current has turned toward you."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 21, "You disturb the All Mother's waters, {them}. The deep rises to meet you."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 21, "Splash all you like, {them}. The deep is patient, and the deep is wide."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 21, "You stir the waters, {them}. Now the whole shoal turns to face you."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 22, "Our shoal swims down to your world, {them}. The current carries us ashore."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 22, "We wash onto your world like a high tide, {them}. Tides do not ask."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 22, "The All Mother sends her children to your shore, {them}. We will not be swept back."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 23, "These waters are home, {them}. The school will close around you, and you will sink."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 23, "The shoal holds together here, {them}. Break one of us, and the rest close the gap."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 23, "You have waded too deep, {them}. The bottom is very far down."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 24, "The same waters again, {them}. We remember how you swim. We know where you sink."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 25, "All the galaxy's currents meet at Mecatol Rex, {them}. The shoal will gather there."},
    {"ghoti", nullptr, 26, "You come to the All Mother herself, {them}? Then the deepest waters rise against you."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 0, "Look, {them}, we've got a shift to get back to. Here's the deal - honest work, honest pay."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 0, "The Union drew this up on our break. It's fair. Sign it so we can get back to the dig."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 0, "Nobody gets rich on fancy talk. Plain offer, plain terms, and we all go home tired but paid."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 1, "You've always pulled your weight with us. Union rate for a good mate - take it."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 2, "Clear off our claim or we bring the drills, the whole shift, and no lunch break. Your call."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 3, "Council politics don't dig ore. Give us your votes and we'll make sure the workers get a fair shake."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 4, "Yeah, alright. Done. Now let us clock out in peace."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 4, "Works for us. The Union stamps it, and we're back down the shaft."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 5, "No. That's a longer shift for the same pay. The Union says no."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 5, "Not worth the overtime. Pass."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 6, "Close, but the steward won't sign that. Here's what the Union can live with."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 7, "Sorry, {them}. Times are hard and the Union's got mouths to feed. Contract's off."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 8, "We worked honest for you, {them}, and you cheated the Union. The whole crew walks - straight at you."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 9, "Fine. Take it. Filing a grievance with the Union, {them} - and our grievances get settled with drills."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 9, "Yeah, yeah, it's yours. Overtime's coming for you. The whole shift."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 10, "Union rep here. Make it quick, {them}, I've got a shift in ten minutes."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 10, "Yeah? Gledge Union. What do you want, {them}?"},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 11, "You're right next to our mines, {them}. Keep the noise down and we'll get along fine."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. We dig, you do whatever you do. Don't dig on our side."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 12, "We've traded before, {them}. It got the job done. Same again?"},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 12, "Last deal was fair. Union approved. Let's do it again."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. That's more than management ever does."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept. The Union respects that. Go on."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. The Union's filed a grievance. Talk."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 14, "Last time you lied. The lads remember. Make it good."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 15, "You shot at our miners, {them}. Union's furious. We'll talk. Briefly."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 15, "You attacked us. That's a strike-worthy offence. Speak."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 16, "You're winning, {them}? Good for you. Don't expect us to work overtime for it."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 16, "Top of the galaxy. Somebody always does the heavy lifting. Usually us."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 17, "Hey, {them}. You're all right. What do you need?"},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 17, "Good to hear from you. Union's happy. Talk."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 18, "The Union's not sure about you, {them}. Speak."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 18, "We'll hear you out. Then we'll vote on it."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 19, "Union says no, {them}. Talk, then clear off."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 19, "The lads don't like you, {them}. Make it short."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 20, "Right, {them}. Overtime it is. Fire up the drills - this won't take a full shift."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 20, "Clock in, crew. {them}'s fleet is today's job. Let's get it done before lunch."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 20, "Union says we get hazard pay for this, {them}. You're the hazard."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 21, "You hit our rigs, {them}? Union rules say we hit back. Hard."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 21, "Great. Now {them} wants a fight. As if the shift wasn't long enough."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 21, "Somebody tell {them} we've got drills that cut through rock. Hulls are easier."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 22, "Shift's landing, {them}. We'll dig you out like everything else."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 22, "Mining crews to the surface, {them}. We'll strip this world like any other seam."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 22, "New dig site, {them}. Sorry about your garrison - it's in the way of the ore."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 23, "This is our mine, {them}. You want it, you go through the whole Union."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 23, "Not one rock leaves this mine without a union stamp, {them}. That includes you."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 23, "You want to strike, {them}? Fine. The Union knows all about strikes."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 24, "You again, {them}? Last time cost us a whole shift. We're billing you for it."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex sits on a lot of good rock, {them}. Union's claiming every bit of it."},
    {"gledge", nullptr, 26, "You're hitting the Union hall, {them}? Every miner just dropped their pick and grabbed a cutter."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 0, "Friend, the Emirates bring a deal fit for a caravan of kings - good for you, good for us."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 0, "{them}! Come, let us trade. Hacan bargains are honest, and honest bargains make everyone rich."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 0, "Look at these terms. A Hacan does not offer scraps - only fair profit for both tables."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 1, "For a trusted partner, the Emirates open the best of the vaults. Take this deal with our blessing."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 2, "Business is better than war, friend - but the Emirates guard their trade routes. Agree, and keep your ships whole."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 3, "Votes are a currency like any other. Sell yours to the Emirates and the Council will favour us both."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 4, "Done! A fine bargain - the Emirates will sing of it in the markets."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 4, "Agreed, and well struck. May your holds stay full."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 5, "No, no. That deal leaves one side hungry, and a Hacan never dines alone."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 5, "My friend, the Emirates know value. This is not it."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 6, "Close, but not yet fair. Here - the Emirates have balanced the scales for you."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 7, "A merchant must follow profit, {them}, and the profit has moved. Nothing personal - only business."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you cheated the Emirates. Every market in the galaxy will hear your name, and none will trade with you."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 9, "Bad business, {them}, very bad business. The Emirates pay - and the Emirates never forget a bad trade."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 9, "Fine, fine, take it. But every merchant in the galaxy will hear what your word is worth."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 10, "Welcome, {them}! The Emirates' tent is open. Come, let us see what you carry."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 10, "Ah, a visitor. The Emirates always have time for a buyer - are you one, {them}?"},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour! The Emirates save the best prices for those who share our borders."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 11, "Our caravans pass your worlds every day, {them}. Good neighbours trade - shall we?"},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 12, "Back again, {them}? Good. The Emirates remember a profitable partner."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 12, "Our last bargain filled both holds. Let us do it again."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 13, "Your word has been good as gold, {them}. Gold is what the Emirates deal in - talk."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 13, "You kept your promise. In the markets, that is worth more than spice."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 14, "Ah, {them}. The last promise you sold us turned out to be sand. Show coin first this time."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Emirates. Every price you hear today has a little extra on it."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 15, "You shot at our caravans, {them}. Business can still be done - but the price has gone up."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 15, "Your ships fired on the Emirates. Still, a merchant talks to anyone. Even you."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 16, "The richest table in the galaxy comes to the Emirates? Then you can afford our prices, {them}."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 16, "You are winning, {them}. Winners pay full price - the Emirates insist."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 17, "{them}! Always a pleasure. Sit, sit - let us make each other rich."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 17, "For you, friend, the Emirates open the good vaults."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 18, "The Emirates are listening, {them}. Make it worth our while."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 18, "Hmm. Show us the deal, {them}. We will weigh it twice."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 19, "Speak quickly, {them}. The Emirates have little patience left for you."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 19, "You again. The Emirates trade with you only because coin has no smell."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 20, "Bad for business, this, {them} - but the Emirates protect their routes. Our guns are open for trade now."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 20, "Your fleet is blocking a trade lane, {them}. The Emirates are clearing it. Invoice to follow."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 20, "Nothing personal, {them} - a caravan must pass. Our guns are simply... expediting delivery."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 21, "You attack a Hacan caravan, {them}? Then you pay full price, and the Emirates never give discounts."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 21, "Attacking a lion's caravan, {them}? The price of that mistake just went up."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 21, "You want our cargo, {them}? It is not for sale. And it is very well guarded."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 22, "The Emirates are acquiring your world, {them}. A hostile acquisition - the terms were always on the table."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 22, "A new branch opens on your world, {them}. The Emirates' staff are landing now."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 22, "Consider this a takeover, {them}. A lion takes what it has paid for - with claws, if needed."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 23, "This market is closed to you, {them}. The lions of Hacan defend every stall of it!"},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 23, "Every stall in this market has a lion behind it, {them}. Each one will fight for it."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 23, "You thought you could take this world for free, {them}? Nothing in the Emirates is free."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 24, "Back again, {them}? Your last visit is still on our books - unpaid."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex, {them} - the greatest market in the galaxy. The Emirates will not be priced out of it."},
    {"hacan", nullptr, 26, "You bring your guns to the Emirates' own gates, {them}? Every lion in Hacan is roaring now."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 0, "Per our modelling, this reciprocal resource reallocation yields a non-trivial mutual surplus. In simple terms: a good deal."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 0, "{them}, the Universities have prepared a transactional framework. We kept the vocabulary small, for your benefit."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 0, "Our probabilistic analysis says acceptance is optimal for you. We would explain why, but the mathematics is rather advanced."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 1, "Your reliability has exceeded our baseline projections. Consequently, the Universities extend favourable terms."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 2, "We have quantified your position as untenable. Comply, or observe the empirical results of our weapons research."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 3, "Council legislation should be shaped by rigorous minds. Assign your votes to the Universities; we shall do the thinking."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 4, "Hypothesis confirmed: you are capable of rational decisions. Accepted."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. The data supports this outcome with high statistical confidence."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 5, "Rejected. Your proposal fails peer review on every conceivable metric."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 5, "Fascinating, in the way a malfunction is fascinating. No."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 6, "Elementary errors detected in your figures. We have corrected them. Please review the revised edition."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 7, "Updated models no longer favour this agreement, {them}. The partnership is concluded. Do take notes."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you have introduced an unacceptable variable. It will be isolated and removed. Thoroughly."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 9, "We have computed that compliance is presently optimal. We have also computed your eventual comeuppance, {them}."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 9, "Very well. Coercion is a crude methodology - your conduct has been archived for later analysis."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 10, "Greetings, {them}. The Universities have allocated a small window of attention to your inquiry."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 10, "A communication from {them}. How charming. Do proceed - slowly, if you please."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 11, "Our respective territories exhibit geographic contiguity, {them}. We are, in the vernacular, neighbours."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds lie adjacent to ours. We have studied them extensively. Please, speak."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 12, "Our previous exchange yielded mutually favourable outcomes. Replication is scientifically justified."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 12, "The data from our last bargain was encouraging, {them}. Let us repeat the experiment."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 13, "You honoured your commitment, {them}. A statistically notable behaviour among your kind."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 13, "Your reliability has been observed, recorded and peer-reviewed. Favourably."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Universities, {them}. The hypothesis \"you can be trusted\" has been rejected."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 14, "Your promise failed replication, {them}. We now apply a substantial error margin to everything you say."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 15, "Your aggression against our ships has been thoroughly documented, {them}. Speak - we are taking notes."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 15, "After your hostile experiment, we are surprised you initiate communication. Fascinating."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 16, "Our models indicate you lead the galaxy, {them}. Statistically, that is an unstable equilibrium."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. The Universities find this an interesting anomaly and intend to correct the sample."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 17, "{them}! One of the few intellects we enjoy conversing with. Please, go on."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 17, "The Universities regard you with what we would describe as positive affect. Speak."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 18, "We are still collecting data on you, {them}. Choose your words carefully - they will be analysed."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 18, "Your intentions remain unclassified. Proceed, and we will refine our models."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 19, "We have concluded you are a hazard, {them}. Please be brief."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 19, "The Universities' patience with you has been exhausted, as our equations predicted."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 20, "Commencing a live-fire experiment on {them} hulls. Hypothesis: they will not survive. Recording results."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 20, "Field trial beginning. {them} ships will serve as the control group. Survival not expected."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 20, "Our latest weapons need peer review, {them}. Your fleet has kindly volunteered."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 21, "{them} has initiated hostilities - a statistically unwise choice. Our weapons research thanks you for the data."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 21, "A research vessel under fire from {them}? How crude. Defensive countermeasures: deploying."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 21, "Fascinating, {them}. You have chosen violence. We have chosen superior physics."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 22, "A field study begins on your world, {them}. Specimens who resist will be catalogued posthumously."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 22, "Survey teams landing on your world, {them}. Please do not interfere with the experiment."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 22, "Your world shows promising research potential, {them}. Our lab is moving in."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 23, "Our planetary defences are peer-reviewed, {them}. Your assault is a deeply flawed methodology."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 23, "Every shield on this world was designed by tenured faculty, {them}. You are not on the faculty."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 23, "Your landing has been observed and modelled, {them}. The model says you lose."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 24, "We have studied our last encounter, {them}. The findings have been published. You will not enjoy them."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex is a site of immense academic interest, {them}. It requires proper supervision. Ours."},
    {"jolnar", nullptr, 26, "You attack the Universities themselves, {them}? Every lab in Jol-Nar just became an armoury."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 0, "Keleres to {them}, come in. We have a proposal for you. Review and respond, over."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 0, "Be advised, this offer is fair and on the record. Copy?"},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 0, "Routine request. Sign off on these terms and we all stay on patrol, not on lockdown."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 1, "You've kept a clean record with the Council. Consider this a courtesy from a friend on the force."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 2, "Comply with these terms. Failure to comply will be treated as hostile, and our units are cleared to respond."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 3, "Dispatch to all delegates - the Council needs a clean result. Back our call and we'll log your cooperation."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 4, "10-4. Deal confirmed."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 4, "Copy that. Terms accepted, logging it now."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 5, "Negative. Request denied."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 5, "That's a no-go. Offer rejected, over."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 6, "Can't approve those terms as written. Stand by for our revised offer and respond, over."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 7, "Attention, {them}. This agreement is void, effective immediately. Do not resist."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 8, "You just made yourself a hostile, {them}. All units, weapons free - self-defense authorized."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 9, "Copy, {them}. Complying under duress. Incident report filed - this is not over."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 9, "Affirmative, terms accepted. Be advised: your callsign is now on the watch list. All units, take note."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 10, "Keleres dispatch, go ahead {them}. State the nature of your business."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 10, "This is the Council Keleres. Channel open. Proceed, {them}."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 11, "You're in our patrol sector, {them}. Keep it clean and we'll keep it friendly."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour, copy. We see you on our scopes every shift. Go ahead."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 12, "Repeat business, {them}. Last transaction checked out clean. Proceed."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 12, "Our records show a previous agreement with you, no violations. Go ahead."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 13, "Your record is clean, {them}. Promises kept. Dispatch appreciates it."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 13, "Verified: you honoured your agreement. That goes in your file. The good part."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 14, "You have an outstanding violation, {them}: broken agreement with the Keleres. We'll hear you - on the record."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 14, "Dispatch flagged you for breach of promise, {them}. Proceed with caution."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 15, "You fired on Keleres units, {them}. That's a 10-33 on file. Make this good."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 15, "Assault on Council forces, logged. We'll talk. All units stay on standby."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 16, "You're leading the galaxy, {them}. The Council keeps a close eye on anyone that far ahead."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 16, "Status check: you're ahead. Expect regular patrols in your area."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 17, "Good to hear from you, {them}. Friends of the Council get priority. Go ahead."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 17, "Copy that, friend. The Keleres are glad to help."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 18, "Dispatch is monitoring you, {them}. Keep your hands where we can see them."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 18, "Proceed, {them}. Everything you say is going in the report."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 19, "You are a known threat to the Council, {them}. Say your piece. Units are standing by."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 19, "{them}, consider this a formal warning. State your business and clear the channel."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 20, "Dispatch, Keleres command - engaging {them} now. All units, weapons free."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 20, "All units, this is Keleres command. Suspect fleet {them} is resisting. Weapons free."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 20, "Keleres patrol to {them} - you are in violation. This is your only warning. Engaging."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 21, "Officers under fire! {them} has opened hostilities. Requesting full response - all units, converge."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 21, "10-33! 10-33! Shots fired by {them}! All Keleres units, respond!"},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 21, "Officer down, officer down! {them} has fired on the Council's patrol. Full response authorized."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 22, "Keleres strike team making planetfall on a {them} world. Suspects, lay down your weapons."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 22, "Tactical team deploying to a {them} world. Warrant in hand. Breaching now."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 22, "Keleres boots on the ground, {them}. Hands where we can see them!"},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 23, "Code 10-33, this world is under Council protection. {them} forces, you are ordered to stand down."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 23, "Perimeter established, {them}. This world is under Council jurisdiction. You will not pass."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 23, "Barricades are up, {them}. Any further advance will be treated as an act of war on the Council."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 24, "Repeat offender on scope - it's {them} again. Priors on file. No leniency this time."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 25, "Code red at the Council's seat, {them}. Mecatol Rex is under Keleres protection. Stand down or be removed."},
    {"keleres", nullptr, 26, "Keleres headquarters under attack by {them}! All units, all reserves - converge on home!"},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 0, "Hear the stone, {them}... Take this offer, and let both our worlds keep their forests a while longer."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 0, "A mountain is built... one pebble at a time. So is trust. Here... is our pebble."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 0, "Roots grow slowly... and live long. Agree to this, and let the green things grow in peace between us."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 1, "Old friend... the soil remembers your kindness. Take this, as the rain is given to the fields."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 2, "Draw your fleets back... the land there has suffered enough. Agree, or the mountain comes down upon you."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 3, "The Council is a river... it carves whatever lies before it. Let our votes flow together... and spare the fields."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 4, "So it shall be... carved in stone, where it will outlast us both."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 4, "Good. A wise choice spreads... like moss. Slowly... and everywhere."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 5, "No... A seed sown in poisoned soil bears poisoned fruit. We will not sow this one."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 5, "The stone has listened... and the stone does not move. Not for this."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 6, "Close... but uneven, like a cracked foundation. Here... set the stones this way instead."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 7, "Forgive us, {them}... even mountains shift, when the living world beneath them demands it."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 8, "You struck the stone, {them}... and the stone will remember, long after your fleets are dust."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 9, "Take it... The stone gives way... slowly. But it remembers every chisel, {them}."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 9, "So be it... Even mountains yield to the wind... and then they bury it."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 10, "Hear the stone... {them}. We have waited... a long time for a voice. Speak."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 10, "The mountain... listens, {them}. Speak slowly. We are in no hurry."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds... grow beside ours, {them}. Tend them well... and we will be good neighbours."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour... roots cross borders. Let ours grow together... not choke each other."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 12, "We have traded... before, {them}. The forest remembers kindness. Again."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 12, "Another bargain... like rain after rain. The soil is grateful."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word... {them}. A stone that does not crack. We honour that."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept... is a seed that grows. Speak."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word... {them}. A cracked stone lets the rot in. Speak... carefully."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 14, "Your promise... crumbled like dry earth. The mountain remembers."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 15, "You struck at us... {them}. The forest burned. The stone endures. Speak."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 15, "Your guns scarred living worlds... We will listen. We will not forget."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 16, "You stand tallest... {them}. The tallest tree... feels the wind most."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy... Do not let your roots grow shallow."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 17, "{them}... friend of the green. Speak."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 17, "The stone is warm... in your sun. Go on."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 18, "The mountain watches you... {them}. Slowly. Patiently."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 18, "Roots search the soil... before they trust it. Speak."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 19, "You are a blight... {them}. Speak... then leave our worlds be."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 19, "The stone is cold to you... {them}. Be brief."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 20, "You scar... the living worlds... {them}. The mountain... moves against you now."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 20, "The stars... are old, {them}. Your ships... are not. They will not... grow old."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 20, "Your fleet... poisons the void... {them}. We... will cleanse it."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 21, "You strike stone... {them}. Stone... does not break. Stone... waits."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 21, "Rain falls... on mountains, {them}... every day. The mountains... remain."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 21, "Your fire... cannot burn stone... {them}. Learn this... while you still can."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 22, "We descend... {them}... to heal what you have wounded. Stand aside... or be buried."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 22, "Like a landslide... {them}... slow at first... then everything."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 22, "Your world... cries out, {them}. We come... to answer it."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 23, "This land... is alive... {them}. It will not... let you poison it. Neither... will we."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 23, "Roots... and rock... hold this world, {them}. Neither... can be pulled up."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 23, "Patience... is the strength of stone, {them}. We... can wait... longer than you."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 24, "Again... {them}. Stone... remembers every blow. And returns it."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 25, "Even the throne world... is only a stone, {them}. Stones... belong to us."},
    {"khrask", nullptr, 26, "The oldest mountain... is our home, {them}. Feel it... wake."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 0, "Bah, haggling. Fine, {them} - take this deal and let us get back to the fighting."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 0, "The skalds sing of battles, not bargains. Still, here are our terms. Be quick about it."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 0, "Hear the Berserkers! We offer this, and we offer it once. Then we go back to sharpening our axes."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 1, "You fought well beside us, shield-friend. Take this, and may your saga be a long one."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 2, "Agree, or we come for you with fire and frost. Truly, we hope you refuse - it has been a dull season."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 3, "Council squabbling puts us to sleep. Give us your votes and we'll go find something worth fighting."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 4, "Ha! Agreed. Now pour the mead and let us speak of war instead."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 4, "So be it - sworn on the frozen halls of our fathers. Now leave us to our blades."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 5, "No. That offer is weaker than a thrall's handshake. Come back with steel in your voice."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 5, "Refused. Bring us a war, not a ledger - we nearly fell asleep."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 6, "Too soft. Take the Berserkers' terms, or take up arms. We would prefer the arms."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 7, "Our oath is broken, {them}, and our axes are out. Nothing personal - you will make a fine saga."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 8, "Oathbreaker! {them}, the skalds will sing of how you fell to us. Arm yourselves."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 9, "Take it, coward. A saga needs a villain, {them}, and you have just been written in."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 9, "Bah! We pay, and we will sing of it - a song about how you fell. Soon."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 10, "Hail, {them}! The Berserkers hear you. Better if you'd come with an axe, but speak."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 10, "You call the halls of Kjalengard, {them}? Speak loud, we are hard of hearing after battle."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds sit right beside our longhalls, {them}. Good! Close enemies make the best sagas."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour! We hear your engines across the border. They sound like a challenge."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 12, "You traded with us before, {them}. It was boring. But you were honest. Again, then."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 12, "Another bargain? Fine. Our skalds won't sing of it, but we'll make it."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 13, "You kept your oath, {them}. An oath kept is worth a saga. Speak, oath-keeper."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 13, "Your word held like a good shield. The Berserkers respect that."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 14, "You broke your oath to Kjalengard, {them}. Oathbreakers end up in the worst sagas."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 14, "A broken oath! Our grandchildren will spit your name. Speak, if you must."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 15, "You fought us, {them}! Glorious! A worthy battle. We still owe you a bloody nose."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 15, "You crossed blades with the Berserkers. We will sing of it - and of our revenge."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 16, "You are mightiest now, {them}. Every warrior in the galaxy wants your head. So do we."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 16, "You lead! A fine champion. Champions are for challenging."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 17, "{them}! Shield-friend! Come, sit by the fire and speak."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 17, "The halls cheer your name, friend. Talk."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 18, "We watch you, {them}. Not friend, not foe. Yet."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 18, "Speak plainly. The Berserkers have no patience for clever words."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 19, "You are a foe of Kjalengard, {them}. Speak before we grab our axes."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 19, "Talk, {them}. Then meet us on the battlefield."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 20, "At last, a fight! Ready your best, {them} - the skalds will sing of this day!"},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 20, "Sound the horns! {them}, you stand between us and a glorious death - yours!"},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 20, "Ha! A fleet worth fighting! {them}, may your end make a fine saga."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 21, "You come at us with axes drawn, {them}? Wonderful! It has been far too long."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 21, "You strike first, {them}? Good! Now the skalds have a beginning for the song!"},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 21, "Blood on the waves of space! {them}, we thank you for this gift!"},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 22, "We storm your shores, {them}! Fire in the sky, frost on the ground, glory everywhere!"},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 22, "Shields high, axes higher! {them}, your world will feel the frost of Kjalengard!"},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 22, "Down to the shore, brothers and sisters! {them} waits, and so does glory!"},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 23, "Come and take it, {them}! We have waited all season for a worthy fight!"},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 23, "Plant your feet, berserkers! {them} comes to our hall - let none of them leave!"},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 23, "Welcome to our hall, {them}! We have saved you a seat. It is in the ground."},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 24, "{them}! We fought before, and the saga was unfinished! Let us end it properly!"},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 25, "The throne world, {them}! What a place for a battle! The skalds will sing of this one forever!"},
    {"kjalengard", nullptr, 26, "You attack our homeland, {them}? Every warrior of Kjalengard rises now - even the old ones!"},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 0, "The Society takes an interest in {them}. A modest exchange, discreetly arranged - nothing anyone else needs to see."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 0, "What a curious offer we have for you. Consider it a gesture between collectors of fine things."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 0, "We prefer to deal quietly, away from prying eyes. These terms are quiet... and quite generous."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 1, "For a dear friend of the Society, terms we offer to very few. Do treasure them."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 2, "Accept, please. You cannot see all of our ships, and we would hate for you to meet the rest of them."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 3, "A vote is a small thing, easily misplaced. Lend us yours, and the Society will owe you a quiet favour."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 4, "Delightful. It shall go into the catalogue with care."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 4, "Accepted, quietly. No one else need know. They rarely do."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 5, "Hm. Not a piece we wish to collect. We decline, politely."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 5, "No, thank you. The Society has seen better offers in shadier places."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 6, "Almost worthy of the collection. We have adjusted the terms - discreetly, of course."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 7, "Did you think you were our partner, {them}? You were our acquisition. The fleet you never saw says hello."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 8, "How careless of you, {them}. The Society catalogues every slight... and collects on each one."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 9, "Very well, it is yours. We will simply add you to the collection, {them}... in time."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 9, "Take it. We are patient collectors, and every rare thing comes to us eventually."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 10, "Welcome, {them}. The Society is always pleased to meet a new... curiosity."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 10, "Ah, {them}. Do come in. Mind the exhibits. Some of them bite."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds lie close to our collection, {them}. Such interesting worlds. Rare, even."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. We admire your systems from afar. Admire them very much."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 12, "You have traded with the Society before, {them}. The pieces you gave us are well loved."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 12, "Another exchange? Our last acquisition from you was delightful."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. A rare quality. We collect rare qualities."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 13, "Reliable. How charming. Speak."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to us, {them}. Disappointing. We do keep records of such things."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise, {them}. It has been catalogued. Speak."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the Society's ships, {them}. We have more than you saw. Many more."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 15, "You damaged part of our collection. We are... displeased. Quietly."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. How rare. How valuable. We are watching closely."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 16, "The most precious thing in the galaxy right now may be you. Interesting."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 17, "Dear {them}. A treasured friend of the Society. Speak."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 17, "We are delighted, {them}. Do go on."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 18, "The Society is cautious with you, {them}. Speak."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 18, "We are still appraising you, {them}."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 19, "You are a flawed piece, {them}. Speak, then go."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 19, "The Society has no place for you, {them}. Be brief."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 20, "Such a rare little fleet, {them}. We simply must add it to the collection."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 20, "Oh, what a charming fleet, {them}. We have just the display case for it."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 20, "Pardon us, {them}. Our curators have marked your flagship as a must-have."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 21, "You struck at us, {them}? How rude. You did not see the rest of our ships... until now."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 21, "Rude, {them}. Very rude. And now you will see how many ships we keep in storage."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 21, "Attacking collectors, {them}? We always keep the finest guns for ourselves."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 22, "Your world holds such lovely treasures, {them}. Our curators are coming to collect them."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 22, "Acquisition teams are landing, {them}. Do mind the fragile pieces. Especially yourselves."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 22, "We have catalogued every treasure on your world, {them}. Now we simply take delivery."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 23, "Please do not touch the exhibits, {them}. Our guards are trained to handle vandals."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 23, "This world is part of our private collection, {them}. Admission is not available."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 23, "Hands off, {them}. Every piece here is priceless - and very well guarded."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 24, "Ah, {them}. We kept a souvenir from our last meeting. We would like a matching set."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex, {them} - the rarest piece in the galaxy. It must be ours. It simply must."},
    {"kollecc", nullptr, 26, "You have entered the vault itself, {them}. Few visitors see it. None of them leave with anything."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 0, "All things flow, {them}, even fleets and fortunes. Let this exchange flow between us in balance."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 0, "This one has meditated upon your needs and ours. The offer is the shape of that stillness."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 0, "Stars are born and stars go dark. In between, there is time for a fair exchange."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 1, "A friend is a quiet place in a loud universe. Accept this, with gratitude."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 2, "No conflict is sought. Yet even a stone in the river is moved in time. Step aside, or be moved."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 3, "Laws are ripples on the surface of a deep pool. Let your votes join ours, and the water will settle."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The circuit closes, and the balance is kept."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 4, "Yes. In agreement, as in silence, there is peace."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 5, "No. This path does not lead toward balance."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 5, "Declined, without anger. Let the offer pass, as clouds pass the moon."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 6, "Your offer is almost whole. This one has added what was missing - consider it."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 7, "All bonds are impermanent, {them}. Ours has reached its end. Do not cling to it."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 8, "You broke the bond, {them}. This one feels no anger, only clarity - and clarity sees you plainly now."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 9, "This one releases it. Attachment is suffering. Yet the river remembers the stone that dammed it, {them}."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 9, "Take it. Balance will return. Balance always returns... and sometimes it returns in force."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 10, "This one greets you, {them}. All things pass. This moment, too. Speak."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 10, "Peace, {them}. This one is listening, as the universe listens."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds lie beside ours, {them}. Like stones in a river, we share the current."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. This one sees your stars each cycle. Their light is welcome."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 12, "We have exchanged before, {them}. The wheel turns, and brings us here again."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 12, "Another exchange. Balance seeks balance. Speak."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Stillness and truth. This one is grateful."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept, like a candle that does not flicker. Speak."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. This one is not angry. This one is... cautious."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise disturbs the balance. Speak, and perhaps it can be restored."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 15, "You attacked this one, {them}. Pain passes. Memory remains. Speak."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 15, "Your guns found us. Even war is impermanent. Talk."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 16, "You rise high, {them}. All that rises must fall. This one wishes you a gentle fall."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy. The wheel turns for all."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 17, "{them}. This one is at peace with you. Speak."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 17, "Friend. The balance between us is good."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 18, "This one watches, {them}. Calmly. Carefully."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 18, "Your path is not yet clear to this one. Speak."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 19, "There is no balance between us, {them}. Speak."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 19, "This one seeks distance from you, {them}. Be brief."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 20, "This one takes no joy in it, {them}. The river moves, and today it moves through you."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 20, "All fleets dissolve in time, {them}. Yours dissolves today. This one does not rejoice."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 20, "The wheel turns, {them}, and your ships lie under it."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 21, "You bring violence to stillness, {them}. Stillness answers. Balance will return."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 21, "Anger is a storm, {them}. Storms pass. This one remains when you have passed."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 21, "You strike, and the universe answers, {them}. Today it answers through this one."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 22, "This one descends to your world, {them}. All things change hands in time. Today is that time."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 22, "Nothing belongs to anyone for long, {them}. This world passes to us now."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 22, "Silently, this one descends, {them}. Listen. That stillness is your garrison falling."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 23, "This one remains, {them}, as the mountain remains. Strike, and learn what stillness is."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 23, "Be still, {them}. The ground here has seen a thousand invaders, and remembers none of them."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 23, "Breathe, {them}. Then turn back. Nothing here is worth your ending."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 24, "We meet again, {them}. All things return. Even this. Especially this."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 25, "The throne is only a chair, {them}. Yet so many fall for it. Today, it is your turn to fall."},
    {"kolume", nullptr, 26, "Even the quiet temple must be defended, {them}. Balance asks this of this one."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 0, "The Tribunal summons {them} to terms. Hear the proposal, and answer before the court."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 0, "By the Queen's leave, we set this agreement before you. The Tribunal judges it fair."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 0, "Justice and profit need not quarrel. This offer serves both, as the Queen intends."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 1, "You stand in good standing before the Tribunal. The Queen extends her favour - accept it."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 2, "The verdict is already written: comply, or the sentence will be carried out by our fleets."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 3, "The Council is a lesser court, but a court still. Vote as the Tribunal rules, and the Queen will remember."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 4, "The court accepts. Let it be entered into the record."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 4, "Approved, by order of the Queen. See that you honour it."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 5, "Rejected. The Tribunal finds your offer wanting."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 5, "Denied. Your petition has no merit before this court."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 6, "Amended by the court: these are the corrected terms, and the ruling is final."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 7, "Your case has been reviewed, {them}. The verdict is guilty, and the sentence begins now."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 8, "Oathbreaker! {them}, you stand accused before the Queen, and the Tribunal will see you punished."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 9, "The Tribunal yields - for now. Your conduct is entered into the record, {them}. Judgement will follow."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 9, "Take it. Extortion is a crime, and the Queen's courts are very patient."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 10, "The Tribunal is in session, {them}. State your case."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 10, "You stand before the Kortali, {them}. Speak, and be judged."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds fall within our jurisdiction, {them}. Conduct yourselves accordingly."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. The Queen's law reaches your borders. Remember that."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 12, "Our records show prior agreements with you, {them}. All lawful. Proceed."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 12, "The Tribunal has dealt with you before. Fairly. Continue."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 13, "You honoured your word, {them}. The Tribunal finds you lawful."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 13, "Your record shows promises kept. Noted in your favour."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 14, "You stand accused of a broken promise, {them}. Your defence had better be strong."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 14, "The Tribunal has not forgotten your breach of faith. Speak."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the Queen's forces, {them}. The charge is grave. Speak."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 15, "An assault on the Kortali. Sentence is pending. Your statement, please."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. The Tribunal watches the powerful most closely."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 16, "Great power, great scrutiny. Proceed."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 17, "The Tribunal looks kindly on you, {them}. Speak freely."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 17, "A citizen in good standing. Proceed, {them}."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 18, "You are under review, {them}. Speak carefully."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 18, "The Tribunal has not reached a verdict on you yet."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 19, "The Tribunal finds you guilty, {them}. Your last words?"},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 19, "You stand condemned before the Queen, {them}. Speak."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 20, "The court finds you guilty, {them}. Sentence: destruction. It is carried out now."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 20, "Order in the void! {them}, you are charged with trespass. Judgement follows immediately."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 20, "The verdict was reached before you arrived, {them}. We are here to carry it out."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 21, "Assault on the Tribunal, {them}. The verdict is swift, and it is final."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 21, "You attack the court itself, {them}? Contempt. The penalty is severe."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 21, "Let the record show, {them}: you struck first. Let it also show what came next."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 22, "The Queen's judgement descends upon your world, {them}. The guilty will be punished."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 22, "Bailiffs of the Tribunal are landing, {them}. Your world will answer for its crimes."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 22, "A warrant from the Queen, {them}. It names your world. Our soldiers are serving it."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 23, "This world is under the Queen's law, {them}. Trespass here is a capital offence."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 23, "No appeal, {them}. This world stays under the Queen's protection."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 23, "Trespassers on this world are tried on the spot, {them}. The court is in session."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 24, "A repeat offender, {them}. The court remembers your case. The sentence doubles."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex will be the Queen's courthouse, {them}. You will be its first case."},
    {"kortali", nullptr, 26, "You bring war to the Queen's own court, {them}? There is no crime greater. There is no mercy left."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 0, "Come closer, {them}. Our gift spreads to all who trade with us - and it is the finest gift there is."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 0, "The Sodality offers this freely, as we offer everything. Freely, and to everyone."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 0, "Every deal is a handshake, and every handshake carries a blessing. Shall we shake?"},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 1, "You have been so good to us. When the plague reaches your worlds, we will make certain it is gentle."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 2, "Do as we ask, and your planets stay clean a while longer. Refuse, and our next pilgrimage begins with you."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 3, "Let us raise our votes together in the Council. The faithful are always the last to fall ill."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 4, "Blessed! The pact is sealed - and so, in a way, are you."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 4, "Wonderful. We will sing of your generosity when the fever comes."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 5, "No. The faithful do not barter away the gift for so little."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 5, "Refused. Keep your offer - we will take what we need once your worlds lie feverish."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 6, "Not quite. Let us... adjust the dose. These terms will go down much easier."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 7, "Forgive us, {them}. The plague must spread, and you were standing far too close."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 8, "Faithless {them}! Then you shall have the gift in full measure, every last drop."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 9, "Take it, with our blessing. And with something else, {them}. You will feel it soon."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 9, "We yield. Our next pilgrimage has found its first destination. How lucky for you."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 10, "Blessings of the sodality upon you, {them}! Speak - and breathe deeply."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 10, "Welcome, {them}! The Kyro are honoured to hear you. Our gift is always ready."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds are so close to ours, {them}. Our blessing travels well on the wind."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour! The plague-priests pray for you daily. Soon you may share the gift."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 12, "You traded with us before, {them}, and you are still well. A shame. Again?"},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 12, "Another bargain! Our last brought joy to both our peoples. Mostly ours."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Faithful as the fever. We bless you."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept. The sodality will remember you in its hymns."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. Liars are first to receive the gift. Speak."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise... we will pray for your recovery. Or not."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the sodality, {them}. Our wounds weep with blessing. Speak."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 15, "You fought the Kyro. Our sickness spreads in every battle. Thank you."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}! So many worlds, so many to share our blessing with."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. Plagues love a crowd. Speak."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 17, "Dear {them}! We will save our finest blessing for you."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 17, "Friend of the sodality! Speak, and be blessed."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 18, "We watch you, {them}. Your health concerns us."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 18, "Speak. We are deciding whether you are ready for the gift."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 19, "You will receive the gift soon, {them}. Speak while you can."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 19, "The sodality prays for your sickness, {them}. Be brief."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 20, "Blessings, {them}! The plague-fleet comes to share its gifts with you. Hold still!"},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 20, "Rejoice, {them}! The holy fever comes to your fleet! Every crew will be blessed!"},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 20, "Open your hatches, {them}. We bring gifts. Coughing gifts."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 21, "You attack the pilgrims, {them}? How kind - now we can share our blessing up close."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 21, "You fire at the faithful, {them}? Then come closer, and receive the blessing."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 21, "Such passion, {them}! You will make a wonderful convert, once the fever takes you."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 22, "Our pilgrimage reaches your world, {them}! Every soul there will be anointed."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 22, "The sodality lands, {them}! Hymns, incense and a very contagious joy!"},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 22, "Your world will be anointed, {them}. Every soul. Whether they like it or not."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 23, "Come and take this blessed world, {them}. Breathe deep - the air here is a gift."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 23, "Holy ground, {them}. Breathe it in. Breathe it all in."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 23, "Every soldier you land, {them}, we will welcome with an embrace. A long, feverish embrace."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 24, "You survived our last blessing, {them}? Remarkable. Let us try a stronger one."},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex, {them} - so many souls in one place! The blessing will spread so quickly!"},
    {"kyro", nullptr, 26, "You have come to the holy sanctuary, {them}! Stay. Pray. Catch something."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 0, "The Lazax permit an exchange. Comply, pawn, and your usefulness will be extended."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 0, "{them}, another subject of the empire. Your tribute has been calculated. Submit it."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 0, "These are the terms of the true Lazax. Negotiation is a courtesy we rarely extend."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 1, "Your obedience has been logged as exemplary. The empire grants you favourable terms, subject."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 2, "Withdraw. The Lazax reclaim what is theirs, and resistance will be converted into compliance."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 3, "An empty throne room - that is your Council. Your votes belong to the Lazax. Surrender them."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 4, "Acceptable. The pawn behaves as designed."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 4, "Compliance registered. The empire is satisfied, for now."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 5, "Rejected. A subject does not dictate terms to the Lazax."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 5, "Insufficient. Grovel harder, and bring a better offer."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 6, "Defective proposal. The Lazax have corrected it. Comply with these terms."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 7, "Function complete, {them}. The empire no longer requires this agreement, or you."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 8, "{them}, defiance detected. Rebellious subjects are crushed. The Lazax will reclaim you by force."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 9, "Concession logged. The Lazax will reclaim this, {them}, along with everything else you hold."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 9, "Temporary compliance authorized. Your designation has been entered in the subjugation queue."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 10, "Channel open. The Lazax will hear the petition of {them}."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 10, "Subject {them} has requested an audience with the Lazax. Granted. Proceed."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 11, "Your territory touches the Lazax border, {them}. Adjacency logged. Speak."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 11, "Proximity noted. Neighbouring subjects may petition the Lazax."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 12, "Previous transaction with {them}: satisfactory. The Lazax authorise repetition."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 12, "Your last offering was accepted. The Lazax permit another."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 13, "Compliance record of {them}: promises honoured. Acceptable to the Lazax."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word. The Lazax approve of predictable subjects."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 14, "Record: {them} broke an agreement with the Lazax. Trust value reduced to zero."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 14, "Breach of promise detected. The Lazax will hear you. The Lazax will not believe you."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 15, "Your fleet's interference was logged, {them}. The Lazax will hear your offer. Briefly."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 15, "Hostile action by {them} recorded by the Lazax. Retaliation scheduled. Speak while you can."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 16, "Projection: {them} leads the galaxy. The Lazax find this incorrect. State your offer."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 16, "Your lead is an anomaly, {them}. The Lazax correct anomalies."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 17, "Subject {them} rated cooperative. The Lazax offer favourable terms."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 17, "The Lazax look upon {them} with approval. Rare. Proceed."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 18, "The Lazax are evaluating {them}. Evaluation incomplete."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 18, "Proceed with caution, {them}. Your file is open before the Lazax."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 19, "{them}. Your existence is tolerated by the Lazax. Barely. Speak."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 19, "Hostility toward {them}: high. The Lazax will close this channel soon."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 20, "The Lazax reclaim this sector. {them} vessels are designated obsolete. Engaging."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 20, "{them} fleet identified. Threat level: negligible. The Lazax will dispose of it."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 20, "Sector reclamation in progress. {them} vessels are an obstruction. Removing obstruction."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 21, "Hostile action by {them} registered. Response: annihilation. The Lazax do not negotiate with targets."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 21, "Weapons fire from {them} detected. Calculating response. Result: total destruction."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 21, "Damage sustained. Irrelevant. The Lazax fleet will repair. The {them} fleet will not."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 22, "Ground assault initiated. The {them} population will be processed into compliance."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 22, "Deploying ground units. {them} defenders will be catalogued, then corrected."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 22, "Return of the Lazax to this world confirmed. The {them} occupants are an error. Error correction begins."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 23, "This world belongs to the Lazax. {them} forces will be converted or erased."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 23, "{them} landing detected. This world is Lazax property. Trespassers will be dismantled."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 23, "Ground defence active. Every {them} soldier is a resource. Resources will be harvested."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 24, "{them} profile retrieved. Previous engagement analysed. Weaknesses mapped. Proceeding."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex is the seat of the Lazax. {them} presence here is an insult. The insult will be deleted."},
    {"l1z1x", nullptr, 26, "Alert: {them} at the Lazax core. All units, priority override. Destroy."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 0, "We have lost much, {them}, and learned to build from fragments. Let this deal be one more piece."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 0, "The Remnants keep a long record of those who helped us rise again. We would gladly add your name."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 0, "A fallen people learns to trade carefully. We believe this is fair - may it be remembered so."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 1, "Few stood with us after the fall. You have. Take this, and know it is written in our histories."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 2, "One civilization has already fallen before our eyes. Do as we ask, or yours becomes the next ruin we sift through."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 3, "The Council decides which stories the galaxy will tell. Let our votes write this one together."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. Another fragment set in its place - the rebuilding goes on."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The chroniclers will record it as a good day for both our peoples."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 5, "No. We have rebuilt from ruins too many times to accept so little."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 5, "We decline. Some pieces simply do not fit what we are building."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 6, "Not as it stands. History taught us to measure twice - here are terms that will hold."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 7, "This page of our story ends here, {them}. The Remnants must survive, whatever the cost."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 8, "We will write this down, {them}. Every word of it. The Remnants never forget a betrayal."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 9, "Take it. We have lost far more than this, {them}. We have also outlasted those who took it."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 9, "So it goes. This page of the chronicle bears your name now - and not kindly."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 10, "The remnant hears you, {them}. Let this meeting be written in our chronicles."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 10, "Speak, {them}. Every conversation is a page of history. Let this one be kind."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds lie close to our ruins, {them}. Be good neighbours to the last of us."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. Our chronicles record those who live beside us. Be worth remembering."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 12, "You have traded with the Lanefir before, {them}. It was a good chapter. Another?"},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 12, "We remember our last deal fondly. Let us write another."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. The chroniclers will speak well of you."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept, as the great ones once kept theirs. Speak."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to us, {them}. It is recorded. The record is long."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise, {them}. We have lost too much to forgive easily."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 15, "You attacked what remains of us, {them}. We have seen empires fall for less."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 15, "Your guns touched the last of the Lanefir. We will hear you. Grieving."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. Our ancestors led once. Learn from how it ended."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. History is full of leaders. Few are remembered kindly."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 17, "{them}, a friend in our chronicles. Speak."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 17, "The remnant welcomes you, friend."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 18, "The chronicles are undecided on you, {them}."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 18, "Speak. We will decide how you are remembered."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 19, "You will be written as an enemy, {them}. Speak."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 19, "The remnant has no welcome for you, {them}. Be brief."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 20, "We have watched a civilization fall before, {them}. Today we write a new chapter - and yours ends here."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 20, "Another chapter of war begins, {them}. Let us make yours a short one."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 20, "The chronicle demands this battle, {them}. We will write it in your wreckage."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 21, "Strike us, {them}, and the chronicle grows another page of ruin. We have written many."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 21, "You strike at the last of a lost people, {them}. We have little left. We will fight for all of it."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 21, "Every war we write down, {them}, ends with the same lesson. You will learn it now."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 22, "We land on your world, {them}, to salvage what can still be saved. Resist, and nothing will be."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 22, "Chroniclers descend upon your world, {them}. It will be a page in our history now."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 22, "Lost worlds haunt us, {them}. Today we take one back."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 23, "These ruins are all that remain of us, {them}. We will not lose them twice."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 23, "The memory of our people lives on this world, {them}. You will not erase it."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 23, "Our ancestors held their ground until the end, {them}. We are their descendants."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 24, "We wrote of our last battle with you, {them}. The ending was left blank. We will fill it in now."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex has seen empires rise and fall, {them}. We will not let the throne fall to you."},
    {"lanefir", nullptr, 26, "These are the last halls of our people, {them}. We will not write their ending today."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 0, "The Barony extends an offer. Consider it a kindness - we so rarely bother with lesser powers."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 0, "{them}, we have drafted terms suited to your... modest circumstances. Do try to keep up."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 0, "A proposal, from your betters. Accept graciously and we may even remember your name."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 1, "You have proven unusually reliable. The Barony rewards such a rare quality - these terms are generous, by our standards."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 2, "We would hate for your fleets to suffer an unfortunate accident. Accept these terms, and they will not."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 3, "Firm direction is what the Council lacks. Lend the Barony your votes; obedience is far less tiring than thinking."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 4, "Acceptable. You show a surprising grasp of your place."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 4, "Very well. The Barony is pleased - savour it, it does not happen often."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 5, "No. The Barony does not haggle with those beneath it."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 5, "How quaint. You mistake our patience for interest. Declined."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 6, "Your offer is beneath us, but we are feeling generous. Here is what a proper arrangement looks like."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 7, "Did you truly believe a Baron's word could bind him to the likes of you, {them}? How charming."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you have embarrassed yourself. The Barony keeps very long ledgers, and yours is now closed."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 9, "Take it, then. The Barony keeps very long ledgers, {them}, and this debt is now written in ink."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 9, "How crude, to settle things with threats. Enjoy your prize. Such vulgarity is always repaid with interest."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 10, "Ah, {them}. The Barony grants you an audience. Do mind your manners."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 10, "How refreshing - a petitioner. The Barony is listening, {them}. Briefly."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 11, "We share a border, {them}. The Barony prefers its neighbours polite... and well within their own lines."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 11, "Our fleets can see your worlds from our windows. Let us keep this neighbourly, shall we?"},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 12, "Our last arrangement was acceptable, {them}. The Barony is willing to be generous again."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 12, "You have dealt with the Barony before and lived to profit by it. Do continue."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word to the Barony. How unexpectedly civilised of you, {them}."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 13, "A promise honoured. The Barony notes such things - it may even reward them."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 14, "{them}. You broke your word to the Barony. We are, of course, far too refined to mention it twice."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 14, "The Barony remembers every broken promise, and yours is framed on our wall."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 15, "You fired on the Barony's fleet, {them}. How bold. How very expensive that will prove."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 15, "After your little attack, the Barony is surprised you dare to call. Amused, but surprised."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 16, "You are winning, {them}. The Barony finds that most irregular, and irregularities are corrected."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 16, "The galaxy's foremost power is, naturally, the Barony. You appear to have forgotten that."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 17, "{them}, a pleasure. The Barony counts you among its more tolerable acquaintances."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 17, "For you, the Barony will set aside a little of its disdain. Do speak."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 18, "The Barony is watching you, {them}. Choose your words as carefully as your manners."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 18, "We have not decided what you are to us yet. Make a good impression."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 19, "You again, {them}. The Barony's patience is a courtesy, and courtesies end."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 19, "Speak, {them}, and then be gone. The Barony has better company to keep."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 20, "The Barony's fleet will now correct your presence here, {them}. Do try to die with some dignity."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 20, "Ah, {them}. The Barony requires this sector tidied, and you are the clutter. Gunners, if you please."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 20, "Do hold still, {them}. Our dreadnoughts are terribly expensive, and we dislike wasting a shot."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 21, "You dare raise guns at the Barony, {them}? How tiresome. Our dreadnoughts have been longing for exercise."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 21, "An attack, {them}? On us? Your audacity is almost charming. Almost."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 21, "How very common of you, {them}. The Barony will now demonstrate what breeding does in a war."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 22, "Your world will make a fine estate, {them}. Kindly tell your garrison to kneel; it saves us the paperwork."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 22, "Our regiments are landing, {them}. Do have your garrison assemble in neat rows; we shall be brief."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 22, "Annexation is under way, {them}. The Barony will see your world properly governed - for once."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 23, "Lesser troops on Barony soil, {them}? Our garrison will teach you the meaning of rank."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 23, "You land on Barony soil without an invitation, {them}? Our garrison will see you out. In pieces."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 23, "These walls were raised by the Barony, {them}. They have outlasted far grander fools than you."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 24, "You return, {them}? How tedious. The Barony had hoped you learned your place the first time."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 25, "The throne world, {them}. It was always meant for a ruler of quality. Step aside for the Barony."},
    {"letnev", nullptr, 26, "You bring war to the Barony's own doorstep, {them}? Unforgivable. Every gun we own now points at you."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 0, "A gift for you, {them}, wrapped with care. Do open it gently - the Dynasty is so fond of surprises."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 0, "Such an honest offer. Truly. Look it over as long as you like; you will find nothing amiss."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 0, "Our court extends its warmest regards, and this modest proposal. What could be safer?"},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 1, "For a friend of the Dynasty, no tricks - well, fewer tricks. Please, accept this with our affection."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 2, "Of course you may refuse. Do mind where you step afterward; our worlds have such uneven floors."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 3, "A small matter of the Council's votes. Stand with us, and your seat will not, ah, collapse beneath you."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 4, "Delightful! Everything is exactly where it ought to be. For now."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 4, "Accepted, with a bow. You have chosen the safe path - this time."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 5, "How kind, but no. The Dynasty prefers the bait to sit on the other side of the trap."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 5, "We must politely refuse. Something about it smells like one of our own tricks."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 6, "Almost charming. Allow us to rearrange the pieces slightly - we know where they fit best."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 7, "Oh, {them}, did you think the floor was solid? Nothing in the Dynasty's house ever is."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 8, "Clever, {them}. Truly. But you stand on our ground now - and it was trapped long before you came."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 9, "Of course, take it, with our compliments. Do watch your step from now on, {them}."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 9, "How gracious of you to insist. We do so love a guest who will be coming back."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 10, "Oh, {them}! What a delight. Do sit. The cushion is perfectly safe. Probably."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 10, "Welcome, {them}. The Dynasty bows to you. Deeply. Watch your feet."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 11, "You live so near, {them}! Neighbours share everything. Secrets, especially."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 11, "Dear neighbour! We've admired your worlds for so long. Up close, too."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 12, "You traded with us before, {them}, and came out smiling. How lucky for you."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 12, "Back for more! Our last deal was such fun. For us, at least."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. How very honourable. How very predictable."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept! We do admire that. It makes you so easy to read."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}? Oh, how naughty. We do love a fellow trickster."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 14, "Tsk. A broken promise. We will smile at you, {them} - with all our teeth."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 15, "You attacked us, {them}. Rude! We will forgive you. Eventually. Surprisingly."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 15, "You fought the Dynasty. We bowed, we smiled, and we remembered."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}! How marvellous. And how very far there is to fall."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 16, "You're ahead! We'll hold your hand all the way down."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 17, "Darling {them}! Truly, we have no tricks for you today. Truly."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 17, "For you, friend, only small traps. Speak."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 18, "We're watching you, {them}. Smiling, but watching."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 18, "Speak, {them}. We're still deciding which trap suits you."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 19, "Oh, {them}. The courtesies are over. Speak."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 19, "We smile because we have plans for you, {them}. Talk."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 20, "Ah, {them}, what a delightful meeting! Do mind the trap - oh. Too late."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 20, "Do come in, {them}! Oh dear - did nobody mention the minefield?"},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 20, "What a pleasure, {them}! We have arranged a little surprise. Several, in fact."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 21, "You attacked us, {them}? How charming. And exactly as we hoped you would."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 21, "How thoughtful of you to attack, {them}! Our traps were getting so lonely."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 21, "Oh no, {them}, you found us! However will we... ah, there it is. The trap."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 22, "We drop in unannounced, {them} - so rude, we know. You'll find the welcome... surprising."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 22, "A small courtesy visit to your world, {them}. Please ignore the explosions."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 22, "We hope you don't mind guests, {them}. We brought gifts. They are ticking."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 23, "Of course you may land here, {them}. We prepared the floor especially for you."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 23, "Welcome, welcome, {them}! Do watch your step. And the next one. And the one after that."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 23, "Please, make yourselves at home, {them}. The floor is ever so comfortable. And ever so hollow."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 24, "Back so soon, {them}? We saved you a very special trap from last time. We improved it."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex, {them}! Such a grand stage. A shame if something... happened to it while you stood there."},
    {"lizho", nullptr, 26, "You found our home, {them}! How lovely. We spent years preparing for your visit."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 0, "{them}. We ruled these stars before the Lazax had a name. Accept our terms, and you may keep what little you hold."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 0, "Kneel to these terms. It is a kindness - we do not usually ask."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 0, "This is not a bargain. It is a decree, softened for small ears. Take it, and be grateful we spoke at all."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 1, "Loyal servants are rewarded, and you have served us well. Take this, and never forget whose favor you enjoy."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 2, "Submit to our terms, or we will take your will from you, as we have taken it from far greater kings."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 3, "The Council is a child's game, and we were old when it began. Your votes belong to us on this agenda - give them gladly."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 4, "Acceptable. You know your place."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 4, "Wise. Submission suits you."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 5, "Crumbs? You dare offer us crumbs? Refused."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 5, "No. A king does not haggle with its subjects."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 6, "Your offer is an insult, but we are generous. These are our terms - accept them, and kneel."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 7, "Did you think we were equals, {them}? Kings keep their word only to other kings."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 8, "You raise your hand against your betters, {them}? We will take your will and wear it like a crown."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 9, "You dare? Take it, then. Kings have bent our will before, {them}, and none of them still wear crowns."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 9, "We yield this - a trifle. We do not yield our memory. Your will shall be ours in the end."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 10, "We permit you to address us, {them}. Kneel in spirit, if not in body."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 10, "The Gene-Sorcerers hear you, {them}. Be worthy of our attention."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds lie at the edge of our dominion, {them}. Everything there will be ours in time."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. We prefer the word \"subject\". You will learn it."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 12, "You have served us in trade before, {them}. Serve again."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 12, "Our last command - forgive us, our last arrangement - pleased us. Continue."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word to us, {them}. Obedience suits you."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 13, "A promise honoured. We reward loyal servants. Speak."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Mahact, {them}. Kings have been unmade for less."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 14, "A lie to the Sorcerer-Kings, {them}. We are curious what you think it will cost."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 15, "You raised arms against us, {them}. We ruled before the Lazax. We will rule after you."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 15, "Your rebellion was noted. Its failure, also. Speak, subject."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}? You merely keep our throne warm."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. How amusing. The galaxy is ours by older right."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 17, "{them}, a favoured servant. We will hear you kindly."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 17, "We are pleased with you, {them}. Rarely do we say so."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 18, "We weigh you, {them}. Servant, or rebel? Choose well."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 18, "Speak. We have not yet decided what to make of you."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 19, "You displease us, {them}. Speak, then begone from our sight."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 19, "Your defiance bores us, {them}. Be brief, before we lose patience."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 20, "Kneel, {them}. Your fleet is ours to break, as we broke kings before you."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 20, "Your fleet is already ours, {them}. It simply does not know it yet."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 20, "Bow, {them}. The Gene-Sorcerers have returned, and the galaxy will kneel again."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 21, "You raise your hand against us, {them}? We will take that hand, and the will behind it."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 21, "You dare strike the Mahact, {them}? We will make your own crews turn their guns on you."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 21, "Your rebellion amuses us, {them}. It will not last."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 22, "We claim your world, {them}. Your people will learn the obedience their ancestors forgot."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 22, "Our will descends upon your world, {them}. Your soldiers will salute us by nightfall."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 22, "The Mahact take what was always theirs, {them}. Your people will remember their masters."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 23, "You set foot in our domain, {them}? We will bend your soldiers' minds until they fight for us."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 23, "Every soldier you land here, {them}, will be ours by morning. Send more."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 23, "This world kneels to the Mahact, {them}. So will you."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 24, "You defy us again, {them}? This time we take more than your fleet. We take your will."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 25, "We ruled the galaxy before the Lazax ever sat on Mecatol Rex, {them}. We are only taking back our throne."},
    {"mahact", nullptr, 26, "You trespass in the house of the Sorcerers, {them}. Here, even your thoughts belong to us."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 0, "Nice cargo you've got. Pay the Coalition's fee and it stays yours - mostly."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 0, "{them}, this is a toll. Everyone pays the Coalition eventually. The smart ones pay early."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 0, "Here's how it works: you give us a little, we don't take a lot. Fair, by pirate standards."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 1, "You've been square with us, and the Coalition respects that. No tricks, no toll - honest terms, friend."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 2, "Clear out, or we strip your ships to the frames and sell the parts back to you."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 3, "Votes are just loot with paperwork. Hand yours over and the Coalition will make it worth your while."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 4, "Pleasure doing business. The Coalition never forgets a good payer."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 4, "Ha! Deal. You just made a ship full of pirates very happy."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 5, "That's not a deal, that's an insult. The Coalition takes - it doesn't get taken."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 5, "Pass. You're asking pirates to be honest, and we only do that for friends."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 6, "Cute offer. Here's the real one - the Coalition's cut is already built in."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 7, "Did you forget who you were dealing with, {them}? Pirates, friend. What's yours is ours now."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you crossed the Coalition. By tomorrow every raider in the galaxy will know your shipping lanes."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 9, "Heh. Shaking down pirates, {them}? Bold. Take it - but sleep with one eye open from now on."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 9, "Fine, it's yours. Funny thing about loot: it never stays where you put it."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 10, "Well, well. {them} comes calling. The Coalition's always open for business - at a price."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 10, "A new mark - sorry, partner. What've you got for the Coalition, {them}?"},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 11, "We park right next door, {them}. Friendly neighbours get fewer raids. Just saying."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 11, "You're close enough to rob, neighbour - so let's keep things friendly, eh?"},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 12, "You again, {them}? Last deal paid out nicely. Let's see if you've still got it."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 12, "You played straight with us before. Pirates respect that. Mostly."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word to a pirate, {them}. That's rarer than you'd think. Respect."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept. The Coalition's ledger says you're good for it."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 14, "{them}. You stiffed the Coalition. In our line of work, that's a debt with interest."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to pirates. Bold. Very bold. The price just doubled."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 15, "You shot up our ships, {them}. No hard feelings - just hard bargaining from here on."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 15, "Took a swing at the Coalition and now you want to deal? I like your nerve."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 16, "Top of the galaxy, {them}? Big treasure ship. Everybody's going to want a piece of it."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 16, "You're winning. Funny - winners are exactly the ones pirates like to visit."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 17, "{them}! Pull up a crate, friend. The Coalition always cuts its friends a fair share."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 17, "For you, the Coalition keeps the cannons cold. Talk."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 18, "Talk, {them}. The Coalition's listening with one hand on the trigger."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 18, "Let's see your cargo first, {them}. Then we'll see about trust."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 19, "Make it quick, {them}. The Coalition's itching for an excuse."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 19, "You've got some nerve calling us. Go on - entertain us before we board you."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 20, "Nice cargo you've got there, {them}. Mind if we take it? Too late - we're boarding!"},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 20, "Hold it right there, {them}! This is a robbery. Hand over the ships and nobody gets spaced. Much."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 20, "Fresh hulls on the scanner, {them}! Lads, we've found our payday!"},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 21, "You picked a fight with the Coalition, {them}? Bold. We'll salvage whatever's left of you."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 21, "Oh, you want to rob the robbers, {them}? Cute. Let's dance."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 21, "Ambushing pirates, {them}? We invented that trick. Watch how it's done."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 22, "Raiding party's going down, {them}! Anything not bolted to the planet is ours."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 22, "Shore leave, lads! {them}, keep your valuables close - it won't help."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 22, "Every vault on your world just got a new owner, {them}. Us!"},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 23, "You want this rock, {them}? Pirates don't hand over their stash without a scrap."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 23, "You're trying to steal from pirates, {them}? Everyone's a comedian."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 23, "This rock's our hideout, {them}. Hideouts come with traps. Lots of traps."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 24, "Well, well, {them}. Back for another beating? We kept your stuff from last time."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 25, "The richest rock in the galaxy, {them}! And here we are, with empty pockets. Let's fix that."},
    {"mentak", nullptr, 26, "You came to the Coalition's own docks, {them}? Brave. Stupid, but brave."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 0, "Good day, {them}. The Protectorate has prepared an arrangement for your safety. Please review it."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 0, "Our headpieces have assessed your situation. This offer will reduce your risk considerably."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 0, "Please remain calm. This proposal is standard, fair, and backed by a very large number of guns."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 1, "Valued partner, your file is marked preferred. This arrangement includes our full protection."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 2, "For your safety, please comply. Our drones are already in position to assist with any non-compliance."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 3, "The Protectorate proposes a voting arrangement in the Council. A stable galaxy is a safe galaxy."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 4, "Thank you. Your cooperation has been logged. Have a secure day."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The headpiece approves, and so do we."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 5, "We regret to inform you that this proposal does not meet our safety standards."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 5, "Declined. Please do not resubmit unless the terms have improved."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 6, "Your offer has been reviewed and adjusted for your protection. Please find the corrected terms enclosed."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 7, "We apologise, {them}. Your protection plan has expired. The Protectorate thanks you for your patronage."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 8, "Incident logged, {them}. The Protectorate will now provide you with a different kind of attention."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 9, "For your safety, we comply. For our safety, your profile has been updated to: threat, {them}."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 9, "Request granted. Please note that this interaction has been recorded for future enforcement."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 10, "Good day, {them}. Mirveda Security, at your service. Please state your needs."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 10, "Welcome, {them}. This conversation is being protected for your safety."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 11, "You live within our protection zone, {them}. Please remain calm. We are watching over you."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. Our drones patrol your border for your protection. Do not be alarmed."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 12, "Valued client, {them}. Our previous arrangement was fully satisfactory. Shall we renew?"},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 12, "Welcome back. Your previous contract was handled with care."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 13, "You honoured your agreement, {them}. Your security rating has improved."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept. Thank you for your cooperation."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 14, "You broke an agreement, {them}. Your security rating has been adjusted. Downward."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 14, "A breach was detected. For your protection, we will proceed carefully."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 15, "You attacked our assets, {them}. This incident has been logged. For your protection."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 15, "You fired on Mirveda units. Please remain where you are. We will talk."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. High-value targets require additional protection."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. We recommend upgraded security. From us."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 17, "Valued friend {them}. Your safety is our priority. Please continue."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 17, "Premium client. How may we protect you today?"},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 18, "We are monitoring you, {them}. Please keep your hands visible."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 18, "For everyone's safety, please speak slowly."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 19, "You have been classified as a threat, {them}. Please speak quickly."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 19, "Our drones are ready, {them}. For our protection."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 20, "For your protection, {them}, your fleet is being neutralized. Please remain calm."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 20, "Attention, {them}: this area is restricted. Your fleet will now be removed for everyone's safety."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 20, "We are sorry for any inconvenience, {them}. Lethal force is being applied to your fleet."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 21, "Hostile activity from {them} detected. Countermeasures engaged. Thank you for your patience."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 21, "Please remain calm, {them}. Your attack has been logged and will be answered shortly."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 21, "Threat confirmed, {them}. Drones are on their way. Thank you for choosing Mirveda security."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 22, "Security personnel are deploying to your world, {them}. Please cooperate fully."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 22, "A security sweep of your world is now in progress, {them}. Please keep all limbs inside the safe zone."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 22, "For the safety of your population, {them}, your defenders are being neutralized."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 23, "This facility is secured, {them}. Unauthorized personnel will be removed. Permanently."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 23, "Access denied, {them}. This world is a secured site. Unauthorized landings will be terminated."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 23, "Please return to your ships, {them}. This is your final courtesy notice."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 24, "Our records show a prior incident with {them}. Enhanced measures are now in effect."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex requires professional security, {them}. We are pleased to provide it. You are no longer needed here."},
    {"mirveda", nullptr, 26, "An attack on the central facility, {them}? All drones, maximum response. This is not a drill."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 0, "What shines but casts no shadow, {them}? An offer from the Glimmer. Reach for it, if you dare."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 0, "Light leaves a star long before it arrives... This offer was sent before you asked. Take it now."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 0, "Two mirrors face each other, and neither knows which is real. Trade with us, and see yourself."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 1, "You are a star we have watched for a long time. For you, the mist parts... take this, and be warm."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 2, "Ask the moth what the lantern wants... Leave as we say, or learn what lies behind the glow."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 3, "A single voice in the Council is an echo in an empty hall. Join yours to ours, and hear how loud it grows."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 4, "Yes... the mist settles. What was a dream now has a shape."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 4, "So the reflection agrees with the face. It is done."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 5, "Can you hold starlight in your hand? Neither can you hold us to this."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 5, "No... the light bends away. Seek us elsewhere, if you can find where elsewhere is."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 6, "Turn the offer, as you would turn a jewel to the light... There. Now it shines as it should."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 7, "Did you trust a reflection, {them}? Reach for us now, and find only cold, empty space."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 8, "You struck at the mist, {them}... Look closely. Which of your ships is real, and which is ours?"},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 9, "Take the light, then... A stolen lantern still burns the hand that holds it, {them}."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 9, "Yours... the way a reflection is yours. Look again later, and see what looks back."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 10, "A light calls in the dark... is it you, {them}? Speak, and we will shine back."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 10, "You see us, {them}, but which of us is real? Speak to the brightest one."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 11, "Your stars reflect in our clouds, {them}. When we look at you, we see ourselves."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour... our light falls on your worlds every night. Do you dream of us?"},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 12, "We have traded before, {them}... or did we only dream it? Again, either way."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 12, "The last bargain still glows. Shall we light another?"},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. A true light, no illusion. Rare."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 13, "Your promise did not flicker. We shine a little brighter for it."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. A false light. We know false lights well."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 14, "Your promise was a mirage. We see through mirages. Speak."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 15, "You struck at the Glimmer, {them}. Did you hit us, or our reflection?"},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 15, "Your guns flashed in our clouds. We scattered. We gathered. Speak."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 16, "You shine brightest, {them}. The brightest stars burn out fastest."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy... a candle in a storm. Speak."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 17, "{them}... a warm glow. We drift toward you."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 17, "Your light is welcome. Speak, friend."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 18, "We watch your light, {them}. Is it true? Is it a trick?"},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 18, "Shadows shift around you. Speak."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 19, "Your light offends us, {them}. Speak... then fade."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 19, "We see only darkness in you, {them}. Be brief."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 20, "What does the moth see before the flame, {them}?... Look closely now... it is us."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 20, "Which light is the star, {them}, and which is the trap?... You chose wrong."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 20, "Your fleet sails into a mirror, {them}... and fights its own reflection."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 21, "You strike at light, {them}... and light scatters... and burns."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 21, "You fire into the glow, {them}... and the glow fires back... from everywhere."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 21, "What is struck, {them}, when the target is only light?... Nothing... and then you."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 22, "We drift down like starlight, {them}... and your world will dream our dream."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 22, "Your sentries dream of us, {them}... and wake to find the dream has landed."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 22, "A shimmer on the horizon, {them}... a shimmer in your halls... a shimmer where your army stood."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 23, "Here the glow is thickest, {them}... and those who walk into it do not walk out."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 23, "Every road on this world bends back on itself, {them}... where will you march?"},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 23, "Look up, {them}... the sky here is watching... and it is not a sky."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 24, "Have we met, {them}?... Or was that a dream?... Either way... it ended the same."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 25, "A throne, {them}, is only a seat for a reflection... let us see whose reflection remains."},
    {"mortheus", nullptr, 26, "You have stepped into the heart of the glow, {them}... here there is no way out... only further in."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 0, "A generous offer, from those who hold a star in their hands. It would be a shame if you made us drop it."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 0, "{them}, accept these terms. Your worlds look so very flammable."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 0, "Let us trade warmly. The alternative is a different kind of warmth."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 1, "You have kept clear of the flames, and Muaat honours that. Take these terms - and our fire stays pointed elsewhere."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 2, "Leave, or we light you up for the whole galaxy to see. You have until our patience burns out."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 3, "Vote with Muaat in the Council. Those who vote against us have a way of catching fire."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 4, "Wise. You have chosen not to burn today."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The furnace cools, for now."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 5, "No. Ask again more humbly - while your worlds are still cool enough to stand on."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 5, "Refused. Muaat does not take scraps from kindling."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 6, "That offer is too cold. We have heated it to proper terms - take them before they scorch."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 7, "Our pact has burned to ash, {them}. Nothing personal - everything burns eventually."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you broke faith with the Embers. Run. Every star you hide behind belongs to us."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 9, "Take it. Hold it tight, {them} - things handed over in anger have a way of catching fire later."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 9, "You buy one day of peace. The forge burns hotter for it, and it will still be hot when you come back."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 10, "The Gashlai hear you, {them}. Speak warmly - the fires are listening."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 10, "A new face before the forge. Choose your words well, {them}. Words burn easily."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 11, "You live close to our stars, {them}. Close enough to feel the heat. Remember that."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 11, "Our suns light your worlds, neighbour. It would be a shame if they flared."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 12, "Our last bargain was well tempered, {them}. Strike another, and keep the forge happy."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 12, "You traded with the Gashlai and kept your skin. Shall we test your luck again?"},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. The fires approve. Keep it up - they are always hungry."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept to Muaat. Wise. Fire forgives nothing, but it rewards the careful."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Gashlai, {them}. We are still deciding how hot to make your apology."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise smoulders, {them}. Ours is still smouldering. Speak carefully."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 15, "You struck at Muaat, {them}. Bold. Fire remembers every hand that touched it."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 15, "Your fleet came too close to the forge. The ashes are still warm. Talk."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 16, "You burn brightest in the galaxy, {them}. Bright things attract the flame."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 16, "So you lead. The Gashlai have melted greater thrones than yours."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 17, "{them}. You have earned some warmth from the forge. Not much - but some."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 17, "The fires like you today. Enjoy it. Speak."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 18, "The forge is watching you, {them}. Do not make it impatient."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 18, "Speak, and we will see if you are fuel or friend."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 19, "Talk quickly, {them}. The forge would rather melt you than listen to you."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 19, "You are tinder to us, {them}. Say your piece before the spark."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 20, "Your ships look cold, {them}. Let us warm them... until they glow, and melt."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 20, "You have flown too close to the sun, {them}. Now you burn."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 20, "Feel that heat on your hulls, {them}? That is the furnace opening its door."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 21, "You fly into the furnace, {them}? Then burn. Every last hull of you."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 21, "You strike at fire, {them}? Fire only grows."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 21, "Every shot you fire, {them}, only feeds the flames. Keep going. We are enjoying it."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 22, "We descend in fire, {them}. When we are done, your world will be glass and ash."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 22, "Our soldiers step out of the fire, {them}. Your world will learn to burn."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 22, "Embers are raining on your world, {them}. By morning, there will be no morning."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 23, "Our ground is molten underfoot, {them}. Step on it, and you will never step again."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 23, "The rock here still glows, {them}. Land on it, and become part of it."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 23, "This world was forged in fire, {them}. Your boots will melt before our walls do."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 24, "Back for more burns, {them}? We kept the furnace warm for you."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 25, "The throne world looks so pale, {them}. Let us give it some colour. Red. Then orange. Then ash."},
    {"muaat", nullptr, 26, "You are at the heart of the star, {them}. Here, we do not burn. We are the burning."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 0, "The omens favour you today, {them}. Take this offer before the signs change - they always do."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 0, "Our threads run beneath every world, listening. They say this trade will feed us both."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 0, "We cast the dice over this deal and read them well. Shall we let them fall in your favour?"},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 1, "Your name grows in good soil, friend. The network offers this, and the omens smile on it."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 2, "Everything rots in the end. Do as we ask, and we will let you choose how slowly."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 3, "The spores have drifted through the Council already. Vote as we do - the omens say it will pass."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The threads take root - this will grow into something good."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 4, "As foretold. The dice knew; we only waited for you to know."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 5, "No. The omens are sour, and we do not plant in sour ground."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 5, "The signs say refuse, and the signs are seldom wrong."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 6, "This offer would wither as it is. Let us graft on new terms - then it may flourish."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 7, "Your omens soured, {them}. We only followed where the signs pointed."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 8, "We saw this in a die that fell badly, {them}. Now all you own will rot from below."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 9, "Take it. Rot is patient, {them}. The signs already show where you will fall."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 9, "We give... and we watch. Every threat leaves a wound, and spores love wounds."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 10, "The threads stir... a voice. Speak, {them}. The spores are listening."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 10, "Hush... the network hears you, {them}. Let us read the signs."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds lie beside our gardens, {them}. Our threads already reach under your soil."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour... the spores drift between us. They always have."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 12, "We traded before, {them}. The dice favoured us both. Again?"},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 12, "The signs say you return. The signs are right. Speak."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. The omens grow sweet around you."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept. Good soil. The network is pleased."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. Rot spreads from broken things. Speak."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 14, "The signs warned us. We did not listen. Now we listen closely."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 15, "You burned our gardens, {them}. The threads remember every scar."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 15, "You fought the network. Decay feeds us. Thank you. Speak."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. The omens say everything rots in time."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. The dice have not finished rolling."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 17, "{them}... the signs are bright around you. Speak."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 17, "The network welcomes you, friend."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 18, "The omens about you are unclear, {them}. Speak."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 18, "We roll the dice for you. Not yet decided."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 19, "The signs say you will rot, {them}. Speak."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 19, "Our threads are tightening around you, {them}. Be brief."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 20, "The signs foretold this, {them}. Your fleet rots from within before we even fire."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 20, "The omens are rotten for your fleet, {them}. We read them twice to be sure."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 20, "Spores in your vents, {them}. Rot in your hulls. Now come the guns."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 21, "You struck the network, {them}. Every thread you cut grows back... toward you."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 21, "You cut a thread, {them}. A thousand more are reaching for you now."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 21, "The dice fell this way long ago, {them}. You are only catching up to the omen."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 22, "Our spores settle on your world, {them}. Slowly, softly, everything becomes ours."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 22, "We fall on your world like soft rain, {them}. Where we fall, things begin to rot."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 22, "The network spreads to your world, {them}. Slowly. Patiently. Inevitably."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 23, "This ground is threaded with us, {them}. Step carefully... every step feeds the rot."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 23, "Every step you take here, {them}, wakes something beneath the soil."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 23, "Decay is patient, {them}. It will wait for your soldiers to tire. Then it will feed."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 24, "Your return was foretold, {them}. So was the way you will leave."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 25, "Even the throne world rots, {them}. We will grow from what remains."},
    {"mykomentori", nullptr, 26, "You tread on the mother-mycelium, {them}. Every thread in the network now turns toward you."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 0, "Ssso. The Collective offers you terms. Be grateful we noticed you at all."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 0, "{them}, we have foreseen your needs. These terms will sssuffice... for one of your kind."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 0, "A gift from the Collective, though you hardly deserve it. Accept, and do not dawdle."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 1, "You amuse us, and that is rare. For you, the Collective offers sssweeter terms than usual."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 2, "Withdraw, little one. We sssaw this ending long ago, and it does not favour you."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 3, "The Council is full of fools. Lend the Collective your votes and let your betters decide."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 4, "Yesss. A wise choice, for once."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. You did exactly as we foresaw... how predictable."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 5, "No. The Collective doesss not stoop to such terms."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 5, "How tiresome. Refused - try again when you have something worth our time."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 6, "Sssuch a clumsy offer. We have improved it, as usual. Take these terms instead."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 7, "Did you think yourself our equal, {them}? Sssweet thing. We always knew this day would come."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you dare? We foresaw your treachery, and we foresaw your end. Ssso it begins."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 9, "Take it, little one. We have ssseen how this ends, and the ending is not kind to you."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 9, "Yesss, take it. Enjoy it while it lasts. We do not forget an insult, {them} - we merely wait."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 10, "Ssso. {them} wishes to speak with the Collective. How... quaint."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 10, "You have our attention, {them}. Briefly. Do not waste it."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 11, "Your little worlds sit at our border, {them}. We see everything that crosses it. Everything."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 11, "Neighbours, are we? The Collective has foreseen your every move. Speak anyway."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 12, "Again, {them}? Our last arrangement was... acceptable. For one of your kind."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 12, "You have bargained with the Collective before. Ssso, you learn. Sslowly."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word to us, {them}. We foresaw it, of course. But it pleases us."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 13, "A promise honoured. Perhapsss you are less simple than you look."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Collective, {them}. We saw it coming. We always do."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 14, "Ssso. The liar returns. Speak, {them}, and we will enjoy watching you try."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 15, "You raised your weapons against the Naalu, {them}. How tiresome. How... foolish."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 15, "Your attack was foreseen. Its failure was foreseen too. Ssspeak."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}? Temporarily. The Collective sees further than you."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 16, "Enjoy the view from the top, {them}. The fall has already been foretold."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 17, "{them}. We find you... tolerable. Rare praise from the Collective. Treasure it."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 17, "For you, the Collective will lower itself to bargain. Ssspeak, friend."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 18, "We are watching you, {them}. Every coil of the future is watching you."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 18, "Ssso. Show us what you want. We have not yet decided what you are."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 19, "You disgust the Collective, {them}. Speak, and be gone."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 19, "We have foreseen this conversation, {them}. It ends badly for you."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 20, "How amusssing, {them}. We sssaw this battle long ago - and you have already lossst it."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 20, "Ssstand aside, {them}. We already know how thisss ends. You do not."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 20, "Poor {them}. You will never sssee the strike that finishes you."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 21, "You ssstrike at the Collective, {them}? We foresaw that too. It endsss badly for you."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 21, "Your attack wasss foreseen, {them}. Your defeat, too."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 21, "Ssso you ssstrike first, {them}? How very... predictable."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 22, "Our warriors dessscend, {them}. Do not bother resisting - we have ssseen how this goes."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 22, "Sssilent feet ssslip onto your world, {them}. Your guards will not even hear them."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 22, "We have ssseen your world in our hands, {them}. Now we take what we have ssseen."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 23, "This world isss ours, {them}. Every step you take here, we sssaw coming."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 23, "You land on our world, {them}? We ssset this trap long before you arrived."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 23, "Every path you take here leads to the sssame end, {them}. We made sure of it."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 24, "Again, {them}? We sssaw you would come back. We sssaw you lose, too."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 25, "The throne wasss always meant for the Collective, {them}. Kneel before it, and before usss."},
    {"naalu", nullptr, 26, "You dare come to our home, {them}? You will not leave it. We have ssseen that."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 0, "Here's a find worth digging into, {them}. Both sides walk off with something shiny - that's how the Alliance likes it."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 0, "Ran the numbers twice and the gears mesh. Take a look before somebody else stakes the claim."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 0, "Nothing fancy, just good honest salvage on both sides. Shake on it?"},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 1, "You've always dealt straight with the Alliance. Best cut of the haul goes to friends - here it is, polished up."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 2, "We'd rather dig than fight, but our mechs do both. Take the deal, or we'll come and excavate it ourselves."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 3, "The Council's just another machine, and votes are the bolts that hold it together. Lend us yours and we'll keep it running."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 4, "Ha! Good find. Deal."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 4, "Gears mesh. The Alliance accepts."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 5, "Nah, that one's fool's gold."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 5, "Dug through it twice. Nothing in there for us."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 6, "Close, but a few parts don't fit. We've retooled it - try this version."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 7, "Sorry, {them} - found a richer seam. The Alliance is moving on, and you're the rock we're breaking."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 8, "You sold us out, {them}? Fine. We know how to dig, and we always find what's buried."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 9, "Alright, alright, take it. But we've got a long memory and a longer drill, {them}."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 9, "Not how we like to do business. Fine - it's yours. We'll just be over here, tuning our mechs."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 10, "Hey there, {them}! The Alliance is always up for a deal. What've you dug up?"},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 10, "Comms open! What can the Alliance do for you, {them}?"},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 11, "We're practically digging into your backyard, {them}. Neighbours should share the tools!"},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds are right next to our dig sites. Let's keep the drills pointed down, eh?"},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 12, "Good to hear from you again, {them}! Last deal ran like a well-oiled machine."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 12, "Back for more? The Alliance loves a repeat customer."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. That's solid bedrock. We can build on that."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept! That's a good foundation. What are we building next?"},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Alliance, {them}. That's a cracked bearing. We'll be checking it."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 14, "Last promise of yours was fool's gold, {them}. Show us the real thing this time."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 15, "You shot at our rigs, {them}. We patched 'em up. Still a bit sore about it."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 15, "You took a swing at the Alliance. Let's talk - but we're keeping our wrenches handy."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 16, "You're top of the galaxy, {them}. Biggest dig always draws the most claim-jumpers."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 16, "You're winning! Careful - a machine running that hot tends to throw a gear."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 17, "{them}! Best partner on the frontier. Grab a seat, let's deal."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 17, "Always good to see you. The Alliance has a soft spot for you."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 18, "Hmm. Let's see what you're offering, {them}. We'll give it a good once-over."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 18, "The Alliance is listening. Testing the soil before we dig, you know?"},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 19, "Make it quick, {them}. The Alliance has better things to dig up."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 19, "You're not our favourite rock, {them}. Talk."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 20, "Sorry, {them} - you're parked on our dig site. Mechs, clear the area!"},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 20, "Heads up, {them}! Our mechs are coming through. Please keep your hulls out of the dig zone."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 20, "Survey says there's a fight here, {them}. Survey's never wrong. Mechs, go!"},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 21, "Hey, {them}, we're working here! Fine - the drills double as guns."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 21, "Seriously, {them}? We just recalibrated the drills! Fine - recalibrating them for you."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 21, "Shots fired at the dig crew, {them}. That's an incident report. And then a counterattack."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 22, "Mechs are going down, {them}! We'll be careful with the rocks... mostly."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 22, "Mechs landing on your world, {them}! We'll leave the ruins standing. You, not so much."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 22, "Big dig on your world, {them}! Shovels out, mechs out, you out."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 23, "You want this site, {them}? Our mechs built it, and our mechs will defend it."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 23, "This site is ours, {them}. Every mech here was built for digging, and they dig graves just fine."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 23, "Careful where you step, {them}. Half this site is unexploded relics, and the other half is us."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 24, "Oh, it's you again, {them}. Our mechs remember your hulls. They kept the dents."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 25, "Do you know what's buried under Mecatol Rex, {them}? We do. And we're not sharing."},
    {"naaz", nullptr, 26, "You're shooting at our home, {them}? The whole Alliance just put down their tools and picked up guns."},
