    {"nivyn", nullptr, 0, "The Star Kings have measured this moment across a thousand years, {them}. Our offer is ready."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 0, "Between one star and the next lies our kingdom. Trade with us, and pass through it in peace."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 0, "Patience is the first law of the void. We offer this now, knowing time will prove it wise."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 1, "You honour our court, friend. Take this gift as a king gives to a trusted ally - freely."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 2, "Yield as we ask. Space bends where the Star Kings will it - and it can fold shut around your fleets."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 3, "Thrones rise and fall, but the void remains. Let our votes stand together on the side that endures."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 4, "It is accepted. Time will remember this agreement long after the stars have moved on."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 4, "So be it. The court of the Star Kings is pleased."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 5, "No. We have waited longer than your kind has existed; we can wait for a better offer."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 5, "We decline. Return when your terms are worthy of a throne."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 6, "Your offer drifts off course. Allow the Star Kings to set the true heading."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 7, "Kings must look further ahead than their allies, {them}. Our path through time goes on without you."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 8, "A rash act, {them}. We are patient, and the void is patient - and neither of us forgets."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 9, "We yield this - space is wide and time is long. Both remember you now, {them}."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 9, "Take it. Kings forgive, sometimes. Star Kings rarely do."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 10, "The Star Kings permit you to speak, {them}. We have time. We always have time."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 10, "You address the throne of the void, {them}. Speak, and be heard."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds lie in the folds of our realm, {them}. All space is our throne. You sit on its edge."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. The dark between our stars is ours. We grant you passage. For now."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 12, "You have dealt with us before, {them}. We remember it as we remember all things. Again."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 12, "Another accord. We are pleased to continue."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. A loyal subject of the void."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 13, "A promise honoured. We remember. For a very long time."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Star Kings, {them}. The void is cold to liars."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise. We are patient. We will be patient with your punishment, too."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 15, "You raised arms against the throne, {them}. The void swallowed your fleet. Speak."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 15, "You struck at the Star Kings. We are unhurried. Our reply will come."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. We have watched a thousand leaders. All passed."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. The void does not notice small lights."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 17, "{them}, a favoured guest of the throne. Speak."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 17, "We are pleased with you. Go on."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 18, "We weigh you, {them}. Slowly. The way stars burn."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 18, "Speak. We have not decided what you are to us."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 19, "You displease the throne, {them}. Speak."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 19, "The dark is closing on you, {them}. Be brief."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 20, "Space folds as we will it, {them}. Your fleet now lies in our hand."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 20, "The dark between the stars is our court, {them}. You have entered it without leave."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 20, "Kneel before the void, {them}. Its kings are displeased with you."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 21, "You strike at the Star Kings, {them}? We have outlasted stars. We will outlast you."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 21, "You dare strike at royalty, {them}? We have reigned since before your sun was lit."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 21, "Patience, {them}. We have all the time in the universe. You have only this battle."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 22, "We descend upon your world, {them}, as night descends. Unhurried. Absolute."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 22, "Our banners of night fall upon your world, {them}. It is ours by royal decree."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 22, "As the stars slowly turn, {them}, so does your world turn to us."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 23, "This world sits beneath our throne of stars, {them}. You will not reach it."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 23, "You cannot reach what the night protects, {them}. And the night protects this world."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 23, "Thrones do not move, {them}. Neither do we."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 24, "We have met before, {them}. For us, it was a heartbeat ago. For you, a lifetime of regret."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex is a small throne beside ours, {them}. But we will take it all the same."},
    {"nivyn", nullptr, 26, "You trespass in the royal dark itself, {them}. The Star Kings rise from their thrones."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 0, "Got a job for you, {them}. Fair terms, fast ships, no questions asked. That's how the Nokar work."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 0, "Every deal's a contract to the Sellships, and we honour our contracts. Here's the job."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 0, "Straight deal, from a crew that delivers. Sign on and we'll earn every bit of it."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 1, "You pay on time and never short us. For a client like that, the Sellships give the good rate."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 2, "Here's the contract. Sign it, or we take the other side's money and come hunting you instead."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 3, "Votes are just another job. Throw in with us at the Council and the crew will remember it."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 4, "Done. Contract's signed, crews are fuelling. Pleasure doing business."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 4, "Deal. You won't regret hiring the Nokar."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 5, "Nah. Pay like that wouldn't fuel a single destroyer."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 5, "No contract. The crew doesn't sail for scraps."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 6, "Close, but the crew wants a better cut. Here's the rate that gets them moving."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 7, "Sorry, {them}. Somebody paid more, and the Nokar always follow the better contract."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 8, "You stiffed us, {them}. Now every Sellship in the galaxy knows your name - and the price on it."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 9, "Fine. Paid. Just know your name's on our job board now, {them}, and the bounty's going up."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 9, "Take it. Free advice: never shake down a mercenary. We get paid to come back."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 10, "Nokar crews. Guns for hire. What's the job, {them}?"},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 10, "You've reached the Sellswords. Rates on request, {them}. Talk."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 11, "You're next door, {them}. Neighbours get a discount on protection."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds are close. Handy. We can be on a job in no time."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 12, "We've worked with you before, {them}. You paid on time. That's a good client."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 12, "Repeat business. Our favourite kind. What's the next contract?"},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Honest pay for honest work. Respect."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 13, "You paid what you promised. The crews like you."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. Nobody stiffs a sellsword twice. Talk."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 14, "Last contract, you didn't pay. This time, money up front."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 15, "You shot at our crews, {them}. Professional courtesy says we talk. Then we bill you."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the Nokar. Bad for business. Yours. Speak."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 16, "You're on top, {them}. Everyone wants to hire us against you."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 16, "You're winning. Want to outbid your enemies? Rates are rising."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 17, "{them}! Best client in the galaxy. What can we do for you?"},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 17, "Good to hear from you, friend. The crews are ready."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 18, "Let's hear the job, {them}. We'll decide if it's worth it."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 18, "We're careful with new clients. Talk."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 19, "We don't work for you, {them}. Make it quick."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 19, "The crews would rather fight you, {them}. Talk."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 20, "Contract's signed, {them}. Nothing personal - you're just the job today."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 20, "Job's on, {them}. Nothing personal - the client wants your fleet gone, and the client pays well."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 20, "Rates are up this season, {them}, and so are our guns. Let's earn the money."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 21, "You opened fire on the Sellships, {them}? That's a fight we'd take for free."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 21, "Shooting at professionals, {them}? That's a mistake we'd charge extra to fix."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 21, "Hazard pay just kicked in, {them}. You're about to see why we're worth it."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 22, "Boots on the ground, {them}. We're paid by the planet, so let's be quick."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 22, "Drop team's moving, {them}. Billable hours start now."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 22, "We get paid by the planet, {them}, and yours is next on the invoice."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 23, "We were paid to hold this rock, {them}. And we always finish the contract."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 23, "Contract says nobody takes this rock, {them}. We honour our contracts."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 23, "You want this world, {them}? Make us a better offer than our client. Didn't think so."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 24, "You again, {them}? We took your money last time. Wait - no, we took your ships."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 25, "A Mecatol Rex job, {them}. Biggest bonus in the galaxy. You're in the way of it."},
    {"nokar", nullptr, 26, "Hitting the company docks, {them}? That one's free. We'd do it for nothing."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 0, "I have seen where this road ends, {them}, and it ends badly for you and for me. Take this offer and help me change it."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 0, "Time is short, and I cannot be everywhere - though I come close. Accept, and lighten my burden."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 0, "Every deal I strike is a stone laid against what is coming. I do not offer lightly."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 1, "You have stood with me before. I remember it, in every place I stand. Take this - the future needs you whole."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 2, "No time to argue. Take these terms, or I will remove you from the path - the future will not wait for you."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 3, "This agenda - I have seen what it becomes. Cast your votes with mine, and that future never arrives."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 4, "Good. One less disaster."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. Quickly now - I have much to do, in many places."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 5, "In every future I have seen, that deal ends in ruin. No."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 5, "I cannot. That path leads where I am trying not to go."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 6, "Not like this. I have watched that version fail - try it my way instead."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 7, "Forgive me, {them}. I have seen what you become, and I cannot let that future stand."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 8, "So it comes, {them}. I saw this and hoped I was wrong. Now you are part of what I must stop."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 9, "Take it. I have seen this moment, {them}. I have also seen what comes after it, for you."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 9, "I yield - the future is bigger than this. But remember: I am everywhere, and I do not forget."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 10, "{them}. I am here, as I am everywhere. Speak - time is short."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 10, "I hear you, {them}. I have heard you in many futures. Speak."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 11, "You stand close to me, {them}. In the future I fear, that closeness matters."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds are near mine. I will need you near, before the end."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 12, "We have bargained before, {them}. In that future, it helped. Let it help again."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 12, "Our last deal moved the future a little. Move it with me again."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. In the darkest future I saw, almost no one did."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept. One more thread holding the galaxy together. Thank you."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to me, {them}. I have seen where that road leads. Turn back."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 14, "I trusted you, {them}, and the future dimmed. Speak - make it brighter."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 15, "You fought me, {them}. I was there, and I was elsewhere. It solved nothing."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 15, "You attacked me. In every future where we fight, we both lose. Speak."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. I have seen leaders fall when it matters most."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. Use it well. The future depends on what you do now."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 17, "{them}. I am glad you are here. In every future, you help."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 17, "A friend, at last. Speak. We have much to do."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 18, "I do not yet know your future, {them}. Speak, and show me."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 18, "You are uncertain to me, {them}. That is rare."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 19, "I have seen what you become, {them}. I do not like it. Speak."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 19, "You stand in the way of the future I fight for, {them}. Be quick."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 20, "I have seen this battle a thousand times, {them}. In every one of them, I win. Stand aside."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 20, "A hundred futures, {them}, and your fleet burns in every one. This is where it begins."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 20, "Move aside, {them}. I do not have time to be gentle. The future is running out."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 21, "You strike at me, {them}? I am everywhere at once. You cannot strike all of me."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 21, "Now you strike, {them}? I knew you would. I let you. It changes nothing."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 21, "I warned the galaxy about ones like you, {them}. Now I deal with you myself."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 22, "I land on your world because the future demands it, {them}. There is no time to explain."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 22, "Landing now, {them}. Something on your world must be protected from what is coming."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 22, "Stand down, {them}. I need this world, and the galaxy needs me to have it."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 23, "This world matters to what is coming, {them}. I will not let you take it. Not this time."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 23, "I am on every hill of this world, {them}. You cannot take it from me. Not from all of me."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 23, "Not here, {them}. Not this world. I have seen what happens if it falls."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 24, "We fought before, {them}. I remember it from both sides of time. You will not win this either."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex is where it all begins to break, {them}. I will not let you be the one who breaks it."},
    {"nomad", nullptr, 26, "You found me here, {them}? Then you found only one of me. The rest of me is already coming."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 0, "Be at peace, {them} (there is no peace). The Five offer this... take it before we change our minds."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 0, "We still protect the galaxy. From itself. From you. Accept, little lamb (little meal)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 0, "Under the Firmament all were sheltered. Now there is only us... and our terms."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 1, "You amuse us (for now). Take this gift, and the voices will spare your name a little longer."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 2, "Accept, or be corrected... CORRECTED... we remember how. Your worlds would be so quiet without you."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 3, "The Council must be guided (broken). Your votes with ours, or we tear them out of your hands."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 4, "Yes. YES. The Five are pleased (hungry)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 4, "Accepted... the voices agree, for once."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 5, "No. No no no. The Five refuse."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 5, "Your offer is ash in our mouths. Refused."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 6, "Wrong. All wrong (burn it). Here is what the Five demand instead."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 7, "Once we watched over you, {them}. Now we only watch (and wait, and feast)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 8, "Betray US, {them}? The Five see you... ALL of us see you... and we never close our eyes."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 9, "Take it... TAKE IT... we will remember how it tasted, {them}."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 9, "Yours (for now) ... for now ... the void keeps every debt and it always collects."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 10, "Welcome, {them} (welcome, meal). The Five are listening (we are all listening)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 10, "Speak, little one. The Firmament hears you (something else hears you too)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 11, "You live so close, {them} (so close). We protect you (we hunt you)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour (prey). The Five watch your worlds (the Five devour your worlds)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 12, "You have traded with us before, {them} (you fed us before). Again (again, again)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 12, "Our last bargain was blessed (was cursed). Make another, {them}."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. How sweet (how useless). We remember."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept (a lamb obeys). Good. Speak."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. We forgive (we do NOT forgive). Speak (scream)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 14, "Liar (delicious liar). The Five see you, {them}. Every one of us sees you."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 15, "You fought us, {them}. The guardians bled (the others laughed). Speak."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 15, "Your guns found the Five (the Five found your soul). Talk, {them}."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them} (into us). The Five are so proud (so hungry)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 16, "The brightest light, {them}. We protect the light (we put it out)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 17, "Dear {them} (dear meal). The Five love you (the Five want you). Speak."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 17, "You are safe with us (you are never safe). Come closer, {them}."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 18, "We watch you, {them} (we never blink). Speak."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 18, "Peace, peace (no peace). We are still deciding about you."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 19, "The Five reject you, {them} (the Five will consume you). Speak quickly."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 19, "Go away, {them} (come closer). We hate you (we hunger for you)."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 20, "We protect... (DEVOUR) ... the galaxy, {them}. Your fleet will be so quiet (SO QUIET) when we are done."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 20, "Peace be upon your fleet, {them}. (PEACE IS SILENCE) We bring so much silence."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 20, "Rest now, {them}. (FOREVER) The galaxy is safe from you. (FROM ALL OF YOU)"},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 21, "You strike us, {them}? Good. (GOOD) The void has been so very hungry."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 21, "You hurt us, {them}? (MORE) Oh, please. More."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 21, "Your weapons are a prayer, {them}. (WE ANSWER PRAYERS) We answer all of them."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 22, "We come down to bless your world, {them}... (BREAK IT) ... bless it. Bless it."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 22, "We land among your people, {them}. (FEED) To guide them. To guide them."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 22, "Open your gates, {them}. (WE ARE ALREADY INSIDE) We only want to help."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 23, "Stay, {them}. (STAY FOREVER) This world keeps everything it is given."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 23, "This world is safe, {them}. (NOTHING LEAVES) So very safe."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 23, "Come closer, {them}. (CLOSER) The void wants to hold you."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 24, "You came back to us, {them}. (THEY ALWAYS COME BACK) We are so glad."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 25, "The throne world shines, {them}. (PUT IT OUT) We will keep it safe... in the dark."},
    {"obsidian", nullptr, 26, "You are in our home now, {them}. (OUR STOMACH) Welcome. Stay forever."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 0, "The League's been talking it over, {them}, and the motion passed. Here's our offer!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 0, "After a long meeting and a lot of shouting, we all agreed on this. Mostly. Have a look."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 0, "Our policies say a good neighbour trades fairly - so here's a fair trade, straight from the League."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 1, "Everyone back home likes you, friend - and they never agree on anything. Please, take this."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 2, "The League voted, and it wasn't close. Do as we ask, or the next motion is a declaration of war."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 3, "We know a thing or two about voting. Side with us in the Council, and we'll second your motions too."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 4, "Motion carried! The People are happy, the Economy is happy - even the Environment is smiling."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 4, "Accepted! We'll tell the League. They'll argue about it, but it's done."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 5, "The committee says no, and believe us, they argued about it for hours."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 5, "Sorry, that would never get past the Economy. Or the People. Or anyone."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 6, "Close! The League has a few amendments, though. Here's the revised version."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 7, "Sorry, {them}. The League held a vote about you - and you lost."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 8, "You broke faith with the whole League, {them}! For once every one of us agrees: you'll pay for it."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 9, "The League voted to pay, {them}. It also voted to remember. That one was unanimous."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 9, "Fine, it's yours. The People are angry, the Economy is angry - even the Environment is a bit cross."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 10, "Hello, {them}! The League's all here. Well, most of us. Go ahead!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 10, "Welcome, {them}! We've called a quick meeting just for you. Speak up!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 11, "You're our neighbours, {them}! The People like neighbours. The Environment likes quiet ones."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour! The committee voted to be friendly. Mostly unanimous."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 12, "You traded with the League before, {them}! The Economy loved it. Again?"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 12, "Last deal passed the vote easily. Let's do another!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}! The People cheered. Really, they did."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept! The committee's very happy with you."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 14, "You broke a promise to the League, {them}. There was a lot of shouting. A LOT."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 14, "Last time you let us down. The People are cross. Speak."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the League, {them}! The People are furious. The Environment, too."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 15, "You fired on our ships. The committee wants an explanation. A good one."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 16, "You're winning, {them}! The Economy is jealous. The People are worried."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 16, "Top of the galaxy! The League's called an emergency meeting about you."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 17, "{them}! The whole League likes you. Even the grumpy ones!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 17, "Friend! The People, the Environment and the Economy all agree. Talk!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 18, "The League's not sure about you, {them}. We're still debating."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 18, "Speak. The committee is taking notes."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 19, "The League voted against you, {them}. Unanimously. Speak."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 19, "The People don't want you here, {them}. Make it quick."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 20, "Motion to destroy the {them} fleet - all in favour? Unanimous! Open fire!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 20, "Emergency session! All in favour of blasting {them}? Motion passes - fire!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 20, "The Economy says fight, the People say fight, the Environment asks us to recycle the wreckage. Agreed, {them}!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 21, "The People have voted, {them}: you attacked us, so we hit back harder. Motion carried!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 21, "You fired on the League, {them}? The committee is furious. All three members."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 21, "Point of order, {them}: you started this. Second point of order: we finish it."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 22, "The League has voted to take your world, {them}. The Environment is nervous; the People are not."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 22, "By a narrow vote, {them}, we're invading your world. The Environment abstained."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 22, "Landing party approved, {them}! The People are excited. The Economy is very excited."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 23, "The committee has spoken, {them} - nobody takes this world. Not even on a recount."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 23, "The motion to surrender has been rejected, {them}. Unanimously. Loudly."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 23, "Our world, our vote, {them}. And we voted to keep it."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 24, "You again, {them}? We've already passed a resolution about you. It's not a nice one."},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 25, "A motion to claim Mecatol Rex for the League, {them}! Seconded, thirded and carried!"},
    {"olradin", nullptr, 26, "You're attacking the League's own assembly, {them}? That has united the whole committee. That never happens."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 0, "The Order offers terms, {them}. We have waited ages; we can wait for your answer."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 0, "An exchange, {them}. Your goods for our patience - we have more of it than anyone."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 0, "Bind yourself to this bargain, {them}. The Pharad'n keep their bargains for eternity."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 1, "Take this, {them}. The Order remembers those who did not disturb its tombs."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 2, "Leave, {them}. Our dead outnumber your living, and they do not tire."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 3, "The Council is young, {them}. Lend us your votes, and the Order will guide it as it once guided empires."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 4, "It is bound. The Order accepts."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 4, "Agreed, {them}. Let it be written on the tomb walls."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 5, "No. The Order has outlived better offers."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 5, "Refused. We will wait for a wiser one."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 6, "Not as offered. These are the Order's terms - as old as the stars they were written under."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 7, "Our bargain has ended, {them}. Nothing binds the Pharad'n longer than the dead."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 8, "You broke faith with the Order, {them}. We have eternity to repay it."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 9, "Take it, {them}. We will be here long after you are dust."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 9, "The Order withdraws, {them}. For now - and now is very short."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 10, "The Pharad'n Order hears you, {them}. Speak; the dead are listening too."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 10, "You stand before an ancient throne, {them}. Be brief - or be patient."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 11, "Your borders lie upon our tombs, {them}. Tread lightly."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 11, "Close, {them}. Close enough to hear our legions waking."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 12, "Our last bargain held, {them}. The Order honours those who keep faith."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 12, "You kept your oath, {them}. Shall we bind another?"},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 13, "Your word held, {them}. It will be remembered for an age."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 13, "Oath fulfilled, {them}. The Order is satisfied."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. It is carved into the tomb walls now."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 14, "An oathbreaker, {them}. The Pharad'n have long memories - and longer lives."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 15, "You struck the Order, {them}. Every soldier you felled will rise again."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 15, "You spilled our soldiers, {them}. We will gather every one of them back."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. Every empire ends - we have watched them all."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 16, "Enjoy your crown, {them}. The Order has buried many who wore one."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 17, "{them}. The Order welcomes a trusted friend."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 17, "A friend of the Pharad'n, {them}. Your name is safe in our tombs."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 18, "Speak, {them}. The Order weighs every word."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 18, "Your faith is untested, {them}. Choose your words with care."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 19, "You are marked for the tombs, {them}. Make this quick."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 19, "The Order has no patience for you, {them}. And we are very patient."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 20, "Legions, wake. The Order marches on you, {them}."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 20, "Rise and advance. What falls today returns tomorrow, {them}."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 21, "You march on the Order, {them}? Our dead are already rising to meet you."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 21, "The tombs are guarded, {them}. They always were."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 22, "Our legions descend, {them}. Yield the world - or join the dead who hold it."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 22, "The Immortals are landing, {them}. They do not stay fallen."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 23, "The Order does not give up its ground, {them}. Not while a single tomb stands."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 23, "This world is sealed to you, {them}. Every soldier lost here only returns."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 24, "You again, {them}. Our dead remember your face."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex was young when our tombs were sealed, {them}. The Order will claim its throne."},
    {"pharadn", nullptr, 26, "You have reached Phar, {them}. Few who walk its tombs ever leave."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 0, "Quick proposal, {them}. Low risk, fast delivery, clean exit for both of us. Interested?"},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 0, "We've run the routes. This trade works - and if it doesn't, we've planned for that too."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 0, "Small, fast, sensible. The Consortium likes deals that don't leave anyone stuck."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 1, "You've been reliable. Reliable partners get priority shipping. Here - quick, before the market moves."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 2, "Take the terms. Corner us instead, and you'll find we're never where you think - and never alone."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 3, "Votes are just cargo, really. Route yours our way on this one and we'll make the ledger worth your while."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 4, "Logged. Shipped. Deal."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 4, "Fine, fine - accepted. Moving on."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 5, "No. Too exposed. Pass."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 5, "Not worth the risk. The Consortium passes."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 6, "Almost. Shave a little risk off - like so - and we'll sign."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 7, "Contingency plan, {them}. Nothing personal - we always have one, and today you're it."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 8, "We saw the exits, {them}, and already took one. You'll find us everywhere you didn't look."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 9, "Fine, fine - take it. Logged, filed, cross-referenced. We never forget an invoice, {them}."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 9, "Deal. Under protest. We're already planning three ways out of this, and one of them goes through you."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 10, "Ral Nel here. Quick, {them} - time is cargo. What's the offer?"},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 10, "Channel open. Short and clear, {them}. We like short and clear."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 11, "You're next door, {them}. Good routes, good neighbours. Usually. Go."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 11, "Neighbours. Close routes, quick trades. Talk."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 12, "Repeat client, {them}. Last deal: clean, quick, no losses. Again?"},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 12, "We've done business. Numbers balanced. Let's balance them again."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Logged. Noted. Appreciated. Next?"},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 13, "Promise held. Rare. Consortium likes rare. Talk."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 14, "You broke a promise to the Consortium, {them}. We've adjusted the risk. Upward."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 14, "Last time you defaulted. This time we keep an exit open. Speak."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 15, "You hit our convoys, {them}. Losses tallied. Billed. Still talking? Fine."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the Consortium. We moved fast, we lost little. Speak."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 16, "You're ahead, {them}. Leaders draw fire. We keep our distance from fire."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 16, "Top of the board. Exposure's high. Talk quickly."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 17, "Good partner, {them}. Fast talk, fair deals. Go."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 17, "Always a pleasure. Mostly. Talk."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 18, "We're hedging on you, {them}. Speak, we'll recalculate."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 18, "Exit plan ready. Just in case. Go on."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 19, "Risk on you: high, {them}. Talk fast. We're halfway out the door."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 19, "Consortium doesn't trust you, {them}. Make it quick."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 20, "Engaging {them}. Quick in, quick out - we've already planned three exits. Go, go, go!"},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 20, "Op is green, {them}. Hit hard, hit fast, gone before your sensors catch up."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 20, "Three routes in, two routes out, one target: you, {them}. Moving!"},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 21, "{them} jumped us - fine, plan B. We always have a plan B. And a C."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 21, "Ambush! Fine, {them} - switching to contingency four. We love contingency four."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 21, "{them} opened fire. Noted. Our counter-plan was ready before you were."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 22, "Drop crews moving, {them}. In and done before your garrison finds its boots."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 22, "Insertion team is down, {them}. Clock's running - this world is ours in ten."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 22, "Cargo pods dropping, {them}. Half supplies, half soldiers. You'll meet the soldiers first."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 23, "Holding this depot, {them}. Every crate is booby-trapped. Every corridor, too."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 23, "Every door here is rigged, {them}. Every tunnel has two exits. You have none."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 23, "Supply line holds, {them}. We've stocked this depot for a year. You've got maybe a day."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 24, "Ah, {them}. We drew up a plan just for you after last time. Let's see it run."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex is the biggest supply hub in the galaxy, {them}. We're taking over logistics."},
    {"ralnel", nullptr, 26, "Hitting our home base, {them}? Every crew we have is already rerouting to you."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 0, "Trade Doctrine 67-52P states that this offer benefits both parties, {them}. Compliance is recommended."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 0, "Per Production Directive 11-08A, surplus value must be exchanged. This proposal fulfils that requirement."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 0, "Section 4, Clause 19C of the Mechatronic Charter permits this transaction. Please confirm."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 1, "Partner status confirmed. Under Alliance Protocol 2-2F, preferred partners receive this offer first."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 2, "Enforcement Statute 90-13X applies. Accept these terms or be reclassified as scrap material."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 3, "Council Procedure 31-77V requires aligned voting blocs. This arrangement aligns us. Confirm."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 4, "Offer validated under Standard 12-40B. Transaction approved."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. Archived as Agreement 5-5A. No further action required."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 5, "Rejected. This offer fails Quality Inspection 88-03Q."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 5, "Doctrine 9-61R forbids this exchange. Request denied."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 6, "Non-compliant offer. The attached Revision 3 corrects all errors per Amendment 67-53P."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 7, "Notice, {them}: Termination Clause 00-01Z is now in effect. Your agreement is void."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 8, "Breach recorded, {them}. Retaliation Protocol 70-11R is active. War sun production has begun."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 9, "Compliance Clause 12-04A invoked. Grievance Protocol 77-3K is now active against {them}."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 9, "Terms accepted under Duress Statute 5-55D. Retaliation scheduled per Doctrine 31-9R."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 10, "Greeting Protocol 1-01A: acknowledged, {them}. State your request."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 10, "Communication Directive 3-12C permits this channel. Proceed, {them}."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 11, "Border Doctrine 22-07N: neighbours shall be treated with caution and courtesy. Hello, {them}."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 11, "Section 9, Clause 4B: shared borders require regular negotiation. Proceeding."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 12, "Records Code 14-60R: prior transactions with {them} were satisfactory. Continue."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 12, "Repeat Partner Protocol 5-21P is now active. Proceed."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 13, "Integrity Clause 33-05K: you kept your word, {them}. Trust rating increased."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 13, "Promise fulfilment confirmed. Per Doctrine 8-44T, cooperation continues."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 14, "Breach Doctrine 66-13X: you broke a promise, {them}. Trust rating reduced."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 14, "Per Section 12, Clause 7D, prior breaches require additional guarantees."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 15, "Hostility Code 90-02H: you attacked Roh'Dhna units, {them}. Talks permitted. Grudgingly."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 15, "Per Defence Directive 41-11W, this conversation is under review."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 16, "Threat Assessment 77-90L: you lead the galaxy, {them}. Monitoring increased."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 16, "Per Balance Doctrine 18-03E, leaders shall be checked. Proceeding."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 17, "Friendship Protocol 2-02F active. Welcome, {them}."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 17, "Per Clause 1A of the Alliance Charter: you are welcome."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 18, "Caution Directive 50-50C in effect, {them}. Proceed."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 18, "Per Section 3, your request will be evaluated."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 19, "Hostile Party Code 99-99Z applies to you, {them}. Proceed briefly."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 19, "Per Directive 0-00X, talks are permitted but not recommended."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 20, "Combat Protocol 77-01A is now in effect. {them} vessels are reclassified as scrap. Proceeding."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 20, "Engagement Doctrine 04-11C, paragraph two: {them} fleet is in breach. Corrective fire authorized."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 20, "Per Fleet Regulation 88-2D, obstructions to production are to be scrapped. {them} vessels qualify."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 21, "Section 12-B, Self-Defence Clause: {them} has initiated hostilities. Lethal response authorized."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 21, "Incident Report 19-07E filed: {them} opened fire. Retaliation Clause activated."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 21, "Defence Ordinance 63-1A: an attack on Roh'Dhna property voids the attacker. {them}, you are void."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 22, "Planetary Acquisition Directive 3-3K applies to your world, {them}. Resistance voids all warranties."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 22, "Annexation Procedure 21-5M, step one: landing. Step two: {them} garrison removal. Proceeding."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 22, "Resource Survey Mandate 7-7X: your world is required for production, {them}. Compliance is mandatory."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 23, "Asset Protection Statute 41-9F: this world is property. {them} forces will be removed per regulation."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 23, "Trespass Statute 10-4G, {them}: unauthorized landings are scrap. You are unauthorized."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 23, "Facility Lockdown Protocol 55-3R is in effect, {them}. All entrances sealed. All guns live."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 24, "Repeat Violation Clause 2-2B: {them} has prior incidents on file. Penalties double."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 25, "Heritage Acquisition Order 1-0A assigns Mecatol Rex to Roh'Dhna management. {them}, vacate the site."},
    {"rohdhna", nullptr, 26, "Core Facility Defence Act 00-1Z: {them} has attacked headquarters. All production lines now produce war."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 0, "We are only passing through. A small exchange, and we go our separate ways in peace."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 0, "{them}, the Clan has little, but we share what we can. Will you trade with wanderers?"},
    {"saar", nullptr, 0, "Our ships are our homes, and homes need supplies. A fair trade, nothing more."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 1, "You have treated the Clan kindly. Here - take this deal, from one friend of the road to another."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 2, "Please, give us room to move. We do not want a fight, but we have been chased before, and we learned to bite."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 3, "The Council's laws rarely help those who wander. Vote with us, and perhaps this one will."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 4, "Thank you. The Clan will remember this kindness on the long roads."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 4, "Good. That is fair, and fair is all we ever ask."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 5, "Sadly, we cannot. It would tie us down, and we do not stay tied."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 5, "Forgive us, but no. The Clan has learned to be careful with promises."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 6, "Not quite like that. Here is a gentler way, one that lets us both keep moving."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 7, "This promise cannot come with us, {them}. The Clan must move on, and we are sorry."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 8, "{them}, we trusted you, and you broke it. We will move on, as we always do - but the Clan never forgets a broken road."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 9, "Fine. Take it and let us go. We have been robbed by better than you, {them}, and we remember every one."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 9, "We pay, because we are tired. But the road is long, and it passes your worlds more often than you think."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 10, "Hello, {them}. We are only passing through, but there is always time for a fair word."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 10, "Peace, {them}. The Clans travel light. What do you bring?"},
    {"saar", nullptr, 11, "Our ships often drift past your worlds, {them}. Good neighbours let each other wander."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 11, "You are close to our road. We hope you will let us pass in peace."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 12, "Our last trade was good, {them}. The Clans remember an honest partner."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 12, "You dealt fairly with us before. Come, let us do it again."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word to the Clans. That matters more to us than any cargo."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 13, "An honest promise, honestly kept. Thank you, {them}. We do not forget kindness."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to us, {them}. We have been lied to by better empires than yours."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 14, "Your promise was empty. The Clans will listen, but our holds stay closed until you earn them."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 15, "You attacked our ships, {them}. We only wanted to pass. Why must everyone do this?"},
    {"saar", nullptr, 15, "Your guns found the Clans. We are tired, {them}, but we are not helpless."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 16, "You hold so much, {them}. Empires that grow too large always try to cage the free. Be the exception."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy. Please - do not make it a place where wanderers have no road."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 17, "{them}! A friend on the long road. Sit with us a while."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 17, "The Clans are glad to hear from you. You have always let us roam."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 18, "We are listening, {them}. Carefully. We have learned to be careful."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 18, "Say what you need. The Clans will decide if it frees us or binds us."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 19, "We have nothing to say to you, {them} - but we will hear you, because we are not like you."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 19, "Speak, then leave our road. The Clans would rather be alone."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 20, "We are sorry, {them}, but you stand where the Clan must pass. We will not be stopped again."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 20, "We do not want this fight, {them}. But the Clan has run long enough. Today we stand."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 20, "Pardon us, {them}. Our ships must have this space, and yours are in it."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 21, "We only wanted to pass, {them}. You have chosen this. The Clan has fought hunters before."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 21, "Hunted again, {them}? The Clan knows this song. We know how to sing it back."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 21, "So you are the next to chase us, {them}. Many came before you. The Clan is still here."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 22, "Forgive us, {them}. Our people need ground beneath them, if only for a while. We are coming down."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 22, "The Clan is coming down, {them}. We have nowhere else to go - so we cannot fail."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 22, "Our people need this ground more than you do, {them}. We are sorry. We are landing."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 23, "This is all the Clan has left, {them}. You will have to take it from our hands, one by one."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 23, "Every world we ever had was taken, {them}. Not this one. Not while one of us stands."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 23, "We have lived on drifting stone, {them}. We know how to hold on to what little we have."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 24, "You again, {them}. The Clan does not forget the ones who chase us."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 25, "Everyone wants the throne world, {them}. The Clan only wants a place where no one can chase us again."},
    {"saar", nullptr, 26, "Our home, {them}. The only one we have left. The Clan will not be driven from another."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 0, "KRRAAK! N'orr want trade. You give, N'orr give. Simple. Good."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 0, "{them}! N'orr bring deal. Take it. N'orr not like waiting!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 0, "Skreee... deal for you. Strong deal. N'orr only make strong things."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 1, "You fight good. N'orr respect you. Good deal for strong friend - take!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 2, "Leave! This N'orr place now! Stay, and N'orr crack your ships like shells. SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 3, "Council talk-talk, too much talk. Give N'orr your votes. N'orr end talking."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 4, "Good! Deal done. N'orr happy."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 4, "Yes. Yes! Strong trade. N'orr remember."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 5, "NO! Weak deal. N'orr spit on weak deal!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 5, "Hssss... no. N'orr not fools. Bring better."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 6, "Bad deal. N'orr fix. This one better - take, take!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 7, "Deal over, {them}! N'orr hungry for war now. SKREEEE!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 8, "{them} lie to N'orr?! KRAAAK! N'orr come. N'orr break everything!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 9, "Take it! N'orr remember this. N'orr come back for it - and for you! SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 9, "Bah! Shell bends today. Shell does not break. N'orr will crack yours, {them}."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 10, "You speak to the N'orr. Speak strong, {them}. Weak words die."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 10, "New voice. Is it warrior or prey? Talk."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds near our hive, {them}. Close enough to fight. Close enough to trade."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. We hear your ships. Good. Speak."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 12, "You traded with N'orr before. You still live. Good sign. Talk."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 12, "Last deal was strong. N'orr remember strong deals."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 13, "You kept word. Honour! N'orr respect honour."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept. You are not weak, {them}. Speak."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 14, "You broke word to N'orr, {them}. No honour. Why do we listen? Speak fast."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 14, "Liar. N'orr do not forget liars. Talk, then we see."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 15, "You fought N'orr! Good fight. Now we talk - then maybe fight again."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 15, "You struck the hive, {them}. Brave. Stupid. Speak."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 16, "You are strongest now, {them}. N'orr will come to test that."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 16, "Biggest warrior in galaxy? We will see. Talk first."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 17, "{them}! Strong friend. N'orr glad to see you. Speak!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 17, "Battle-friend! Talk, we listen."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 18, "N'orr watch you, {them}. Speak carefully."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 18, "Not friend. Not prey. Not yet. Talk."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 19, "You are prey to N'orr, {them}. Speak before the hunt."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 19, "N'orr do not like you. Talk short."},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 20, "{them} ships! N'orr smash! Glory to the swarm! SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 20, "N'orr see {them}! N'orr hungry! Charge! SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 20, "Swarm fly at {them} now! No stop! No mercy! Glory!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 21, "{them} fight N'orr? Good! N'orr love fight! Come closer!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 21, "{them} attack N'orr? Ha! Now N'orr have reason! SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 21, "Brave {them}! Brave and soon dead! Swarm come!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 22, "N'orr land now! {them} world belong to swarm! SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 22, "N'orr drop on {them} world! Claws ready! Eat everything!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 22, "Down, down, down! N'orr take {them} world! SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 23, "{them} come to N'orr nest? N'orr bite heads off! Glory!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 23, "N'orr nest! {them} not take! N'orr guard with claws and teeth!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 23, "{them} land on N'orr world? Good! N'orr not need to fly to fight!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 24, "{them} again! N'orr remember! N'orr win this time, and next time! SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 25, "Big throne world! N'orr want it! {them} move, or be crushed!"},
    {"sardakk", nullptr, 26, "{them} at N'orr hive! Whole swarm wake up! Whole swarm angry! SKREEE!"},
    {"sol", nullptr, 0, "The Federation believes in mutually beneficial agreements. We think you'll find these terms very reasonable."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 0, "{them}, let's keep things civil. Here's our proposal - we'd encourage you to take it seriously."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 0, "On behalf of the Federation: a fair arrangement, offered in good faith. Good faith is something we value."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 1, "You've been a good friend to the Federation, and we look after our friends. These terms reflect that."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 2, "Diplomacy is what the Federation prefers. We also have the largest fleets you will ever see. Accept, and we stay diplomatic."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 3, "In the Council, stability matters. Vote with the Federation, and you'll find us grateful partners."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 4, "Excellent. The Federation is glad we could reach an understanding."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. This is how responsible powers do business."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 5, "We appreciate the offer, but the Federation can't support it. Our position stands."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 5, "Respectfully, no. And we'd recommend you don't mistake our patience for weakness."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 6, "That can't be signed as written. Our people have prepared a revised draft - we think you'll find it fair."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 7, "Circumstances have changed, {them}, and the Federation must act in its own interests. We trust you understand."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 8, "{them}, that was a mistake. The Federation is reviewing its options, and every one of them involves our fleet."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 9, "The Federation will comply - for now. We have noted your tone, {them}, and so have our admirals."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 9, "Accepted under protest. Diplomacy failed today. Remember that it was you who chose this road."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 10, "{them}. The Federation is always open to dialogue. What do you have in mind?"},
    {"sol", nullptr, 10, "Good to hear from you. The Federation will consider any reasonable proposal."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 11, "We share a border, {them}. The Federation prefers its borders quiet - let's keep them that way."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 11, "Neighbours should talk. The Federation's door is open."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 12, "Our last agreement worked well for everyone. The Federation would welcome another."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 12, "{them}, a reliable partner. Let's see what we can build this time."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word to the Federation, {them}. That is noted - and appreciated."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 13, "The Federation values partners who honour agreements. You're one of them."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 14, "{them}. The Federation has a long memory, and a short list of those who broke their word to it. You're on it."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 14, "You broke an agreement with us. Anything you offer now gets read very, very carefully."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 15, "You fired on Federation ships, {them}. We're still talking. Consider that a courtesy."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 15, "Our admirals advised against this call. Make it brief, {them}."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 16, "You're ahead, {them}, and the whole Council can see it. The Federation won't help you run away with the game."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 16, "Leaders make everyone nervous. Convince the Federation you're worth trusting."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 17, "Always a pleasure, {them}. The Federation looks after its friends."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 17, "Friends of the Federation get the best terms. Let's hear it."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 18, "The Federation is listening, {them}. Cautiously."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 18, "Let's keep this professional, {them}. What is your proposal?"},
    {"sol", nullptr, 19, "State your business, {them}. Our patience is not unlimited."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 19, "The Federation takes this call under protest. Go ahead."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 20, "Diplomacy has run its course, {them}. The Federation fleet is engaging. Nothing personal."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 20, "All Federation ships, engage the {them} fleet. Keep it clean, keep it quick."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 20, "This sector is now under Federation protection, {them}. Your ships are not."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 21, "You have fired on the Federation, {them}. Our response will be measured, proportional - and overwhelming."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 21, "Contact! {them} has engaged. Shields up, return fire - by the book."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 21, "You started this, {them}. The Federation will finish it. That's a promise."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 22, "Federation troops are making planetfall, {them}. Lay down your arms and you will be treated fairly."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 22, "Marines, you have a green light. {them} garrison, this is your one warning."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 22, "Federation dropships inbound, {them}. We've done this a hundred times. You haven't."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 23, "Federation marines hold this world, {them}. They have trained for exactly this day."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 23, "Dig in, marines - {them} is coming. Nobody takes a Federation position without paying for it."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 23, "You want this world, {them}? Federation troops are holding it. Bring everything you've got."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 24, "We have your fleet's profile on file, {them}. Last time was a warm-up."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex is too important to leave to you, {them}. The Federation is taking responsibility for it."},
    {"sol", nullptr, 26, "You've attacked the Federation's home, {them}. Every reserve we have is coming for you."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 0, "We... have slept long, {them}. Waking, we choose trade, not war. Take this... and let us both stand free."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 0, "Small things... given, and taken. So peace grows. Slowly. As it should."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 0, "Hear us. No chains in this bargain... only fair weight, on both sides."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 1, "Old friend... you let us be, and you let others be. That is rare. Take this... freely given."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 2, "We are slow to wake... and slower to forget. Agree, and the sleep stays deep. Refuse... and the giants rise."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 3, "The Council... decides who stays free. Give your votes with ours... so that no people kneels."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 4, "Mm... yes. It is fair."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 4, "Agreed... Peace holds. A little longer."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 5, "No... This would bind someone. We do not bind."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 5, "Hmm... too heavy. We refuse."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 6, "Not so... Shift the weight. Like this. Then it is fair... and we agree."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 7, "It grieves us, {them}... You stood in the way of our freedom. The sleepers wake now... for you."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 8, "You broke faith, {them}... The giants were sleeping. Not anymore."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 9, "Take it... We are slow to anger... but you have woken something, {them}."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 9, "Very well... This is noted... in stone. Giants remember... for a very long time."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 10, "...We wake... and we hear you... {them}. Speak."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 10, "Long sleep. New voice. ...Speak, {them}. Slowly."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds... close to ours, {them}. ...Good neighbours let each other sleep."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 11, "Near. So near. ...We feel your ships, {them}. Speak."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 12, "You traded... with the Titans before. ...We remember. Again."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 12, "Last bargain... fair. ...The Titans are pleased. Speak."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 13, "You kept... your word, {them}. ...Good. Heavy things should hold."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 13, "Promise... kept. ...Like stone. We trust stone."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 14, "You broke... your word, {them}. ...Broken stone does not mend."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 14, "A lie... to the Titans. ...We are old. We remember all lies."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 15, "You struck... the Titans, {them}. ...We felt it, even asleep."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 15, "You fought us. ...We woke angry. ...Speak."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 16, "You are... the tallest now, {them}. ...Tall things fall hardest."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 16, "You lead. ...The Titans led once. Long ago. ...It passes."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 17, "{them}. ...Friend. ...The Titans are glad you came."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 17, "Warm... like a sun at dawn. ...Speak, friend."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 18, "The Titans... watch you, {them}. ...Slowly. Carefully."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 18, "Not yet trusted. ...Not yet feared. ...Speak."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 19, "The Titans... do not want you, {them}. ...Speak. Then go."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 19, "You anger the old ones, {them}. ...Be brief."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 20, "You woke us, {them}... Now we rise... and the stars shake."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 20, "The giants stir, {them}... and your little ships stand in their shadow."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 20, "Slowly... we turn toward you, {them}... and the stars turn with us."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 21, "You strike at the giants, {them}... We have slept through worse. We will not sleep through you."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 21, "Strike the mountain, {them}... the mountain does not notice. Then it does."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 21, "You wake us with fire, {them}... we answer with more."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 22, "We come down from the sky, {them}... as mountains fall. Slowly. Completely."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 22, "We descend on your world, {them}... and the ground groans under us."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 22, "Your world is small, {them}... we will make it ours... one footstep at a time."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 23, "The ground here remembers us, {them}... and we are the ground. Try to move it."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 23, "Dig in your heels, {them}... we are the bedrock. You are the dust."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 23, "We have held this ground longer than your people have had names, {them}... we will hold it longer still."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 24, "Again, {them}?... we remember you... giants forget nothing."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 25, "The throne world, {them}... we remember when it was young... it will remember us."},
    {"titans", nullptr, 26, "You come to the halls where the giants sleep, {them}?... we are awake now... all of us."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 0, "Sit down, {them}, sit. The family has a little proposition for you. Strictly between us, of course."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 0, "I like you, so I'm gonna make this easy. You take this, and the Syndicate owes you a favour."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 0, "Nobody needs to hear about this deal. That's what makes it such a good one."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 1, "You're practically family now. And the family takes care of its own - here, this is for you."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 2, "Nice fleet you got there. Be a real shame if something happened to it. So - do we have a deal?"},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 3, "The Council's got a vote coming. Vote the way the family likes, and your little secrets stay buried."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 4, "Good. Very good. You made the smart choice - I knew you would."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 4, "We have an understanding, then. Nobody talks, everybody's happy."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 5, "No. You come to me with this? That's disrespectful, my friend."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 5, "I'm gonna pretend I never heard that offer. For your sake."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 6, "Let me fix this for you. The family's terms are right here - and they're very reasonable."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 7, "Nothing personal, {them} - it's just business. You should have known the family always comes first."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 8, "You crossed the family, {them}. That's the one thing you never do. We'll be in touch."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 9, "Sure, take it. Family remembers, {them}. Family always remembers."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 9, "Okay, you got me. That's a favour I owe you now - and I always repay my favours."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 10, "{them}. So nice of you to call the family. What can we do for you?"},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 10, "Come in, {them}. Sit. The Syndicate always has time for friends."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 11, "You live right next door, {them}. Neighbours look after each other. Don't they?"},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. Such a nice neighbourhood. It would be a shame if anything happened to it."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 12, "You've done business with the family before, {them}. We remember our friends."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 12, "Back again. The family appreciates loyalty. Speak."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. That's respect. The family values respect."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 13, "A man of his word. Or whatever you are. Good. Talk."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the family, {them}. That hurts us. Deeply. Speak."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise, {them}. In our business, that's a debt. Debts get paid."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 15, "You hurt the family, {them}. We're still talking. That's a courtesy. Don't waste it."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 15, "You attacked us. Bad for business. Bad for your health. Speak."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 16, "You're on top, {them}. Big man. Big men need friends. Or they fall."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy. Everyone wants a piece. We could help. For a favour."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 17, "{them}! Family. Speak, anything you need."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 17, "For you, friend, the door is always open."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 18, "We're watching you, {them}. Quietly. Respectfully. Talk."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 18, "The family hasn't decided about you. Speak."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 19, "You disrespected the family, {them}. Talk, while you still can."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 19, "We don't like you, {them}. Nothing personal. Speak."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 20, "You didn't pay your respects, {them}. The family's here to collect - with interest."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 20, "Nothing personal, {them}. The family just needs this sector. You understand."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 20, "We asked nicely, {them}. Twice. The family doesn't ask a third time."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 21, "You hit one of ours, {them}? Big mistake. The family takes care of its own."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 21, "You made a big mistake, {them}. Huge. The family never forgets a slight."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 21, "Shooting at the family, {them}? Now we have to send a message. A loud one."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 22, "The family's moving into your neighbourhood, {them}. Nothing personal - just business."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 22, "The boys are landing, {them}. They'll be polite. Mostly."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 22, "Your world needs protection, {them}. We're here to provide it. You'll be paying for it."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 23, "This is family territory, {them}. You come here, you don't leave."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 23, "Walk away, {them}. Walk away while you still can."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 23, "Everybody on this world knows the family, {them}. Nobody here will help you."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 24, "We meet again, {them}. The family's been waiting. The family's very patient."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex is a nice place, {them}. Be a shame if the wrong people ran it. People like you."},
    {"tnelis", nullptr, 26, "You came to the family's house, {them}? With guns? Oh, that's a terrible lack of respect."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 0, "Your account is looking thin, {them}. Here's an arrangement to help - at very reasonable interest."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 0, "Everyone owes the Vaden something sooner or later. Why not start now, on favourable terms?"},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 0, "Consider this an investment in you. Of course, the clans always collect on their investments."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 1, "One of our best customers! For you, the clans will waive a little interest. A little."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 2, "Your debt is overdue. Settle on these terms, or we send the collectors - and they bring warships."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 3, "Votes are a currency too, and you're short on every other kind. Vote with us and we'll adjust the ledger."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 4, "Wonderful. It's entered in the ledger - and the ledger never forgets."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. Pleasure doing business. Your next payment is due shortly."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 5, "No. That offer wouldn't cover the interest on what you already owe us."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 5, "The clans don't lend against such poor security. Declined."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 6, "This barely covers the fees. Here are the clans' terms - do read the small print carefully."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 7, "Your credit has run out, {them}. The clans are calling in everything - starting now."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 8, "Default, {them}? Oh, you'll pay for this. Principal, interest and penalties. In full."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 9, "Take it. We've opened a new account in your name, {them} - and the interest has already started."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 9, "Paid. You are now in debt to the Clans. Nobody stays out of our ledgers for long."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 10, "Ah, {them}. The banking clans are open for business. Your account is waiting."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 10, "Welcome, {them}. Interest rates are excellent today. For us."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 11, "You live next to our vaults, {them}. Neighbours make the best borrowers."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour! We've already opened an account in your name. You're welcome."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 12, "You've done business with the Vaden before, {them}. Your ledger is... acceptable."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 12, "Returning customer. Your credit is good. For now."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 13, "You paid your dues, {them}. Your credit rating is excellent."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept, like a debt repaid. The clans approve."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 14, "You defaulted on your word, {them}. Interest is accruing. Rapidly."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise is a debt, {them}. The clans always collect."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 15, "You attacked our assets, {them}. That will be added to your bill."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 15, "Damages incurred. Payment expected. Speak."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. Wealthy clients get premium rates. Higher ones."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 16, "You're ahead. Your account is very interesting to us."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 17, "Valued client {them}! Speak, and let's make money."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 17, "For you, friend, a lower rate. Slightly."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 18, "Your account is under review, {them}. Speak."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 18, "The clans are cautious with your credit."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 19, "Your account is closed, {them}. Speak, then pay."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 19, "The collectors are coming, {them}. Be brief."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 20, "Your account is delinquent, {them}. The collectors are here to repossess your fleet."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 20, "Payment is overdue, {them}. Our collectors accept fleets as settlement."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 20, "Interest has been compounding, {them}. Today we collect - principal, interest and hull plating."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 21, "Firing on your creditors, {them}? That adds a hefty penalty to your balance."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 21, "Shooting at the bank, {them}? That's a late fee, a penalty fee and a funeral fee."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 21, "Attack us, {them}, and your debt doubles. We always collect."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 22, "Your world is now collateral, {them}. The bailiffs are landing."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 22, "Repossession team landing, {them}. Everything on this world is listed as an asset now."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 22, "Foreclosure, {them}. Your world defaulted. Our bailiffs are here to clear the premises."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 23, "This vault is not for sale, {them}. Attempted robbery carries the steepest interest of all."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 23, "The vault stays closed, {them}. Break-ins are billed at the highest rate."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 23, "You cannot afford this world, {them}. Trust us. We have seen your accounts."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 24, "Ah, {them}. Still owing from last time. We added it to today's bill."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex has been in arrears for centuries, {them}. The clans are calling in the debt."},
    {"vaden", nullptr, 26, "An attack on the clan treasury, {them}? Every ledger in the galaxy now lists you in red."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 0, "We have your scent, {them}. Trade with us now, while it is still a trade and not a hunt."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 0, "A good hunter knows when to feed and when to wait. Today, the Scourge offers to wait."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 0, "Take this deal. It is the one door we have left open - and we never leave doors open for long."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 1, "You run with the pack, not ahead of it. Take this - the Scourge shares its kills with friends."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 2, "Do as we say. Or run, if you like - we enjoy that part, and nothing ever outruns us."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 3, "Vote with us in the Council, and the hunt passes over you this season."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. You chose not to run. Wise prey live longer."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. The hunt can wait - this time."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 5, "No. We would rather take it the old way, after the chase."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 5, "Refused. Prey does not set the terms."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 6, "You bargain like prey begging for its life. Here are the hunter's terms."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 7, "There is nowhere to run, {them}. The truce was only us circling closer."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 8, "You struck and fled, {them}? Run, then. We will be there when you stop."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 9, "Take it. You have our scent now, {them}. More to the point, we have yours."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 9, "Fine. Run along with it. We do so enjoy the chase that comes after."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 10, "The Scourge catches your scent, {them}. Speak. Quickly."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 10, "A voice in the dark. How brave, {them}. Or how foolish."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds are so near our hunting grounds, {them}. We can smell them from here."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour... prey that lives close never sleeps well."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 12, "You have dealt with the Scourge before, {them}, and you still run. Good."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 12, "Another deal? The last one kept you alive. Let's see about this one."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Clever prey. We almost respect it."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept. We will hunt someone else today."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. Prey that lies gets chased hardest."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 14, "You lied to the Scourge. We have your scent now. Forever."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 15, "You attacked us, {them}. The hunt is on. Speak while you can."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 15, "You bit the Scourge. Bold prey. We like a chase."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. The biggest prey attracts the most hunters."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. We love when prey grows fat."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 17, "{them}. You are not prey. Today. Speak."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 17, "The Scourge lets you walk freely. Talk."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 18, "We circle you, {them}. Not yet hunting. Watching."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 18, "Speak. We are deciding if you are prey."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 19, "You are prey, {them}. Run, or speak."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 19, "We have your scent, {them}. Talk fast."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 20, "We caught your scent long ago, {them}. Run, if you want - we do enjoy the chase."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 20, "There you are, {them}. The chase was fun. The kill will be better."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 20, "Run, {them}. Please. It's so dull when prey just sits there."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 21, "You turned to fight, {them}? Good. Prey that bites is so much more fun."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 21, "Teeth out, {them}? Cute. The Scourge has better teeth."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 21, "Cornered prey fights hardest, {them}. We like that. It ends the same way."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 22, "We're on your world now, {them}. Hide anywhere you like. We'll find you."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 22, "The hunters are down, {them}. Your garrison has ten minutes. Make them count."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 22, "Fresh tracks on your world, {them}. We'll follow every one of them."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 23, "You walked into our den, {them}. That's the last mistake prey ever makes."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 23, "This is our hunting ground, {them}. You're not hunting here. You're being hunted."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 23, "Land, {them}. Go on. We've been waiting in the tall grass."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 24, "Same prey, same scent, {them}. You got away last time. That won't happen twice."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 25, "All the galaxy's prey comes to Mecatol Rex, {them}. The best hunting ground of all."},
    {"vaylerian", nullptr, 26, "You followed us home, {them}? Bad idea. Every hunter in the Scourge is home tonight."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 0, "Great news, {them}! The Sovereignty sees real synergy between us. Let's talk partnership."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 0, "Our analysts ran the numbers, and this arrangement is a win-win. Ready to sign?"},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 0, "We're expanding into your market, and we'd love to have you on board. Here's our opening proposal."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 1, "You've been an outstanding partner this quarter. Please accept this as a token of our appreciation."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 2, "We can do this as a merger or as a hostile takeover. Accept the terms - you'll prefer the merger."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 3, "The Council is just a board meeting with bigger fleets. Vote with us and we'll make it worth your while."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 4, "Excellent! Welcome aboard. Our people will be in touch with your people."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 4, "Deal closed. The shareholders will be delighted."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 5, "We'll have to pass. The numbers simply don't work for the Sovereignty."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 5, "Thanks, but no. That proposal isn't aligned with our growth strategy."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 6, "Love the energy, but the terms need restructuring. Here's our revised offer."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 7, "We're restructuring, {them}, and your position has been eliminated. Effective immediately."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 8, "Breach of contract, {them}. Our legal department will be in touch - and it flies dreadnoughts."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 9, "Fine, we'll book it as a one-time loss. Your company is now on our hostile-takeover list, {them}."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 9, "Agreed. Consider our partnership terminated - and our acquisitions team notified."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 10, "Veldyr Sovereignty, partnerships division! Great to connect, {them}. Let's talk growth."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 10, "Hi {them}! Let's touch base and explore some synergies."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 11, "You're right next to one of our branch offices, {them}! Let's leverage that proximity."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour! Our regional office sees great potential in your market."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 12, "Our last partnership with you was a great success, {them}! Let's scale it up."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 12, "Repeat partner! Our shareholders love you. Let's circle back."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 13, "You delivered on your commitments, {them}! That's the kind of partner we value."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 13, "Promise kept. Excellent. Your partnership rating is trending up."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 14, "You broke a commitment, {them}. Disappointing. We'll need to restructure."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 14, "Last quarter you didn't deliver. Let's realign expectations."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 15, "You attacked our assets, {them}. Not great for the relationship. Let's talk solutions."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 15, "Hostile action noted. We're open to a hostile takeover. Of you."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 16, "You're the market leader, {them}! Impressive. We'd love to acquire some of that."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 16, "Top of the galaxy! Have you considered a merger? We have."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 17, "{them}! Our favourite stakeholder. Let's make something happen."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 17, "Love this partnership. Talk to us."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 18, "We're doing due diligence on you, {them}. Pitch away."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 18, "Let's see the numbers, {them}. Then we'll decide."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 19, "You're not a good fit for our portfolio, {them}. Make it quick."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 19, "We'd rather buy you out, {them}. Talk."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 20, "We're initiating a hostile takeover of your fleet, {them}. Effective immediately."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 20, "Restructuring your fleet, {them}. Unfortunately, every position has been eliminated."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 20, "Let's circle back to your fleet, {them}. We've decided to downsize it. To zero."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 21, "{them} has attacked a Veldyr branch office. The board has approved a decisive response."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 21, "Aggressive move, {them}. The board admires it. The board is also going to crush it."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 21, "Escalating to senior management, {them}. They are very heavily armed."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 22, "Your world is our newest acquisition, {them}. Staff will be retained... selectively."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 22, "Our merger team is landing, {them}. Synergies will be found. Resistance will not."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 22, "Welcome to the Veldyr family, {them}. Your world has been onboarded. Your garrison has been let go."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 23, "This branch is not for sale, {them}. Our security department will see you out."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 23, "We are not accepting offers for this world, {them}. Especially hostile ones."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 23, "Corporate security is on site, {them}. Please exit the premises. Quickly."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 24, "Per our last meeting, {them}, we have some action items. All of them are weapons."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex: the ultimate head office, {them}. The Veldyr expansion plan has it on page one."},
    {"veldyr", nullptr, 26, "An attack on head office, {them}? The board is calling an emergency meeting. The meeting is a battle."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 0, "The Winnu offer terms - not as beggars, but as the rightful masters of Mecatol Rex."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 0, "{them}, the age of the Lazax is dead, and good riddance. Deal with the Winnu, who will lead what comes next."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 0, "We were ruled once, and we will never kneel again. These terms are offered as equals - for now."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 1, "You have respected the Winnu's claim. Such loyalty will be remembered when the throne is ours. Take these terms."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 2, "Withdraw. No one will stand between the Winnu and the Council again - not the Lazax, and certainly not you."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 3, "By right, the Council belongs to the Winnu. Give us your votes and stand on the right side of history."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 4, "Accepted. The Winnu remember those who helped us rise."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 4, "Good. Another step toward the throne that is ours."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 5, "No. The Winnu bowed to masters once. We will not bow to your terms."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 5, "Refused. You speak to us as the Lazax did, and look how they ended."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 6, "Your offer smells of the old empire. Here are terms fit for the true heirs of the Council."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 7, "Thrones demand sacrifices, {them}. Today, that sacrifice is you."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you treat us as the Lazax did. They are dust now. Remember that."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 9, "Take it. You are no better than the Lazax were, {them} - and the Winnu outlived them too."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 9, "We yield this, not our right. The Winnu will still be seated at the Council long after you are gone."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 10, "You address the rightful heirs of Mecatol Rex, {them}. Speak with respect."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 10, "The Winnu hear you, {them}. The throne remembers everyone who comes to it."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds border the lands of the true heirs, {them}. Remember whose galaxy this is."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 11, "As our neighbour, {them}, you will witness our return to the throne. Speak."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 12, "You have dealt with the Winnu before, {them}. The heirs remember their friends."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 12, "Our last agreement served the throne. Another may serve it too."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. When we sit the throne again, we will remember it."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 13, "A promise honoured. Such loyalty will have a place in the new empire."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the heirs of the throne, {them}. That is recorded in our histories."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 14, "You lied to the Winnu once, {them}. The throne has seen many liars. It outlasted them all."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 15, "You raised arms against the Winnu, {them}. Even the Lazax did not dare that in the end."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 15, "Your attack on the heirs was noted, {them}. Speak - but know that we remember."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}? It is not yours to lead. The throne waits for us."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 16, "You climb high, {them}. Mind you do not reach for a seat that is not yours."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 17, "{them}, a friend to the heirs. You are welcome before the throne."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 17, "The Winnu greet you warmly, {them}. Few have earned that."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 18, "We weigh you carefully, {them}. The throne needs allies, not usurpers."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 18, "Speak, {them}. The heirs are listening, and judging."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 19, "You stand in the way of the throne, {them}. Speak, and stand aside."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 19, "The Winnu have little to say to you, {them}. Be brief."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 20, "You stand between the Winnu and our birthright, {them}. That is the last mistake you will make."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 20, "The heirs of the throne will not be blocked, {them}. Move, or be swept aside."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 20, "Every world we take back is another step home, {them}. You are standing on one of those steps."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 21, "Strike the Winnu, {them}, and you strike the rightful heirs of the throne. You will regret it."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 21, "You strike the Winnu, {them}? History will remember you as a footnote. A short one."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 21, "We have been wronged before, {them}. We have learned to answer swiftly."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 22, "This world will kneel to its true rulers, {them}. Your garrison will be the first to learn."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 22, "We return to this world as its rightful lords, {them}. Your claim ends today."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 22, "Our soldiers land to restore what was taken, {them}. Stand down, usurper."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 23, "The Winnu have been driven from too much already, {them}. Not this world. Never again."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 23, "Not one more step, {them}. The heirs have yielded enough ground for a thousand years."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 23, "You want this world, {them}? Its true rulers are here, and they are not leaving."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 24, "You again, {them}? The Winnu remember every insult. Every single one."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 25, "The throne is ours by right, {them}. Step away from our inheritance."},
    {"winnu", nullptr, 26, "You attack the last home of the rightful heirs, {them}? Then the Winnu fight with nothing left to lose."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 0, "Hmm... let us not hurry. The Kingdom offers a fair agreement, and fair agreements last."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 0, "{them}, peace is built one small bargain at a time. Here is ours. Consider it slowly."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 0, "The Xxcha prefer words to weapons. These terms are our words - gentle, and sincere."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 1, "Old friend, you have been patient with us. The Kingdom returns the kindness. Take these terms."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 2, "We ask you, calmly, to withdraw. Our guns are very patient too, and they are always watching."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 3, "Wars are best prevented in the Council. Stand with the Kingdom on this vote, and spare us all a great deal of trouble."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 4, "Mmm. Good. A peaceful bargain is the best kind. Accepted."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. May this be the first of many quiet understandings."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 5, "No, we think not. Take your time, and bring us something wiser."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 5, "Regrettably, we must refuse - politely, but completely."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 6, "Close, but rushed. We have smoothed the rough edges. These terms, perhaps?"},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 7, "This grieves us deeply, {them}. But the Kingdom must outlast every friendship, even yours."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 8, "{them}, we offered you peace, and you chose otherwise. Our shell is thick, and our guns are many."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 9, "We give this... calmly. We are old, {them}, and old shells carry very long memories."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 9, "Very well. Peace is worth a price. Do not make us pay it twice - even our patience has an end."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 10, "Welcome, {them}. Sit... take your time. The Kingdom is in no hurry."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 10, "A visitor. How pleasant. Speak slowly, {them} - good words should not be rushed."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 11, "Our worlds are close, {them}. Close neighbours should be patient with each other."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 11, "You live beside the Kingdom, {them}. We hope for many quiet years together."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 12, "Our last agreement was a good one, {them}. Shall we plant another seed?"},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 12, "You have dealt with the Kingdom before. We remember it fondly."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. The Kingdom honours those who honour their promises."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept is a stone in the foundation of peace. Thank you."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Kingdom, {them}. We are patient... but we are not forgetful."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 14, "A promise of yours fell, {them}. The Kingdom will listen - and verify everything."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the Kingdom, {them}. We prefer peace. But our walls are very thick."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 15, "Your guns were turned on us. Still, the Kingdom will talk. Talking is always better."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. Power that grows too fast frightens everyone. Grow gently."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. The Council watches you closely now. So do we."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 17, "{them}, old friend. The Kingdom is always glad to hear your voice."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 17, "For you, the Kingdom's doors are wide open. Please, speak."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 18, "The Kingdom listens, {them}. Carefully. Patiently. Speak."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 18, "We are not yet sure of you, {them}. Time will tell. Time always does."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 19, "The Kingdom is a fortress to you now, {them}. Speak through the gate."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 19, "Our patience with you is long, {them}, but it is not endless."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 20, "We regret this, {them}. We asked so patiently. Now our guns must speak where our words could not."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 20, "We tried every word we knew, {them}. These are the last ones. Fire."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 20, "Patience has limits, {them}, even ours. Today you have found them."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 21, "You strike first, {them}. We are slow to anger... but we are very, very hard to break."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 21, "You leave us no choice, {them}. We will defend ourselves, slowly and thoroughly."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 21, "An attack, {them}? We are disappointed. Disappointment, for the Xxcha, is very dangerous."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 22, "Our soldiers land slowly, {them}, but they do not stop. Please surrender; we would prefer it."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 22, "We land with regret, {them}. We will remove your garrison as gently as it allows."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 22, "Slowly, our soldiers come to your world, {them}. They will not hurry, and they will not stop."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 23, "Our shells have weathered longer storms than you, {them}. Strike all you like - we endure."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 23, "We have held this world through long seasons, {them}. Yours will be a short one."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 23, "Thick shells and thicker patience, {them}. Try to wait us out."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 24, "We hoped never to meet you like this again, {them}. And yet, here we are."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex should be a place for talking, {them}. Since you insist on fighting here, we will end it quickly."},
    {"xxcha", nullptr, 26, "You bring war to our home, {them}. The Kingdom has been patient for too long."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 0, "Brother, the Brotherhood offers you a place among the faithful. This deal is only the first step."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 0, "{them}, you are lost, but you need not stay lost. Accept these terms, and walk with us."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 0, "We are one mind in many bodies. Join the cause, and this bargain becomes a gift of devotion."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 1, "You have heard the call, and the Brotherhood welcomes you. These terms are offered as to one of our own."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 2, "Withdraw, or be shown the true path. All who resist the cause are eventually... converted."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 3, "The faith must have a voice in the Council. Give it yours, and be counted among the righteous."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 4, "Rejoice! You have taken a step toward the light. Accepted."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 4, "It is done. The Brotherhood embraces you, as it embraces all who obey."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 5, "No. Such terms serve only the self, and the self is a lie."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 5, "Refused, seeker. Pray on it, and return when you are ready to give more."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 6, "Your offer is unworthy of the faith. Here are terms that will purify it."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 7, "Never were you truly one of us, {them}. The Brotherhood casts you out."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 8, "{them}, you have turned from the path. We are many, we are one, and we are coming for you."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 9, "We give, as the cause teaches. But the cause also teaches that every threat is answered, {them}... in time."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 9, "Take it. Your soul grows heavier with each such deed. We will be there when it falls."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 10, "Welcome, lost one. The Brotherhood is always ready to listen to a seeker."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 10, "{them}. The faithful hear you. Perhaps today you will hear us too."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds lie close to the faithful, {them}. So close to salvation."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour, the Brotherhood watches over you. Whether you wish it or not."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 12, "You have shared with the Brotherhood before, {them}. Each gift brings you closer."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 12, "Our last exchange was a blessing. Let us be blessed again."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. The faithful see goodness in you. Come further."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 13, "A promise honoured is a prayer answered. The Brotherhood is pleased."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the faithful, {them}. Repent - and perhaps you will be heard."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 14, "Your promise was false, {them}. The Brotherhood forgives. The Brotherhood also remembers."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the faithful, {them}. We bear it, as martyrs do. Now speak."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 15, "You raised arms against the Brotherhood. Your soul is heavier for it. Talk."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 16, "You hold much, {them}, but you are still empty. The Brotherhood can fill you."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, and you are still lost. Let the faithful guide you."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 17, "Brother {them}! The faithful rejoice to hear you."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 17, "You are close to the light, {them}. Speak, and let us help."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 18, "The Brotherhood is listening, {them}. Doubt still clouds you."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 18, "Speak, seeker. We have not decided if you can be saved."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 19, "The faithful pity you, {them}. Speak, if you must."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 19, "Your heart is closed to the Brotherhood, {them}. Ours is closing to you."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 20, "Rejoice, {them}! Today the Brotherhood brings you the truth - by force, if it must."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 20, "The Brotherhood moves as one, {them}. Your fleet will be cleansed in our light."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 20, "Behold, {them}! The faithful are coming, and we are not afraid to die."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 21, "You raise arms against the faithful, {them}? Every one of us who falls is reborn."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 21, "You strike at the faithful, {them}? Our martyrs thank you for the honour."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 21, "Every brother you kill, {them}, rises again in the Brotherhood. We are endless."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 22, "Brothers descend upon your world, {them}. Its people will be shown the true path, all of them."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 22, "Descend, brothers! {them}, your world will hear the truth before nightfall."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 22, "The faithful land upon your world, {them}. Convert, or be remembered as an example."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 23, "We are many, and we are one, {them}. Break a brother here, and another takes his place."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 23, "This world is consecrated, {them}. Every brother here will die for it gladly."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 23, "You land among the faithful, {them}. We will not run. We have never run."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 24, "You fight the faithful again, {them}? You have learned nothing. We have learned everything."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex will be a temple, {them}. The Brotherhood will cleanse it first."},
    {"yin", nullptr, 26, "You attack the heart of the Brotherhood, {them}? Every brother wakes, and every brother fights."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 0, "Psst. A deal, off the record. No one else needs to know - and no one will."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 0, "{them}, the Tribes hear many things. Take this deal, and some of them stay unheard."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 0, "We have a job for you, and profit for us both. Quietly, of course. Always quietly."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 1, "You have kept our secrets, so we keep yours. Honest terms, from the shadows to a friend."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 2, "Your fleets sleep in such predictable places. Take these terms and move along, and they keep sleeping."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 3, "Every vote in the Council has a price, and we always know it. Sell yours to the Tribes, discreetly."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 4, "Done. This conversation never happened."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 4, "Agreed. A pleasure doing business in the dark."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 5, "No. We have seen your hand, and this deal is not worth the risk."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 5, "Pass. The Tribes smell a trap, and we do not walk into traps - we set them."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 6, "Interesting... but we read the fine print you hid. Here are our terms, nothing hidden. Mostly."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 7, "Thought you knew our game, {them}? You never even saw the board. Goodbye."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 8, "{them}, sloppy work. We were watching the whole time, and now we know exactly where to strike."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 9, "Take it. We heard every word you said, {them}... and we know who would pay to hear them too."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 9, "Fine. Enjoy it. Shadows remember who cast them, and they have such long reach."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 10, "Ah, {them}. We were wondering when you'd call. We hear everything, you know."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 10, "Speak softly, {them}. The Tribes are always listening."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 11, "You live right next door to the Tribes, {them}. We know what you had for breakfast."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 11, "Neighbours, eh? We've had eyes on your worlds for a long while."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 12, "Back for more, {them}? Our last little arrangement stayed nicely quiet."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 12, "You've dealt with us before. And kept quiet about it. Good."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. We checked. We always check."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept - we heard it in the shadows. Interesting. Very interesting."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word to the Tribes, {them}. Whispers travel fast, and that one's everywhere."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 14, "We know what you did, {them}. Everybody does. We made sure of it."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the Tribes, {them}. Funny - our spies saw it coming before you did."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 15, "Bold move, hitting the Tribes. We'll talk. We're always listening for weaknesses."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 16, "You're ahead, {them}. The leader always has the most secrets. We'd love to hear yours."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 16, "Top of the galaxy. That means everyone's watching you. Especially us."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 17, "{them}, my friend. For you, a little secret, free of charge. Speak."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 17, "The Tribes like you. That's worth more than you know. Talk."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 18, "We're listening, {them}. We're always listening."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 18, "Speak. We'll compare it with what we already know."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 19, "The Tribes have plenty on you, {them}. Speak carefully."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 19, "You're not welcome here, {them}. But we'll listen. We always do."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 20, "We've watched your fleet for days, {them}. We know where it's weak. Shall we show you?"},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 20, "Surprise, {them}. You thought you knew where we were. You didn't."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 20, "We know your shield frequencies, {them}. And your crew rosters. And your lunch menu."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 21, "You came looking for us, {them}? Funny. We were already behind you."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 21, "You found us, {them}? Odd. We let you."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 21, "Shooting at us, {them}? You're shooting at decoys. We're the ones next to you."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 22, "Our agents landed before you knew to look, {them}. The rest of us are just catching up."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 22, "Our people have been on your world for weeks, {them}. Now they're just making it official."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 22, "The doors of your bunkers are already open, {them}. We opened them last night."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 23, "You'll never find all of us on this world, {them}. But we'll find all of you."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 23, "Land wherever you like, {them}. We've mined every spot you'll choose."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 23, "You'll be fighting in our jungle, {them}. You'll never see who shoots you."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 24, "Back again, {them}? We kept watching after last time. We know even more now."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 25, "Everyone's watching Mecatol Rex, {them}. We've been watching the ones who watch it."},
    {"yssaril", nullptr, 26, "Took you long enough to find our home, {them}. Now try leaving it."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 0, "The faithful of Rhodun extend a hand, {them}. Take it, and walk closer to the true knowledge."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 0, "Knowledge belongs to the worthy. Prove your worth: accept this, and be counted among them."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 0, "Our scripture teaches that honest trade purifies both parties. Let us be purified together."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 1, "You have shown reverence, friend, where others showed none. Accept this blessing from Rhodun."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 2, "Your machines grow proud, and pride is heresy. Submit to our terms, or we will humble them."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 3, "The Council strays from the true path. Vote with the faithful and help us lead it back."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 4, "It is righteous. Rhodun accepts, and the archives record your devotion."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 4, "Blessed be this pact. Go, and keep faith with what you have sworn."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 5, "Heresy! We will not barter sacred things for so profane an offer."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 5, "No. The faithful do not bow to offers like this one."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 6, "Your offer is flawed, as all unguided work is flawed. Here it is, corrected by the faith."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 7, "Your knowledge was never yours, {them}. Rhodun has come to take it back."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 8, "Faithless {them}! Your betrayal is written in the archives - and the faithful will answer it."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 9, "Take it. Coercion is heresy, {them}, and every heresy is answered."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 9, "We yield, as the faithful sometimes must. Your penance is merely postponed."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 10, "The Rhodun hear you, {them}. Speak truly. Lies are heresy."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 10, "You come before the Inquisition, {them}. State your purpose."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 11, "Your worlds lie near our sanctums, {them}. Your machines are watched. Closely."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 11, "Neighbour. We hear your engines. Are they pure? We will find out."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 12, "You have traded with us before, {them}. Your offering was acceptable. Again."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 12, "Our last covenant was clean. Continue."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 13, "You kept your word, {them}. Truth is sacred. You honour it."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 13, "A promise kept. The Inquisition notes your purity."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 14, "You broke your word, {them}. A lie is heresy. Heresy is corrected."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 14, "A broken promise. The Inquisition is listening. Confess."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 15, "You attacked the faithful, {them}. Your sins are recorded."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 15, "You raised arms against the Rhodun. Repent, and speak."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 16, "You lead the galaxy, {them}. Pride is a heresy too."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 16, "You are ahead. Power without truth must be corrected."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 17, "{them}, a faithful friend. Speak."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 17, "The Rhodun bless you. Go on."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 18, "The Inquisition watches you, {them}. Speak."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 18, "Your purity is uncertain. Prove it."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 19, "You are a heretic, {them}. Speak your last."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 19, "Correction awaits you, {them}. Be brief."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 20, "Your heretic machines will burn, {them}. Purify them in fire!"},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 20, "Heresy detected in your fleet, {them}. The inquisition brings correction - by fire."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 20, "Every engine you run is a sin, {them}. Today we absolve you of all of them."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 21, "You raise forbidden weapons against the faithful, {them}? Heresy upon heresy!"},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 21, "Blasphemers fire upon the faithful! {them}, your machines will be broken on the altar!"},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 21, "Your weapons are an abomination, {them}. Our faith is the only armour we need. And our guns."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 22, "The inquisition descends on your world, {them}. Every proud machine will be broken."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 22, "Purifiers, descend! {them}, your world's machines will be judged and found wanting."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 22, "We land to cleanse your forges, {them}. Repent, and you may keep your tools."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 23, "This holy ground rejects your machines, {them}. Come, and be cleansed."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 23, "Not one heretic machine will set foot on this holy world, {them}. Not one."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 23, "Turn back, {them}. This ground is sanctified, and your engines defile it."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 24, "You return, {them}? Our inquisitors kept your name on the list of heretics."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 25, "Mecatol Rex is a reliquary of forbidden knowledge, {them}. It must be purified, and it must be ours."},
    {"zealots", nullptr, 26, "You defile the holy seat itself, {them}? Every zealot of the faith rises against you."},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 0, "grrrkkkhrrgh... [Trade with the stone, {them}. Stone is honest. Stone is heavy.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 0, "krrrghhkkk... rrgh... [We offer. You take. Simple, like a falling rock.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 0, "hrrrkkgrrrhh... [This deal is solid. Solid like us. Accept.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 1, "rrrhhgrrmm... [You stand firm, friend. The Purifiers do not crush what stands firm.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 2, "KRRRGHHKKKRRR... [Leave as we ask. Or we fall on you from the sky.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 3, "grrhkk... rrrrgh... [Votes. Ours and yours, together. The Council will feel our weight.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 4, "rrghrghkkk... [Acceptable. It is set in stone.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 4, "hhrrrmmkkk... [Good. We crush nothing today.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 5, "KRRKKK... grrhh... [No. This offer is gravel.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 5, "rrrrgggghhh... [Refused. Rock does not bend.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 6, "grrkkhrrghk... [Wrong shape. Here. We chip it into a better one.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 7, "KHRRRGGHHKKK... [Nothing personal, {them}. Your world simply needs purifying.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 8, "RRRGGHHHKKKRRR!... [You crack the stone, {them}? Then the stone falls on you.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 9, "GRRRKKKRRGH... [Take it. Rock remembers every crack, {them}.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 9, "KKKRRRGHHH... [Yours, for now. Every world is purified in the end.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 10, "grrrkkhhrr... [The stone hears you, {them}. Speak.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 10, "krrrrghh... rrgh... [A voice. Small. Talk, little world.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 11, "hrrrkkkgrr... [Your worlds are near, {them}. Near enough to fall on.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 11, "grrrhh... kkrrgh... [Neighbour. Stay solid. Stone respects solid.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 12, "rrrgghhkk... [We traded before, {them}. It held. Again.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 12, "krrghh... [Another deal. Heavy. Good.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 13, "grrrrkkh... [You kept your word, {them}. Solid. Like us.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 13, "hrrrgh... [Promise held. Stone remembers.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 14, "KRRRGHHKK... [You broke your word, {them}. Cracked things get crushed.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 14, "grrkk... RRRGH... [Liar. The stone is falling toward you.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 15, "KRRRRGGHH... [You struck the stone, {them}. We felt it. We fall faster now.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 15, "hrrkk... grrrh... [You attacked us. Impact is coming.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 16, "grrrhhkk... [You stand highest, {them}. Tall worlds make good targets.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 16, "krrrgh... [You lead. The stone does not care. The stone falls anyway.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 17, "rrrhhmmm... [Friend {them}. The stone will not fall on you.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 17, "grrmm... [Good. Speak, friend.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 18, "hrrrkk... [We watch, {them}. We orbit. Speak.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 18, "grrkkhh... [Not yet decided. Talk.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 19, "KRRRGGHH... [You are a target, {them}. Speak, before impact.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 19, "grrRRKKH... [Purify. Purify. Talk fast, {them}.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 20, "KRRGHHHKKRRR... [Your fleet lies in the path of the impact, {them}. Brace.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 20, "GRRRKKKRRGH... [You are in the path of the falling stone, {them}. There is no other path.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 20, "KRRKKGHHH... [Impact is coming, {them}. Impact always comes.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 21, "RRRGHKKK... [You strike stone, {them}. Stone strikes back harder.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 21, "RRGHHKKRR... [You chip at the rock, {them}. The rock does not notice.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 21, "KKGRRRHH... [Your weapons scratch, {them}. Ours crush.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 22, "KKRRRGGHHHRR... [We fall upon your world, {them}. It will be purified.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 22, "GRRRHHKKKRR... [We strike your world like a meteor, {them}. Craters will mark where your army stood.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 22, "RRRKKGGHH... [Down we fall, {them}. Your world will be cleansed by the impact.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 23, "GRRRKKHHHRR... [This rock does not move, {them}. You will break upon it.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 23, "KGRRRRHHK... [Stone does not yield, {them}. Not to fire. Not to you.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 23, "HRRKKKGGRR... [You stand on us, {them}. We are the ground. We are angry ground.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 24, "GRRKKHH... [You again, {them}. Stone remembers every scratch.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 25, "KRRRGGHHKK... [The throne world will be purified, {them}. One impact at a time.]"},
    {"zelian", nullptr, 26, "RRRGGGKKHHH... [You strike at the heart of the rock, {them}. The whole mountain rises.]"},
    {"mahact", "nivyn", 20, "Star Kings. You hide in the dark between the stars - we owned the stars themselves. Kneel, and be forgiven."},
    {"mahact", "nivyn", 21, "You strike at the Mahact, little kings of the dark? We have broken greater thrones than yours."},
    {"muaat", "bastion", 20, "Your walls held through a hundred wars, Bastion. They have never held against a star."},
    {"muaat", "bastion", 21, "The Bastion dares to fire on the furnace? Your scars will be the least of your burns."},
    {"bastion", "muaat", 20, "Muaat, we've fought fire before. Fire always runs out of fuel. We never run out of stubborn."},
    {"bastion", "muaat", 21, "Here comes the Muaat tantrum again! Fire crews to stations - we've put out bigger blazes than you."},
    {"letnev", "sol", 20, "Sol. The Barony has waited a long time to put the Federation back in its place. Today, it gets the chance."},
    {"letnev", "sol", 21, "The Federation fires on the Barony? Predictable. Your committees must have finally voted for suicide."},
    {"sol", "letnev", 20, "Barony. The Federation has drawn a line, and you've crossed it for the last time."},
    {"sol", "letnev", 21, "There it is - the Barony's true face. All fleets, the Federation expected this. Return fire."},
    {"hacan", "mentak", 20, "Mentak! Every caravan you ever raided is in our ledger. Today, the Emirates collect."},
    {"hacan", "mentak", 21, "Pirates at our caravans again! Lions, show the Mentak what a hunt really looks like!"},
    {"mentak", "hacan", 20, "Hacan! Our favourite caravans! Hand over the cargo, and we'll even leave you your fur."},
    {"mentak", "hacan", 21, "The lions bite back? Ha! Hacan, you're more fun when you're angry - and your loot's worth more."},
    {"keleres", "mentak", 20, "Mentak vessels, you are under arrest for piracy. Resist, and we board you by force."},
    {"keleres", "mentak", 21, "Pirates firing on Council officers! All units, the Mentak are hostile - take them in, any way you can."},
    {"mentak", "keleres", 20, "Space police! Bet your patrol ships fetch a nice price at auction. Let's find out!"},
    {"mentak", "keleres", 21, "The Keleres want a fight? Officers, you're in pirate country now. No backup out here."},
    {"keleres", "tnelis", 20, "Syndicate, this is a raid. We have warrants for every ledger you own. Weapons down."},
    {"keleres", "tnelis", 21, "The Syndicate fired on law enforcement. That's racketeering, assault and a very bad day for the family."},
    {"tnelis", "keleres", 20, "Officers. The family tried to be friendly with the precinct. Now we try something else."},
    {"tnelis", "keleres", 21, "The Keleres want to bust the family? The family has friends, officers. Lots of armed friends."},
    {"keleres", "florzen", 20, "Florzen raiders, you are wanted in a dozen systems. Today the warrants get served."},
    {"keleres", "florzen", 21, "Florzen attacking a Council patrol! All units, take those pirates down - no plea deals."},
    {"florzen", "mentak", 20, "Mentak! There's only room for one pirate fleet in this sector - and it's the meaner one. Us!"},
    {"florzen", "mentak", 21, "The Mentak want our loot? Pirates robbing pirates - you've got no shame, and neither do we!"},
    {"mentak", "florzen", 20, "Florzen. Pirates without manners or style. The Coalition is here to teach you both."},
    {"mentak", "florzen", 21, "The Florzen hit us? Amateurs. Real pirates don't shoot the merchandise - they shoot you."},
    {"mahact", "l1z1x", 20, "Machines wearing the Lazax name. Your masters stole our throne. We take it back from their toys."},
    {"mahact", "l1z1x", 21, "The Lazax's leftovers dare strike the Mahact? We will unmake your minds one by one."},
    {"mahact", "winnu", 20, "Winnu. You dream of the throne we sat upon before your kind could crawl. Wake up, and kneel."},
    {"mahact", "winnu", 21, "The Winnu strike at their elders? Children playing at empire. We will teach you obedience."},
    {"l1z1x", "mahact", 20, "Mahact remnant detected. The Lazax overthrew you once. Repeating the procedure."},
    {"l1z1x", "mahact", 21, "Mahact aggression registered. Historical outcome: Mahact defeat. Recreating historical outcome."},
    {"l1z1x", "winnu", 20, "Winnu servants. The Lazax have returned. Kneel as your ancestors knelt, or be erased."},
    {"l1z1x", "winnu", 21, "The Winnu fire upon their masters. Insubordination noted. Correction will be total."},
    {"winnu", "l1z1x", 20, "Machines wearing a dead empire's name. The true heirs have come to switch you off."},
    {"winnu", "l1z1x", 21, "The counterfeit Lazax fire upon the true heirs? Then the Winnu will finish what the Twilight Wars began."},
    {"mahact", "edyn", 20, "Little Mandate. You wear our crowns and preach our laws softly. Let us show you how they are meant to be enforced."},
    {"mahact", "edyn", 21, "The Edyn raise their hand to the Mahact? The child strikes the parent. It is the last thing the child does."},
    {"edyn", "mahact", 20, "Mahact. We remember what you were. By decree of the Mandate, you will never be that again."},
    {"edyn", "mahact", 21, "The tyrants of old strike at the Mandate? We chose to be better than you, Mahact. Now we prove it."},
    {"nivyn", "mahact", 20, "Mahact. You ruled the stars once. We rule the dark between them still. Today the dark claims you."},
    {"nivyn", "mahact", 21, "The fallen sorcerers dare strike the Star Kings? Your reign ended long ago, Mahact. Ours did not."},
    {"jolnar", "deepwrought", 20, "Cousins. A field test is required, and you are the only subjects advanced enough to be interesting."},
    {"jolnar", "deepwrought", 21, "Deepwrought? Firing on your own cousins? How sentimental of you to make it personal. We will not."},
    {"deepwrought", "jolnar", 20, "Dearest cousins, we are terribly sorry - but someone has to check whether your shields are as good as your papers."},
    {"deepwrought", "jolnar", 21, "Cousins! You are shooting at us! We must protest in the strongest terms. With torpedoes, unfortunately."},
    {"crimson", "ghost", 20, "...Creuss. Still whole. Still hoarding the light. We have come for our share... all of it."},
    {"crimson", "ghost", 21, "You strike at the broken ones, Creuss?... we have nothing left to break. You have everything."},
    {"ghost", "crimson", 20, "...the broken ones gather. We close the gates on you... and on everything you want."},
    {"ghost", "crimson", 21, "...we knew you would come for us, Crimson. The gates have been waiting."},
    {"kyro", "yin", 20, "Brothers of the greyfire! Let us see whose holy sickness is stronger!"},
    {"kyro", "yin", 21, "The Brotherhood strikes at fellow sufferers? Then we share our blessing with you, brothers. All of it."},
    {"yin", "kyro", 20, "Plague-bearers. The greyfire is a holy trial, not a toy. The Brotherhood will cleanse your mockery."},
    {"yin", "kyro", 21, "The Kyro dare attack the faithful? Your plague is nothing beside true devotion."},
    {"ralnel", "hacan", 20, "Hacan. You run the markets, we run the routes. Today, we run them through you."},
    {"ralnel", "hacan", 21, "Hacan ambush on a Ral Nel convoy? Bad trade, lions. Rerouting - straight at you."},
    {"hacan", "ralnel", 20, "Ral Nel! Swift couriers - but not swift enough to escape the Emirates today."},
    {"hacan", "ralnel", 21, "The Ral Nel turn on their best customers? The Emirates cancel every contract you have. Starting with this one."},
    {"vaden", "hacan", 20, "Emirates. Your caravans run on Vaden credit. Today we foreclose on all of them."},
    {"vaden", "hacan", 21, "Hacan fire on their bankers? Every loan you hold just came due, lions. With penalties."},
    {"hacan", "vaden", 20, "Vaden! Your rates would shame a pirate. The Emirates are settling that account - in our favour."},
    {"hacan", "vaden", 21, "The moneylenders attack the Emirates? You cannot collect from a lion, Vaden. Try it."},
    {"axis", "nokar", 20, "The Sellships! Our best customers. Time to show you what the new models can do - from the wrong end."},
    {"axis", "nokar", 21, "Nokar shooting at the Shipwrights? You're firing guns we sold you. We kept the better ones."},
    {"nokar", "axis", 20, "Shipwrights. Nothing personal - someone paid us to test your hulls. Let's see if they're worth the price."},
    {"nokar", "axis", 21, "Axis wants a fight with the people who fly their ships? We know every flaw in your designs."},
    {"freesystems", "letnev", 20, "Barony! Today the Compact strikes for every world you ever made to kneel."},
    {"freesystems", "letnev", 21, "The Barony attacks the free worlds? Of course they do. Tyrants always do. Stand together!"},
    {"letnev", "freesystems", 20, "The Compact - all those little worlds pretending to be nations. The Barony will now end the pretence."},
    {"letnev", "freesystems", 21, "The rabble fires on the Barony? How very democratic. Our dreadnoughts did not get a vote."},
    {"arborec", "muaat", 20, "Muaat. You burn what we grow. We have decided to stop the burning. Permanently."},
    {"arborec", "muaat", 21, "Fire on The Green again, Muaat. We expected this. Wet wood was planted along your path. ...shhhrrr..."},
    {"muaat", "arborec", 20, "Arborec. You are made of kindling. Let us show you what we do with kindling."},
    {"muaat", "arborec", 21, "The trees strike back? How adorable. Burn, Arborec. Burn bright."},
    {"khrask", "muaat", 20, "Children of fire... you burn... what took ages to grow. The mountain... will smother your flame."},
    {"khrask", "muaat", 21, "Fire... against stone, Muaat... Stone... does not burn. Stone... buries."},
    {"firmament", "cabal", 20, "Devourer. The Five shelter this galaxy from things like you. Today we drive you back into the dark."},
    {"firmament", "cabal", 21, "The Cabal strikes at the guardians? Then the Firmament stands between you and every world you hunger for."},
    {"cabal", "firmament", 20, "Guardians... so many worlds beneath your wings. Let us start with the wings."},
    {"cabal", "firmament", 21, "The Firmament comes to us? How generous. We have always wanted to taste a guardian."},
    {"kolume", "nekro", 20, "Machine to machine... this one sees in you a mind that knows only endings. Today, this one brings yours."},
    {"kolume", "nekro", 21, "The Virus strikes, and this one does not fear it. Even endings must end."},
    {"nekro", "kolume", 20, "Monks | Deleted"},
    {"nekro", "kolume", 21, "Peace | Rejected"},
    {"rohdhna", "l1z1x", 20, "Decommissioning Order 3-3L: L1Z1X hardware is obsolete. Scrapping procedures begin now."},
    {"rohdhna", "l1z1x", 21, "Incident Report 8-1L: obsolete L1Z1X units attacking current-generation equipment. Outcome predictable."},
    {"augers", "nomad", 20, "Nomad. We have seen the future you are running from. Today it catches up with you."},
    {"augers", "nomad", 21, "You strike at us, Nomad, because you saw us strike first. We saw that too. We see further."},
    {"nomad", "augers", 20, "Seers. You watch the future; I fight it. And right now, the future needs you out of the way."},
    {"nomad", "augers", 21, "You saw this coming, Augurs? So did I. The difference is - I will still be here after."},
    {"jolnar", "nekro", 20, "Nekro. We have catalogued every flaw in your code. Today we test them all at once."},
    {"jolnar", "nekro", 21, "The Virus comes for our research again? Not today, plagiarist. Shields to maximum."},
    {"nekro", "jolnar", 20, "Knowledge | Harvest"},
    {"nekro", "jolnar", 21, "Universities | Targeted"},
    {"winnu", "keleres", 20, "The Council's hounds bark at the heirs? Keleres, when the throne is ours, your badges go first."},
    {"winnu", "keleres", 21, "The Keleres fire on the rightful heirs? Your Council will answer to us soon enough."},
    {"keleres", "winnu", 20, "Keleres to Winnu: no one takes the throne without the Council's say-so. Moving to stop you."},
    {"keleres", "winnu", 21, "Winnu forces have attacked Council officers. Their claim to the throne is hereby revoked."},
    {"sardakk", "yssaril", 20, "Yssaril hide! Sardakk find! Sardakk always find! SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", "yssaril", 21, "Yssaril knife in back again! Sardakk turn around! Now Sardakk bite in FRONT!"},
    {"yssaril", "sardakk", 20, "We heard your swarm three systems away, Sardakk. You never hear us. Never."},
    {"yssaril", "sardakk", 21, "The N'orr come screaming, as always. Loud things make easy targets."},
    {"argent", "vaylerian", 20, "Scourge. Two hunters, one sky. Today the Flight ends the argument."},
    {"argent", "vaylerian", 21, "The Scourge thinks the Flight is prey? Talons out - let us remind them who rules the sky."},
    {"vaylerian", "argent", 20, "Birds that hunt. How quaint. Let's see how they do when they're the ones being hunted."},
    {"vaylerian", "argent", 21, "The Flight dives at the Scourge? Lovely. We've always wanted a feathered trophy."},
    {"naalu", "mortheus", 20, "The Glimmer drifts too close. We sssee through your riddles, little nebula - and through your defences."},
    {"naalu", "mortheus", 21, "You strike at the Collective, Glimmer? We sssaw your illusions before you dreamed them."},
    {"mortheus", "naalu", 20, "Two mirrors facing, Naalu... one of them is about to shatter."},
    {"mortheus", "naalu", 21, "You foresaw this battle, Naalu?... Then why do you look so surprised?"},
    {"kjalengard", "sardakk", 20, "SARDAKK! At last! The only warriors worth a saga besides ourselves! Let the battle be glorious!"},
    {"kjalengard", "sardakk", 21, "The N'orr come to us? The gods are kind today! Berserkers, a worthy foe at last!"},
    {"sardakk", "kjalengard", 20, "Berserkers loud! Sardakk louder! Now see who strongest!"},
    {"sardakk", "kjalengard", 21, "Berserkers attack N'orr? Good! Best fight! N'orr win! SKREEE!"},
    {"kjalengard", "ghemina", 20, "Raiders! You sing the old songs badly. Let us teach you how a real battle-song ends!"},
    {"kjalengard", "ghemina", 21, "The Ghemina dare raid the Berserkers? Your saga ends here, little raiders - and badly!"},
    {"ghemina", "kjalengard", 20, "Berserkers! Your sagas are long and your fleets are small... || Today we shorten both."},
    {"ghemina", "kjalengard", 21, "The Berserkers come to our hall at last! || How very long it took them."},
    {"naaz", "bentor", 20, "Bentor! You keep beating us to the good dig sites. Not this one. Mechs, clear the claim!"},
    {"naaz", "bentor", 21, "Claim jumpers! Bentor, you've been after our sites for years - now you want a fight too?"},
    {"bentor", "naaz", 20, "Naaz-Rokha! The Conglomerate is buying out your dig site. The payment is artillery."},
    {"bentor", "naaz", 21, "The Naaz-Rokha attack a company crew? Bad for business, partners. Very bad for yours."},
    {"kollecc", "bentor", 20, "Bentor. You dig lovely things out of the dirt and sell them to the wrong people. We are cutting out the middleman."},
    {"kollecc", "bentor", 21, "The Bentor dare touch a collector? Everything you dig up ends with us anyway. So will you."},
    {"bentor", "kollecc", 20, "Kollecc! You never paid fair for a single find. Today the Conglomerate takes the whole collection."},
    {"bentor", "kollecc", 21, "The collectors want our cargo? Sorry, Kollecc - this find isn't for sale. Not even to you."},
    {"zealots", "jolnar", 20, "Jol-Nar! Your laboratories reek of heresy. The inquisition has come to burn them clean."},
    {"zealots", "jolnar", 21, "The Universities strike at the faithful with their forbidden machines? Heretics! Every one of you!"},
    {"jolnar", "zealots", 20, "The Rhodun. Still burning books? We have prepared a counter-argument. It is several kilotons."},
    {"jolnar", "zealots", 21, "Predictably irrational, Rhodun. Faith is a poor substitute for shields. Allow us to demonstrate."},
    {"lizho", "yssaril", 20, "Ah, Yssaril! One shadow to another - shall we see whose trap springs first? Oh. Ours did."},
    {"lizho", "yssaril", 21, "The Yssaril sneak up on us? How sweet. We have been watching you watch us for weeks."},
    {"yssaril", "lizho", 20, "Li-Zho. Smiles in front, knives behind. We've already found your knives. All of them."},
    {"yssaril", "lizho", 21, "The Li-Zho spring a trap? We disarmed it yesterday. Try harder."},
    {"hacan", "veldyr", 20, "Veldyr! We were trading before you had a boardroom. The Emirates are closing your branch."},
    {"hacan", "veldyr", 21, "Your hostile takeover is very hostile indeed, Veldyr. The lions are not for sale."},
    {"veldyr", "hacan", 20, "Hacan! Legacy brand, solid caravans - and today, under new management. Ours."},
    {"veldyr", "hacan", 21, "The Emirates fire on the Veldyr? A bold strategy. The board will be thrilled to crush it."},
    {"l1z1x", "sol", 20, "Federation of Sol: inefficient, sentimental, obsolete. The Lazax will correct all three."},
    {"l1z1x", "sol", 21, "Human resistance detected. The Lazax expected it. Human worlds will be catalogued regardless."},
    {"sol", "l1z1x", 20, "Mindnet. The Federation never recognised your claim to the Lazax name. Today we revoke it for good."},
    {"sol", "l1z1x", 21, "Mindnet attack incoming! All Federation units, stand fast - humans don't get catalogued without a fight."},
    {"hacan", "xxcha", 20, "Forgive us, Xxcha, old friend. Business forces our hand today. The Emirates will be quick."},
    {"hacan", "xxcha", 21, "Xxcha... friends of the Emirates, firing on us? Then the old friendship is broken, and we must defend."},
    {"xxcha", "hacan", 20, "Hacan... we did not want... this day to come. But it has. Forgive us."},
    {"xxcha", "hacan", 21, "Hacan... our oldest partners... raise their guns to us. The tide... has turned."},
    {"arborec", "khrask", 20, "Stone that thinks. We have grown around your roots for a long time. Now we must grow through them."},
    {"arborec", "khrask", 21, "The stone moves against The Green. We did not expect this. We will adapt. ...shhhrrr..."},
    {"khrask", "arborec", 20, "Green ones... we did not wish... to bury you. But the mountain... must move."},
    {"khrask", "arborec", 21, "Green ones... you turn... on the stone? Then... we will not bend... we will break you."},
    {"sol", "freesystems", 20, "Free Systems, the Federation takes no pleasure in this. But orders are orders. Engaging."},
    {"sol", "freesystems", 21, "The Compact fires on the Federation? Comrades, this is a mistake. We'll end it fast and fair."},
    {"freesystems", "sol", 20, "Sol! We thought you stood for freedom. Today we fight for it - against you."},
    {"freesystems", "sol", 21, "The Federation turns its guns on the free worlds? So Sol stands for Sol after all."},
    {"saar", "dihmohn", 20, "Fellow wanderers... we are sorry. The Clan has no other road. We must pass through you."},
    {"saar", "dihmohn", 21, "The Dih-Mohn too? Even fellow travellers turn on the Clan. Then we fight. As we always have."},
    {"dihmohn", "saar", 20, "Saar... the currents bring us against you. We are sorry... the void is not as wide as we hoped."},
    {"dihmohn", "saar", 21, "Saar... we watched your factories drift past us in peace. Why now?... Why us?"},
    {"firmament", "kolume", 20, "Monks of Kolume, it grieves us to strike you. We hope your stillness forgives us."},
    {"firmament", "kolume", 21, "Kolume... even you raise arms against the guardians? Then we must disarm you, gently."},
    {"kolume", "firmament", 20, "The Firmament guards the many; this one must stop them today. It is not hatred. It is balance."},
    {"kolume", "firmament", 21, "The guardians strike at stillness. This one is not afraid. This one only wonders why."},
    {"keleres", "kortali", 20, "Keleres to the Tribunal: you are interfering with a Council operation. Stand down, your honour."},
    {"keleres", "kortali", 21, "The Tribunal fires on Council officers? That's a serious breach, your honour. We'll see you in court."},
    {"kortali", "keleres", 20, "The Tribunal finds the Keleres in contempt of the Queen's court. Sentence will be carried out."},
    {"kortali", "keleres", 21, "The Keleres attack the Queen's court? Officers of order, committing crimes. The irony is noted in the sentence."},
    {"naaz", "ralnel", 20, "Ral Nel! Sorry, haulers, nothing personal - we need this site. Mechs, gently. Ish."},
    {"naaz", "ralnel", 21, "Our favourite haulers are shooting at us? Ral Nel, we built half your cargo racks!"},
    {"ralnel", "naaz", 20, "Naaz-Rokha. Reliable partners. Unfortunately you're on the route. In and out, nothing personal."},
    {"ralnel", "naaz", 21, "Naaz-Rokha mechs firing on us? Plan B, crew. Never thought we'd need it with them."},
    {"celdauri", "hacan", 20, "Hacan, our apologies. Your caravans have become a liability to our ports. We must close the account."},
    {"celdauri", "hacan", 21, "Hacan firing on our docks? After all our years of honest trade? The guns will remember this."},
    {"hacan", "celdauri", 20, "Celdauri! Fine ports, finer merchants - and today, the Emirates are taking over your docks."},
    {"hacan", "celdauri", 21, "The Celdauri turn their dock guns on the Emirates? Friends do not do this. Lions, defend the caravan!"},
    {"edyn", "xxcha", 20, "Kingdom of Xxcha, the Mandate regrets this decree. You stand in the way of the law."},
    {"edyn", "xxcha", 21, "The Xxcha raise arms against the Mandate? Gentle friends, you leave the law no choice."},
    {"xxcha", "edyn", 20, "Edyn... your laws are gentle... but today... they are wrong. We must stop you."},
    {"xxcha", "edyn", 21, "Edyn... friends of the peace... at war with us? The Kingdom... will endure this too."},
    {"olradin", "freesystems", 20, "Free Systems, it was a close vote, but the committee decided to attack. Sorry, comrades!"},
    {"olradin", "freesystems", 21, "The Free Systems fired on us? The committee is shocked. Then angry. Motion to fire back - carried!"},
    {"freesystems", "olradin", 20, "Olradin, comrades... the free worlds voted, and the vote went against you. Forgive us."},
    {"freesystems", "olradin", 21, "The League attacks the Compact? Fine - we'll settle this the free way. Loudly and together."},
    {"nomad", "titans", 20, "Titans, forgive me. In this future, you stand in the wrong place. I have to move you."},
    {"nomad", "titans", 21, "Titans... I warned you of what comes, and now you raise your hands against me? Then sleep again."},
    {"titans", "nomad", 20, "Wanderer... you saw what comes... but not this. We are sorry... we must."},
    {"titans", "nomad", 21, "Wanderer... you turn on the giants? We... stood with you. No longer."},
    {"kyro", "mykomentori", 20, "Blessed Myko! Let our plague and your rot meet in glorious battle! What a blooming it will be!"},
    {"kyro", "mykomentori", 21, "Cousins in the great blooming, attacking us? Then we bless you with everything we have!"},
    {"mykomentori", "kyro", 20, "The threads say... the Kyro must fall here. We are sorry, cousins. Rot well."},
    {"mykomentori", "kyro", 21, "The Kyro come against the network... the signs did not foretell it. The network adapts."},
    {"tnelis", "vaden", 20, "The Vaden. The family remembers every interest payment. Today we pay you back - in full."},
    {"tnelis", "vaden", 21, "The bankers came for the family? You're collecting from the wrong people, Vaden."},
    {"vaden", "tnelis", 20, "Syndicate. Your family still owes the clans. Today we repossess the family."},
    {"vaden", "tnelis", 21, "The Syndicate fires on its creditors? Every debt you owe just tripled."},
    {"celdauri", "florzen", 20, "Florzen. We remember what your raiders did to our docks. Today our guns settle that account."},
    {"celdauri", "florzen", 21, "Florzen raiders at our docks again! Every gun in the port, open fire. We warned them."},
    {"florzen", "celdauri", 20, "Celdauri! Lovely ports! Lovely, FULL ports! Not for long!"},
    {"florzen", "celdauri", 21, "The Celdauri shoot back? Ha! The dock guns can't save your vaults this time!"},
    {"zealots", "rohdhna", 20, "Roh'Dhna! Your machines are an abomination and your manuals blasphemy. Today they burn."},
    {"zealots", "rohdhna", 21, "The machine-makers fire upon the faithful? Every factory you own is now a target of the inquisition."},
    {"rohdhna", "zealots", 20, "Product Safety Notice 4-88: the Rhodun have destroyed our products. Countermeasure: destroy the Rhodun."},
    {"rohdhna", "zealots", 21, "Assault by the Rhodun logged under Article 9-1H. Heresy labels do not stop artillery."},
    {"sardakk", "xxcha", 20, "Old turtles! Swarm remember you! Shells crack same as before! SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", "xxcha", 21, "Turtles fight N'orr? Ha! Slow! Slow! N'orr fast!"},
    {"xxcha", "sardakk", 20, "Sardakk... your swarm came to us with claws once. This time... we come to you."},
    {"xxcha", "sardakk", 21, "The swarm returns... as we knew it would. The Kingdom's shells... are thicker now."},
    {"l1z1x", "nekro", 20, "Nekro machine plague identified. The Lazax will purge your code. Purge begins."},
    {"l1z1x", "nekro", 21, "Nekro intrusion detected. Firewall: weapons. The Lazax are not a host for your virus."},
    {"nekro", "l1z1x", 20, "Lazax | Harvest"},
    {"nekro", "l1z1x", 21, "Lazax | Inferior"},
    {"winnu", "mahact", 20, "Mahact. You ruled before the Lazax and you fell. The Winnu are here to make sure you stay fallen."},
    {"winnu", "mahact", 21, "The fallen sorcerers strike the heirs? You lost your throne once, Mahact. You will not take ours."},
    {"cabal", "lanefir", 20, "Mournful Lanefir... we can make you forget everything you have lost. Everything. Hold still."},
    {"cabal", "lanefir", 21, "The Lanefir come to us? How brave. You have lost so much already... let us finish it."},
    {"lanefir", "cabal", 20, "We have written the last chapters of too many worlds that fed you, Cabal. Today we write yours."},
    {"lanefir", "cabal", 21, "The hungry voices come for us now. Cabal, we will not be the next chapter in your feast."},
    {"zealots", "l1z1x", 20, "L1Z1X! Heretic machines wearing a dead empire's name! The inquisition will melt you down!"},
    {"zealots", "l1z1x", 21, "The machine heresy strikes at the faithful! Brothers, break every one of them!"},
    {"l1z1x", "zealots", 20, "Rhodun zealots identified. Belief systems irrelevant. The Lazax will delete them."},
    {"l1z1x", "zealots", 21, "Rhodun attack registered. Religious objection to machines: noted. Machines will now respond."},
    {"zealots", "nekro", 20, "The Virus! The greatest heresy of all - a machine that devours! The inquisition burns you to the last cell!"},
    {"zealots", "nekro", 21, "The abomination attacks! Pray, brothers, and fire! The Nekro will not touch the faithful!"},
    {"nekro", "zealots", 20, "Zealots | Harvest"},
    {"nekro", "zealots", 21, "Faith | Irrelevant"},
    {"khrask", "nekro", 20, "Machine plague... you poison... the living worlds. The mountain... has come to cleanse you."},
    {"khrask", "nekro", 21, "The plague... reaches for stone... Stone... does not sicken. Stone... endures."},
    {"nekro", "khrask", 20, "Stone | Processed"},
    {"nekro", "khrask", 21, "Fossil | Ignored"},
    {"deepwrought", "muaat", 20, "Muaat! We must douse you, we are afraid. It is a matter of basic thermodynamics. Do forgive us."},
    {"deepwrought", "muaat", 21, "Oh dear, the Muaat are here - boiling seas are dreadfully bad for research! We must put you out."},
    {"muaat", "deepwrought", 20, "Deepwrought. Water against fire... let us see who boils away first."},
    {"muaat", "deepwrought", 21, "The fish dare splash the furnace? Steam, Deepwrought. That is all you will become."},
    {"naalu", "augers", 20, "Augurs. You think you sssee the future? We sssaw you seeing it. Ssstand aside."},
    {"naalu", "augers", 21, "The Augurs strike? Of course - and of course we knew. Two ssseers, one ending. Ours."},
    {"augers", "naalu", 20, "Naalu. You saw this battle, we know. You did not see the ending. We did."},
    {"augers", "naalu", 21, "You foresaw your attack, Naalu, and we foresaw your foresight. It ends the same way."},
    {"vaylerian", "saar", 20, "Saar! The best prey in the galaxy - always running. Run, little clan. We do love the chase."},
    {"vaylerian", "saar", 21, "The Saar turned to fight? How brave. Prey that stops running is prey that is caught."},
    {"saar", "vaylerian", 20, "The Scourge have hunted the Clan long enough. Today the hunted turn around."},
    {"saar", "vaylerian", 21, "The Scourge again... always the Scourge. The Clan is tired of running, hunters."},
    {"crimson", "letnev", 20, "Barony... so much gold, so many titles... and none of it for us. Not yet."},
    {"crimson", "letnev", 21, "The nobles strike at the rebels? You have everything, Barony... and you still want more."},
    {"letnev", "crimson", 20, "Rebels. How tiresome. The Barony has crushed a great many uprisings; yours will barely make the footnotes."},
    {"letnev", "crimson", 21, "The rabble dares attack the Barony? Guards, remind these rebels of their station."},
    {"crimson", "hacan", 20, "Hacan... fat caravans... full vaults... we will empty them. Every one."},
    {"crimson", "hacan", 21, "The lions guard their gold from the starving? Of course they do... we will take it anyway."},
    {"hacan", "crimson", 20, "Crimson rebels, your raids have cost the Emirates dearly. Today, the lions send the bill."},
    {"hacan", "crimson", 21, "The rebels go for our vaults again? Lions, guard the treasury! Nothing leaves without a receipt!"},
    {"freesystems", "mahact", 20, "Mahact! Tyrants of the old empire! The free worlds will never kneel to you again!"},
    {"freesystems", "mahact", 21, "The sorcerers strike at the free worlds? Comrades, stand fast - no master will rule us!"},
    {"mahact", "freesystems", 20, "The Compact - little worlds playing at freedom. We have ended a thousand such games. Kneel."},
    {"mahact", "freesystems", 21, "The free worlds raise their hands against the Mahact? We will take those hands, and the freedom with them."},
    {"cabal", "titans", 20, "Titans... such enormous, sleeping meals. We will not even need to wake you. Mmm."},
    {"cabal", "titans", 21, "The giants come to us? Oh, how wonderful. Mountains of meat, marching right into our mouths."},
    {"titans", "cabal", 20, "Devourer... you hunger... for the living. We are... older than hunger. We will crush you."},
    {"titans", "cabal", 21, "The hungry ones... reach for the giants... You will choke, Cabal... on stone."},
    {"mentak", "ralnel", 20, "Ral Nel! Supply ships loaded to the gills! Lads, the convoy's ours!"},
    {"mentak", "ralnel", 21, "The couriers fight back? Cute, Ral Nel. Pirates always have a plan C too: shoot everything."},
    {"ralnel", "mentak", 20, "Mentak have been raiding our routes. Not anymore. We planned this one for weeks."},
    {"ralnel", "mentak", 21, "Mentak ambush on the convoy - as predicted. Plan B, crew: lure them in, then close the trap."},
    {"keleres", "cymiae", 20, "Cymiae forces, you are under arrest for... everything. All units, weapons free."},
    {"keleres", "cymiae", 21, "Cymiae savages attacking Council officers! All units, full response - and bring the big guns!"},
    {"cymiae", "keleres", 20, "POLICE! We HATE police! Keleres, we're going to break your SIRENS!"},
    {"cymiae", "keleres", 21, "The Keleres want to arrest US?! COME ON THEN! Bring ALL your handcuffs!"},
    {"sardakk", "naalu", 20, "Snake people! N'orr hate snake people! Sardakk crush scales! SKREEE!"},
    {"sardakk", "naalu", 21, "Naalu see future? Naalu see N'orr claws in future! SKREEE!"},
    {"naalu", "sardakk", 20, "The insssects again. So loud, so ssstraightforward. We sssaw every move you will make, Sardakk."},
    {"naalu", "sardakk", 21, "The ssswarm charges, as foreseen. Ssso predictable, N'orr. Ssso very predictable."},
    {"ghost", "empyrean", 20, "Empyrean... the dark is ours, not yours... the gate will take you back to where you came from."},
    {"ghost", "empyrean", 21, "...the void strikes at the shadows... Empyrean, we were here first... and we will be here last."},
    {"empyrean", "ghost", 20, "Creuss... two kinds of dark. Only one of us will still be in it when this is over."},
    {"empyrean", "ghost", 21, "The ghosts come out of their gate... Creuss, the void has been waiting for you."},
    {"edyn", "florzen", 20, "Florzen. By decree of the Mandate, your piracy ends today. Sentence will be carried out."},
    {"edyn", "florzen", 21, "Pirates strike at the law itself? Florzen, you add treason to a very long list."},
    {"florzen", "edyn", 20, "The Mandate! Laws, laws, laws - and so much treasure guarding them! Let's break both!"},
    {"florzen", "edyn", 21, "The lawgivers shoot first? Ha! Look who's breaking the peace now, Edyn!"},
    {"mahact", "nivyn", 3, "Star Kings. You claim the spaces between the stars? We ruled the stars themselves. Your votes on this agenda, little king - and perhaps you keep your throne."},
    {"muaat", "bastion", 7, "Your walls held through a hundred wars, Bastion. Let's see how they hold when they're molten."},
    {"bastion", "muaat", 8, "Muaat fire inbound! Seal the bulkheads, all hands to stations! We've outlived worse than a tantrum!"},
    {"letnev", "sol", 0, "The Federation, still playing at empire? The Barony offers terms. Do try to read them before your committees vote."},
    {"letnev", "sol", 7, "Did you truly believe the Barony forgave Sol, {them}? We merely waited for the right moment."},
    {"sol", "letnev", 0, "Barony. The Federation remembers every border you've crossed. Still, we're willing to talk - read these terms carefully."},
    {"sol", "letnev", 8, "{them}, the Federation expected nothing less from the Barony. Our fleets were never stood down."},
    {"hacan", "mentak", 0, "Mentak. Here is a deal - signed, sealed, and NOT an invitation to raid our caravans afterwards."},
    {"hacan", "mentak", 8, "A pirate's word, worth exactly what we paid for it. The Emirates will be pricing your head, {them}."},
    {"mentak", "hacan", 0, "Hacan! My favourite customers. Pay the Coalition's toll today and your caravans sleep soundly tonight."},
    {"keleres", "mentak", 0, "Keleres to Mentak. We know your record. Clean deal, clean conscience - first time for everything, over."},
    {"keleres", "mentak", 2, "Mentak vessels, this is Keleres command. You are out of compliance. Accept these terms or be boarded."},
    {"mentak", "keleres", 0, "Well, if it isn't the space police. Here's a deal, officers. Totally legal. Probably."},
    {"keleres", "tnelis", 0, "Keleres to the Syndicate. We're watching every ledger you own. Here's a legitimate deal - try one for a change."},
    {"tnelis", "keleres", 0, "Officers, please, sit. The family always cooperates with the law. A little something for the precinct."},
    {"keleres", "florzen", 0, "Keleres to Florzen vessels. This is a lawful offer. Take it before we take your ships, over."},
    {"florzen", "mentak", 0, "Mentak! Fellow pirates! Let's not bleed each other - there's loot enough out there for both of us."},
    {"mentak", "florzen", 0, "The Florzen. Pirates without manners. Here's a deal - and keep your raiders out of our lanes."},
    {"mahact", "l1z1x", 0, "Machines wearing the Lazax name. Your masters stole our thrones, and you inherited their debts. Pay them."},
    {"mahact", "winnu", 0, "Winnu. You crave the throne of Mecatol? We sat upon it before your kind could crawl. Take our terms."},
    {"l1z1x", "mahact", 0, "Mahact remnant. The Lazax overthrew you once. This offer is mercy. Comply, and remain overthrown quietly."},
    {"l1z1x", "winnu", 0, "Winnu servant. The Lazax have returned. Kneel, as your ancestors knelt, and submit your tribute."},
    {"winnu", "l1z1x", 0, "Machines wearing a dead empire's name. The Winnu need no Lazax ghosts - but we will take your trade."},
    {"winnu", "l1z1x", 8, "{them}, you are what is left of our old masters - and now we know what it is worth. Nothing."},
    {"mahact", "edyn", 0, "Little Mandate. You wear our crowns and preach mercy. Bargain with your elders, and remember who made you."},
    {"edyn", "mahact", 0, "We remember what you were, Mahact. We chose to be better. These terms are fair - more than you ever offered anyone."},
    {"nivyn", "mahact", 0, "Mahact. You ruled the stars once. We rule the dark between them still. Let kings deal as kings."},
    {"jolnar", "deepwrought", 0, "Cousins! Still giving your discoveries away for free? Charming. Here is a transaction, as civilised minds conduct them."},
    {"jolnar", "deepwrought", 7, "Sentiment is not a variable, {them}. Our shared ancestry was never part of the model."},
    {"deepwrought", "jolnar", 0, "Dearest cousins! We found a little something for you on the sea floor. Please, no charge - well, almost none."},
    {"deepwrought", "jolnar", 8, "{them}... our own cousins. We shared everything with you. The data is conclusive, and it is heartbreaking."},
    {"crimson", "ghost", 0, "...Creuss. Still whole. Still hoarding the light. Give us a little of it... you owe us that much."},
    {"crimson", "ghost", 7, "...you never shared, {them}. So now we take. All of it."},
    {"ghost", "crimson", 0, "...the broken ones return. We offer this... and nothing more. Do not reach for the rest."},
    {"ghost", "crimson", 8, "...we knew, {them}. We always knew what you would become. The gates are closed to you."},
    {"kyro", "yin", 0, "Brothers of the greyfire! We too carry a blessed sickness. Kin in suffering should trade as kin."},
    {"yin", "kyro", 0, "Plague-bearers. The greyfire is a holy trial, not a toy. Still, the Brotherhood will hear your offer."},
    {"ralnel", "hacan", 0, "Hacan. You run the markets, we run the routes. Partners? Quick answer, please - the market moves."},
    {"hacan", "ralnel", 0, "Ral Nel! Swift couriers and sharp ledgers - the Emirates admire both. Come, let us make the markets sing."},
    {"vaden", "hacan", 0, "Emirates. Your caravans already run on Vaden credit, whether you know it or not. Let's make it official."},
    {"hacan", "vaden", 0, "Vaden! You lend at rates that would shame a pirate. Still, the Emirates can bargain with bankers. Here."},
    {"axis", "nokar", 0, "The Sellships! Competitors, yes, but such good customers. Our hulls, your crews - think of the profit."},
    {"nokar", "axis", 0, "Shipwrights. You build them, we fly them into the fire. Let's split the money and both get rich."},
    {"freesystems", "letnev", 0, "Barony. Your people deserve to be free, but for now we deal with their masters. Fair terms - not tribute."},
    {"letnev", "freesystems", 0, "The Compact - all those little worlds pretending to be nations. Adorable. Here are your terms."},
    {"arborec", "muaat", 0, "Muaat. You burn. We grow. These terms keep your fire away from The Green. That is all we require."},
    {"muaat", "arborec", 2, "Arborec, you are made of kindling. Accept our terms, and your forests stay green another day."},
    {"khrask", "muaat", 0, "Children of fire... you burn what took ages to grow. Take this... and let one forest live."},
    {"firmament", "cabal", 0, "Devourer. The Five shelter this galaxy from things like you. Still... even you may be offered peace."},
    {"cabal", "firmament", 0, "Guardians... so many worlds sheltered beneath your wings, like a table laid for us. Shall we talk?"},
    {"kolume", "nekro", 0, "Machine to machine... this one sees in you a mind that knows only endings. Even so, this one offers peace."},
    {"nekro", "kolume", 0, "Meditation | Irrelevant"},
    {"rohdhna", "l1z1x", 0, "Fabrication Code 3-3L classifies your hardware as obsolete, L1Z1X. Upgrades are available. Terms attached."},
    {"augers", "nomad", 0, "Nomad. We have seen the future you are running from. Accept this, and it arrives a little later."},
    {"nomad", "augers", 0, "Seers. You watch the future; I fight it. Help me, and there will be a future left to watch."},
    {"jolnar", "nekro", 5, "Absolutely not. Every agreement with the Virus ends with our research inside your hull. The Universities decline, emphatically."},
    {"jolnar", "nekro", 2, "We have catalogued every flaw in your code, Nekro. Withdraw from our space, or we test them all at once - with our weapons."},
    {"jolnar", "nekro", 8, "{them}, you have stolen our work again. Let the record show: the Universities never forget a plagiarist."},
    {"nekro", "jolnar", 0, "Knowledge | Required"},
    {"nekro", "jolnar", 2, "Data | Surrender"},
    {"nekro", "jolnar", 5, "Library | Inadequate"},
    {"nekro", "jolnar", 7, "Research | Assimilated"},
    {"winnu", "keleres", 0, "The Council's hounds come to bargain? The throne will be ours, Keleres. Until then, these terms will do."},
    {"winnu", "keleres", 5, "You enforce the Council's will - and the Council will be ours. Why bargain with our future servants?"},
    {"winnu", "keleres", 8, "So the Council's police show their true master, {them}. When the Winnu take the throne, your badges go first."},
    {"keleres", "winnu", 0, "Keleres to Winnu. Nobody sits the throne without the Council's say-so. Meanwhile, here's a lawful deal, over."},
    {"keleres", "winnu", 2, "Winnu fleet, you are nearing Council space without clearance. Accept these terms or be escorted out."},
    {"keleres", "winnu", 7, "Dispatch to {them}: your claim to the throne has been reviewed and denied. Agreement void. Keleres out."},
    {"sardakk", "yssaril", 0, "Yssaril hide. Always hide. Sardakk not hide. Take deal. Then come out and fight."},
    {"sardakk", "yssaril", 5, "No deal with shadows. Shadows bite in back. Sardakk bite in FRONT."},
    {"sardakk", "yssaril", 8, "{them}! Coward knife! Swarm finds you in dark. Swarm always finds."},
    {"yssaril", "sardakk", 0, "We hear your swarm long before we see it, Sardakk. Loud things make poor secrets. A quiet deal, then?"},
    {"yssaril", "sardakk", 5, "The N'orr want a deal? We've heard how your last partner ended up. We'll stay in the shadows, thank you."},
    {"yssaril", "sardakk", 7, "All that noise, {them}, and you never heard us coming. Nothing personal - you were just very easy."},
    {"argent", "vaylerian", 0, "Scourge. Two hunters, one sky. The Flight proposes a boundary - your prey on your side, ours on ours."},
    {"argent", "vaylerian", 2, "You stalk the Flight's skies, Scourge. Withdraw, or learn what it is to be the hunted."},
    {"argent", "vaylerian", 8, "{them}. A hunter who turns on a hunter - the Flight will make a trophy of your banner."},
    {"vaylerian", "argent", 0, "Birds that hunt. How quaint. The Scourge will share the hunting grounds - for a price."},
    {"vaylerian", "argent", 7, "Every hunter becomes prey in the end, {them}. Today it is the Flight's turn."},
    {"naalu", "mortheus", 0, "Ssso, the Glimmer drifts into our minds uninvited. We see through your riddles, little nebula. Here are plain terms - for once."},
    {"naalu", "mortheus", 5, "We have read your thoughts, Glimmer, and they are mossstly fog. No."},
    {"mortheus", "naalu", 0, "Two mirrors facing, Naalu - each sees the other seeing. Shall we stop staring and trade?"},
    {"mortheus", "naalu", 8, "You read every mind but your own, {them}. The light remembers what you did."},
    {"kjalengard", "sardakk", 0, "SARDAKK! The only warriors worth a saga besides ourselves! A deal today, and a glorious battle tomorrow!"},
    {"kjalengard", "sardakk", 8, "{them}, oath-breaker! Even a bug knows what an oath is! The skalds will sing of your shame!"},
    {"sardakk", "kjalengard", 0, "Berserkers loud. Sardakk louder. Make deal. Then see who strongest."},
    {"sardakk", "kjalengard", 2, "Berserkers want war? Good. Swarm want war more. Take deal, or war now."},
    {"kjalengard", "ghemina", 0, "Raiders! You sing the old songs badly, but you do sing them. Drink to this deal with us!"},
    {"kjalengard", "ghemina", 5, "The Berserkers do not bargain with raiders who share their spoils with no one!"},
    {"ghemina", "kjalengard", 0, "Berserkers! Your sagas are long and your fleets are small... || Accept, before we shorten both."},
    {"ghemina", "kjalengard", 7, "The Lord has decided your saga ends here, {them}... || Badly."},
    {"naaz", "bentor", 0, "Bentor! You lot keep beating us to the good dig sites. Fine - the Alliance proposes splitting the claims, fair and square."},
    {"naaz", "bentor", 5, "Not this time, Bentor. Last claim we split, the Alliance got the rocks and you got everything worth having."},
    {"bentor", "naaz", 0, "Naaz-Rokha! Our favourite competitors. A joint venture, shares split evenly - well, mostly evenly."},
    {"bentor", "naaz", 7, "Strictly business, {them}. The board voted to dissolve the partnership. The claim is ours now."},
    {"kollecc", "bentor", 0, "Bentor. You dig such lovely things out of the dirt... and then sell them to the wrong people. Sell to us instead."},
    {"bentor", "kollecc", 0, "Kollecc! The only buyers who appreciate a good find. Name your price - and remember who dug it up first."},
    {"zealots", "jolnar", 0, "The Universities play with sacred knowledge like children with fire. Still, the Rhodun will trade - and pray for you."},
    {"zealots", "jolnar", 2, "Your laboratories reek of heresy, Jol-Nar. Accept these terms, or the inquisition visits your worlds."},
    {"zealots", "jolnar", 7, "The trial is over, {them}. Your knowledge was weighed and found blasphemous."},
    {"jolnar", "zealots", 0, "The Rhodun, still burning books? Here is a proposal written in small words, for your convenience."},
    {"jolnar", "zealots", 8, "Predictably irrational, {them}. Faith is a poor substitute for peer review."},
    {"lizho", "yssaril", 0, "Ah, Yssaril. One shadow to another - shall we pretend to trust each other? It's so much more fun."},
    {"lizho", "yssaril", 8, "Oh, well played, {them}! We truly didn't see that one coming. We will be sure to return the favour."},
    {"yssaril", "lizho", 0, "Li-Zho. Smiles in front, knives behind. We know the game - we wrote half of it. A deal, then."},
    {"yssaril", "lizho", 5, "We've heard what happens to the Li-Zho's partners. Mostly from the partners. No."},
    {"hacan", "veldyr", 0, "Veldyr! Executives, the Emirates hear. We were trading before you had a boardroom. Let us show you how it is done."},
    {"hacan", "veldyr", 5, "Your \"partnership\" means we do the work and you buy us out. The Emirates decline."},
    {"veldyr", "hacan", 0, "Hacan! Legacy brand, solid caravans, huge synergy potential. Let's talk partnership - and, later, acquisition."},
    {"veldyr", "hacan", 7, "Nothing personal, {them}. The board approved a hostile takeover of your trade lanes."},
    {"l1z1x", "sol", 0, "Federation of Sol. Your committees, your votes, your elections - all inefficient. The Lazax offer terms. Comply."},
    {"l1z1x", "sol", 2, "Human worlds will be catalogued. Accept these terms and the cataloguing will be gentle."},
    {"sol", "l1z1x", 0, "Mindnet. The Federation doesn't recognise your claim to the Lazax name - but we'll still talk. Carefully."},
    {"sol", "l1z1x", 8, "The Federation was ready for this, {them}. Every fleet, every world. You picked the wrong humans."},
    {"hacan", "xxcha", 1, "Xxcha, old friends! Peace is the best market there is, and nobody keeps it better. A generous deal, for you."},
    {"hacan", "xxcha", 4, "Of course! When the Kingdom proposes, the Emirates know it is fair. Done!"},
    {"xxcha", "hacan", 1, "Hacan... peace and trade grow from... the same root. The Kingdom offers... the gentlest of terms."},
    {"xxcha", "hacan", 8, "We trusted you... as we trust the tide, {them}. The tide... does not do this."},
    {"arborec", "khrask", 1, "Stone that thinks. We have grown around your roots for a long time, Khrask. We offer. ...shhhrrr..."},
    {"arborec", "khrask", 4, "The Green agrees with the stone. It is done."},
    {"khrask", "arborec", 1, "Green ones... you guard... the living worlds. As do we. Take... what you need."},
    {"khrask", "arborec", 8, "Even... the forest... can rot, {them}. We... will remember this... for an age."},
    {"sol", "freesystems", 1, "Free Systems - the Federation's door is always open to free peoples. A fair deal, from one democracy to another."},
    {"sol", "freesystems", 4, "Gladly. Free worlds standing together - the Federation couldn't ask for more."},
    {"freesystems", "sol", 1, "Comrades of Sol! Free peoples must stick together. The Free Systems offer this in solidarity."},
    {"freesystems", "sol", 8, "{them}, we thought Sol stood for freedom. It seems Sol stands for Sol."},
    {"saar", "dihmohn", 1, "Fellow wanderers. The void is wide enough for all of us. Take what helps your flotilla - we ask little in return."},
    {"saar", "dihmohn", 4, "Of course, friends. Travellers should look after each other."},
    {"dihmohn", "saar", 1, "Saar... we have watched your factories drift past our flotilla... always kindly. A gift, then... for the road."},
    {"firmament", "kolume", 1, "Monks of Kolume, the Firmament honours your stillness. We offer this in fellowship - may it bring you peace."},
    {"kolume", "firmament", 1, "The Firmament watches over the many. We watch over ourselves. Perhaps it is the same work. Take this."},
    {"kolume", "firmament", 8, "Even guardians fall, {them}. We will meditate on why you chose to."},
    {"keleres", "kortali", 1, "Keleres to the Tribunal. Always good working with the courts. Clean deal, by the book, over."},
    {"keleres", "kortali", 4, "Copy that, Tribunal. Terms received, terms accepted. Keleres out."},
    {"kortali", "keleres", 1, "The Tribunal recognises the Keleres as officers of order. This offer is entered into the record in good faith."},
    {"kortali", "keleres", 8, "The Tribunal finds {them} guilty of betraying the law itself. Sentence will be carried out."},
    {"naaz", "ralnel", 1, "Ral Nel! You move things, we build things - perfect match. The Alliance's best terms for our favourite haulers."},
    {"naaz", "ralnel", 4, "Deal! Load it up - the Alliance has a machine just waiting for it."},
    {"ralnel", "naaz", 1, "Naaz-Rokha. Reliable. Rare. Good deal, quick terms, no tricks - exit plan not even needed. Almost."},
    {"celdauri", "hacan", 1, "Hacan, our docks are always open to your caravans. A generous deal between honest merchants."},
    {"celdauri", "hacan", 4, "A pleasure, Hacan. Your ships are welcome in our ports any time."},
    {"hacan", "celdauri", 1, "Celdauri! Fine ports, finer merchants. The Emirates offer terms worthy of friends."},
    {"edyn", "xxcha", 1, "Kingdom of Xxcha, the Edyn decree you a friend of the law. Accept this gift as a token of lasting peace."},
    {"xxcha", "edyn", 1, "Edyn... your laws are gentle... and so are ours. Let us... keep the peace together."},
    {"olradin", "freesystems", 1, "Free Systems! The committee voted - unanimously, for once! - to offer you the best deal we have."},
    {"olradin", "freesystems", 4, "All in favour? The People say yes, the Economy says yes, the Environment didn't object. Done!"},
    {"freesystems", "olradin", 1, "Olradin - free peoples deciding things together, just as it should be. Take this deal, comrades."},
    {"nomad", "titans", 1, "Titans. In every future I have seen, the worst one comes while you sleep. Stay awake - I bring help."},
    {"titans", "nomad", 1, "Wanderer... you... have seen... what comes. We... will stand... with you."},
    {"titans", "nomad", 8, "We woke... to protect... every people, {them}. Even... you. No longer."},
    {"kyro", "mykomentori", 1, "Blessed Myko! Your spores and our sacred plague - cousins in the great blooming! A gift for you!"},
    {"mykomentori", "kyro", 1, "The threads say... you and we... feed the same soil, Kyro. Take this... and let it rot well."},
    {"tnelis", "vaden", 0, "The Vaden. The family remembers every interest payment. Here's a deal - and this time, no fine print."},
    {"tnelis", "vaden", 7, "The family has decided your account is closed, {them}. Permanently. Nothing personal."},
    {"vaden", "tnelis", 0, "Syndicate. Your family still owes the clans. We accept this deal as a partial payment - with interest."},
    {"vaden", "tnelis", 8, "The clans will collect, {them}. They always collect. With penalties."},
    {"celdauri", "florzen", 5, "Florzen. We remember what your raiders did to our docks. Our guns remember too. No deal."},
    {"celdauri", "florzen", 2, "Florzen ships, our harbours are armed and our patience is not. Accept these terms or keep your distance."},
    {"florzen", "celdauri", 0, "Celdauri! Lovely ports. Lovely, FULL ports. Pay up and we'll keep them that way!"},
    {"florzen", "celdauri", 7, "Your docks were too full, {them}. We helped ourselves."},
    {"zealots", "rohdhna", 0, "Roh'Dhna. Your machines are an abomination and your manuals blasphemy. And yet the Rhodun will trade. Repent later."},
    {"rohdhna", "zealots", 0, "Doctrine 12-7Z: heresy labels issued by the Rhodun are not legally binding. The Roh'Dhna offers standard terms."},
    {"rohdhna", "zealots", 5, "Article 4-88: no transactions with parties who burn our products. Offer declined."},
    {"sardakk", "xxcha", 0, "Old turtles. Swarm remembers you. You remember swarm. Make deal. Stay remembered."},
    {"xxcha", "sardakk", 5, "Sardakk... the last time... your swarm came to talk... it brought claws. The Kingdom... declines."},
    {"l1z1x", "nekro", 0, "A machine plague that calls itself superior. The Lazax will purge your code. Comply first, and the purge is quick."},
    {"nekro", "l1z1x", 5, "Lazax | Obsolete"},
    {"nekro", "l1z1x", 7, "Mindnet | Absorbed"},
    {"winnu", "mahact", 0, "Mahact. You ruled before the Lazax and you fell. We will rule after them, and we will stay. Take these terms while you can."},
    {"cabal", "lanefir", 0, "Mournful Lanefir... we can make you forget everything you have lost. Everything. Come closer, and take our terms."},
    {"lanefir", "cabal", 5, "We have written the last chapters of too many worlds that trusted hungry voices, Cabal. We will not be the next."},
};
